(528105, 52390, 13749, '<td valign="top">i''m guessing oskar?  if not, i must be really mistaken.. but glad you submitted this one, after your success with the other in the water challenge.  only slightly blown out in the upper right, but still great work.</td>', 'i''m guessing oskar?  if not, i must be really mistaken.. but glad you submitted this one, after your success with the other in the water challenge.  only slightly blown out in the upper right, but still great work.', '2004-01-01 03:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
