(528135, 52770, 7369, '<td valign="top">I reckon this photo will score very high; at least it is my favourite of the week. A most excellent photo with wonderful colours, strong expression and a very interesting POV (10).</td>', 'I reckon this photo will score very high; at least it is my favourite of the week. A most excellent photo with wonderful colours, strong expression and a very interesting POV (10).', '2004-01-01 06:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(528136, 52753, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great scenery and wonderfull clearity. Nice title too.<br/>Have you ever tried to turn it upside down and then crop away the top: gives a very surreal result with everything flying in the clear reflection of the sky.</td>', 'Great scenery and wonderfull clearity. Nice title too.Have you ever tried to turn it upside down and then crop away the top: gives a very surreal result with everything flying in the clear reflection of the sky.', '2004-01-01 06:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(528137, 52662, 1143, '<td valign="top">Mind telling me how long your exposure was? We saw some beautiful red and green lights the other night, but I didn''t have my camera. We''re trying again tonight if it''s clear. Very strong color in this one. Focus on the bottom is a bit soft for stationary objects.. any idea what caused that?</td>', 'Mind telling me how long your exposure was? We saw some beautiful red and green lights the other night, but I didn''t have my camera. We''re trying again tonight if it''s clear. Very strong color in this one. Focus on the bottom is a bit soft for stationary objects.. any idea what caused that?', '2004-01-01 06:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(528147, 52663, 12802, '<td valign="top">A good shot here, great DOF.  Think it may be slammed though because of the subject.<br/> <br/>The details here are really good, the water droplets at the top of the breast, the different skin tones.  <br/> <br/>Only gripe would be the white glare on the left hand side of the breast.  Maybe using a burn tool to make this a little darker.  9/10</td>', 'A good shot here, great DOF.  Think it may be slammed though because of the subject. The details here are really good, the water droplets at the top of the breast, the different skin tones.   Only gripe would be the white glare on the left hand side of the breast.  Maybe using a burn tool to make this a little darker.  9/10', '2004-01-01 07:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(528148, 52555, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really cute shot here, the beautiful bright blue eyes really add that something extra to the shot. 8/10</td>', 'Really cute shot here, the beautiful bright blue eyes really add that something extra to the shot. 8/10', '2004-01-01 07:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(528155, 51427, 6740, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for landscape shots....good luck in the voting.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for landscape shots....good luck in the voting.', '2004-01-01 07:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(528157, 52707, 6740, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. At first glance, I thought the tigers had bagged a deer for dinner.</td>', 'Nice photo. At first glance, I thought the tigers had bagged a deer for dinner.', '2004-01-01 07:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(528158, 53054, 6740, '<td valign="top">Has the potential to do well in the voting. It has feeling. Thanks for submitting it.</td>', 'Has the potential to do well in the voting. It has feeling. Thanks for submitting it.', '2004-01-01 07:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(528162, 53009, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-01-01 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
