(528195, 53093, 8159, '<td valign="top">Like this shot a lot. The reflection from the softbox in her glasses is a bit distracting. If it had been more vertical, it might have looked like a window. I would have been tempted to play with the reflection a bit in Photoshop. Anyway, nicely done.</td>', 'Like this shot a lot. The reflection from the softbox in her glasses is a bit distracting. If it had been more vertical, it might have looked like a window. I would have been tempted to play with the reflection a bit in Photoshop. Anyway, nicely done.', '2004-01-01 09:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
