(528444, 52311, 9448, '<td valign="top">I recognise this -- its a parody of a shot by John Freeman in a book he reacently wrote. You should have taken more care lining up the glasses and kept them away from the edge of the table. You even seem to have copied the black card on either side of the glasses. No originality unfortunately, and only a moderate reproduction.<br/> <br/>Sharp, nice colors (Like the original) and not too much noise. Had I not seen it before and apart from the lack of care lining up the glasses you would have got 7 or 8. I do however hate copies so sorry but 5.<br/> <br/>My appologies if you had not seen mr. Freemans picture.<br/> <br/>Edit: --<br/>in retrospect it has occurred to me that many people do well on the site with parody photographs.  Therefore my initial opinion was a little bit harsh, and I have changed your vote to a six.<br/> <br/>I have also check again on the original that I saw, and it had a white background so I do quite like your blue background as it complements the glasses quite well.  The top of your front most glasses also has a slightly uneven edge at the top of it, and this does draw your eye towards it -- which is a little bit distracting.<br/> <br/>In order to line the classes up better I would recommend using two rulers on the bases of the glasses so that you can guarantee that they are straight.<br/>Overall a very good picture.</td>', 'I recognise this -- its a parody of a shot by John Freeman in a book he reacently wrote. You should have taken more care lining up the glasses and kept them away from the edge of the table. You even seem to have copied the black card on either side of the glasses. No originality unfortunately, and only a moderate reproduction. Sharp, nice colors (Like the original) and not too much noise. Had I not seen it before and apart from the lack of care lining up the glasses you would have got 7 or 8. I do however hate copies so sorry but 5. My appologies if you had not seen mr. Freemans picture. Edit: --in retrospect it has occurred to me that many people do well on the site with parody photographs.  Therefore my initial opinion was a little bit harsh, and I have changed your vote to a six. I have also check again on the original that I saw, and it had a white background so I do quite like your blue background as it complements the glasses quite well.  The top of your front most glasses also has a slightly uneven edge at the top of it, and this does draw your eye towards it -- which is a little bit distracting. In order to line the classes up better I would recommend using two rulers on the bases of the glasses so that you can guarantee that they are straight.Overall a very good picture.', '2004-01-01 12:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(528446, 52835, 15570, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It is well done</td>', 'I like this photo. It is well done', '2004-01-01 12:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(528456, 52793, 509, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  One of my favorites so far.  I can''t think of a thing I would change.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  One of my favorites so far.  I can''t think of a thing I would change.', '2004-01-01 12:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(528459, 53066, 3459, '<td valign="top">A little too much bluring.</td>', 'A little too much bluring.', '2004-01-01 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(528461, 52835, 509, '<td valign="top">The colors and subject in particular are great in this shot.  I think the green light in the lighthouse adds an interesting touch. -10-</td>', 'The colors and subject in particular are great in this shot.  I think the green light in the lighthouse adds an interesting touch. -10-', '2004-01-01 12:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(528465, 53029, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark, I''d like to see more detail in the feathers.  Also, it appears as though fill flash was used, but it is a little strong (reflections on around the bird''s head).</td>', 'This is a little dark, I''d like to see more detail in the feathers.  Also, it appears as though fill flash was used, but it is a little strong (reflections on around the bird''s head).', '2004-01-01 12:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(528467, 49486, 12962, '<td valign="top">Colors are great and make an eerie picture of Chicago''s beautiful skyline!  I am biased because this is taken from my favorite place to bring guests to (at or near the Adler Planetarium) and my office building is clearly seen in the picture (3rd building from left with the TORCO sign).   (It''s funny that there is another entry in the challenge from the same view point but taken at night!)  Good job!!!</td>', 'Colors are great and make an eerie picture of Chicago''s beautiful skyline!  I am biased because this is taken from my favorite place to bring guests to (at or near the Adler Planetarium) and my office building is clearly seen in the picture (3rd building from left with the TORCO sign).   (It''s funny that there is another entry in the challenge from the same view point but taken at night!)  Good job!!!', '2004-01-01 12:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(528469, 50424, 2649, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  It may be my monitor, but the snow looks a little pink.  I wonder if this is intentional, or was it just the natural light?</td>', 'Excellent photo.  It may be my monitor, but the snow looks a little pink.  I wonder if this is intentional, or was it just the natural light?', '2004-01-01 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(528471, 52391, 8367, '<td valign="top">The ice makes this look like an antique or vintage photo. Good capture. I think this would also look good if you cropped it into a  landscape format.</td>', 'The ice makes this look like an antique or vintage photo. Good capture. I think this would also look good if you cropped it into a  landscape format.', '2004-01-01 12:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(528475, 52311, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very clever - an intriguing image</td>', 'Very clever - an intriguing image', '2004-01-01 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(528477, 50767, 8643, '<td valign="top">Love it - very classy stop motion.</td>', 'Love it - very classy stop motion.', '2004-01-01 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(528478, 52075, 8643, '<td valign="top">Makes a very interesting abstract</td>', 'Makes a very interesting abstract', '2004-01-01 12:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(528479, 52276, 2649, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I would have eliminated the white spots on the right.   The ones in the water might be birds, but the one in the tree looks un-natural.  Still, an<br/>excellent shot.</td>', 'Good composition.  I would have eliminated the white spots on the right.   The ones in the water might be birds, but the one in the tree looks un-natural.  Still, anexcellent shot.', '2004-01-01 12:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(528481, 49898, 8643, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, love the high contrast and gentle background.  You must have taken advantage of the new rules....</td>', 'Lovely portrait, love the high contrast and gentle background.  You must have taken advantage of the new rules....', '2004-01-01 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(528482, 53070, 8643, '<td valign="top">Maybe I would have put the tree more off centre but a great idea.</td>', 'Maybe I would have put the tree more off centre but a great idea.', '2004-01-01 12:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(528487, 53066, 8643, '<td valign="top">Maybe NeatImage a tad overdone but it produces a very effective portrait - would that skin really looked like that!  I like it!!!</td>', 'Maybe NeatImage a tad overdone but it produces a very effective portrait - would that skin really looked like that!  I like it!!!', '2004-01-01 12:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(528488, 51950, 8643, '<td valign="top">A lovely study leading to peace and quiet!</td>', 'A lovely study leading to peace and quiet!', '2004-01-01 12:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(528489, 52577, 8643, '<td valign="top">A beautiful study - lovley soft capture with pin sharp centre of attention.<br/>?Canon 50mm f1.8??</td>', 'A beautiful study - lovley soft capture with pin sharp centre of attention.?Canon 50mm f1.8??', '2004-01-01 12:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(528505, 53044, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image! I love the way the coloring just does its own thing in the water and how its behavior is so unpredictable. One thing I would have changed is the bowl/vessel. Either show more of it or none at all. I know it''s difficult since it''s glass and that''s a pain to photograph on its own. In the picture''s current state, it makes me look at parts of the image like the lower left and wonder how the blue dye is just floating there. Overall, great shot!</td>', 'This is an excellent image! I love the way the coloring just does its own thing in the water and how its behavior is so unpredictable. One thing I would have changed is the bowl/vessel. Either show more of it or none at all. I know it''s difficult since it''s glass and that''s a pain to photograph on its own. In the picture''s current state, it makes me look at parts of the image like the lower left and wonder how the blue dye is just floating there. Overall, great shot!', '2004-01-01 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(528506, 52953, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot and the look of determination on the surfer is great. I might have cropped the bottom a bit closer, however, so the bottom edge would be just below the lowest portion of white spray under the surfboard. Great focus and composition!</td>', 'Nice action shot and the look of determination on the surfer is great. I might have cropped the bottom a bit closer, however, so the bottom edge would be just below the lowest portion of white spray under the surfboard. Great focus and composition!', '2004-01-01 13:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(528511, 52525, 8054, '<td valign="top">That''s one of the better duotone shots I''ve seen. Very sharp focus and subject matter is good, as well. The fur (?) coat shows lots of detail. Nice job! 10!</td>', 'That''s one of the better duotone shots I''ve seen. Very sharp focus and subject matter is good, as well. The fur (?) coat shows lots of detail. Nice job! 10!', '2004-01-01 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(528531, 52663, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. It really makes you focus on the subject. Details of the skin and water are excellent! Great shot!</td>', 'Great use of negative space. It really makes you focus on the subject. Details of the skin and water are excellent! Great shot!', '2004-01-01 13:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
