(528625, 53093, 255, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot! ;)<br/> <br/>everything rocks about it--lighting, toning, composition--but one of my fav parts has to be what i assume to be the reflection of the softbox in her glasses--but if you didn''t know what it was, you would just think the diamonds added more glamour to her. now, the only thing that is missing is a funky studded bracelet! ;)<br/>you rock. 10.</td>', 'gorgeous shot! ;) everything rocks about it--lighting, toning, composition--but one of my fav parts has to be what i assume to be the reflection of the softbox in her glasses--but if you didn''t know what it was, you would just think the diamonds added more glamour to her. now, the only thing that is missing is a funky studded bracelet! ;)you rock. 10.', '2004-01-01 14:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
