(528637, 52353, 4493, '<td valign="top">Truely a spectacular shot! This is one of the best sunset shots I''ve seen. Nice composition and use of your environment. 10 -danny</td>', 'Truely a spectacular shot! This is one of the best sunset shots I''ve seen. Nice composition and use of your environment. 10 -danny', '2004-01-01 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(528640, 51867, 4493, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the simple world in front of us produces images of great beauty. I''m sure many have walked past plants with the same formations of ice on them, but they probably have never seen the simple beauty you show here. I love your b/w conversions and  crisp focus on the ice. Excellent shot! 10 -danny</td>', 'Sometimes the simple world in front of us produces images of great beauty. I''m sure many have walked past plants with the same formations of ice on them, but they probably have never seen the simple beauty you show here. I love your b/w conversions and  crisp focus on the ice. Excellent shot! 10 -danny', '2004-01-01 14:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(528641, 53009, 4493, '<td valign="top">Spectacular use of natural light. Wonderful image. 10 -danny</td>', 'Spectacular use of natural light. Wonderful image. 10 -danny', '2004-01-01 14:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(528642, 51910, 4493, '<td valign="top">Love these old forks. Great light, composition and detail throughout. A slight reflective board bouncing some light back to the front would, in my opinion, made this a top shot! 9 -danny</td>', 'Love these old forks. Great light, composition and detail throughout. A slight reflective board bouncing some light back to the front would, in my opinion, made this a top shot! 9 -danny', '2004-01-01 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
