(528960, 51950, 6667, '<td valign="top">I like this shot  a lot.  I will, however, make two comments:  First, cropping out the tree line would have eliminated a distraction.  The fence line in and of itself is an interesting subject. Next I would have liked to  seen a richer sharper contrast between the fence and the snow. Best of luck</td>', 'I like this shot  a lot.  I will, however, make two comments:  First, cropping out the tree line would have eliminated a distraction.  The fence line in and of itself is an interesting subject. Next I would have liked to  seen a richer sharper contrast between the fence and the snow. Best of luck', '2004-01-01 19:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(528962, 53108, 714, '<td valign="top">That road in the forground ruins the shot.  Rats.  Otherwise very nice.  Perfect lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'That road in the forground ruins the shot.  Rats.  Otherwise very nice.  Perfect lighting.  Good luck.', '2004-01-01 19:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
