(528980, 53062, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been more interestingly done... having part of the cross cut off is somewhat annoying... and I''m not big on the shadows left by the flash or the harsh lighting you used.</td>', 'I think this could have been more interestingly done... having part of the cross cut off is somewhat annoying... and I''m not big on the shadows left by the flash or the harsh lighting you used.', '2004-01-01 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
