(529003, 51959, 6667, '<td valign="top">Interresting, to say the least.   I fnd the subject both humorous and disturbing at the same time.  Because it does that, I like it a lot. You got my attention and a high rating from me. But two things hold it from an even higher rating: that is off center with half the mom.  And why not color?!</td>', 'Interresting, to say the least.   I fnd the subject both humorous and disturbing at the same time.  Because it does that, I like it a lot. You got my attention and a high rating from me. But two things hold it from an even higher rating: that is off center with half the mom.  And why not color?!', '2004-01-01 19:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
