(529302, 52937, 11457, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2004-01-02 05:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(529303, 52668, 11457, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes. I would have liked better an off-center composition, and the ability to see the whole spiraling barbwire.</td>', 'Interesting shapes. I would have liked better an off-center composition, and the ability to see the whole spiraling barbwire.', '2004-01-02 05:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(529304, 52614, 11457, '<td valign="top">Slightly underexposed.  The strong shadows detract as well.</td>', 'Slightly underexposed.  The strong shadows detract as well.', '2004-01-02 05:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(529305, 53051, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the only thing I noticed were that the colors seemed a little too unrealistic, possibly over saturated. Good focus, lighting ( I like the angle), and composition.</td>', 'Nice shot, the only thing I noticed were that the colors seemed a little too unrealistic, possibly over saturated. Good focus, lighting ( I like the angle), and composition.', '2004-01-02 05:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(529306, 52483, 11457, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I''m not sure about cutting the head of the office. He could have been separated from the child, visually, by using a narrow depth of field. Great lighting.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I''m not sure about cutting the head of the office. He could have been separated from the child, visually, by using a narrow depth of field. Great lighting.', '2004-01-02 05:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(529307, 52610, 9668, '<td valign="top">The bottom part of the picture is great. But I think the blue shade could be more set to a white balence. Maybe you wanted it like that to counter balence the white. good overall though, nice view!</td>', 'The bottom part of the picture is great. But I think the blue shade could be more set to a white balence. Maybe you wanted it like that to counter balence the white. good overall though, nice view!', '2004-01-02 05:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(529308, 53069, 11457, '<td valign="top">Slightly tilted to the left. Very nice otherwise!</td>', 'Slightly tilted to the left. Very nice otherwise!', '2004-01-02 05:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(529312, 52353, 11457, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, perspective, reflections, colors.... wow.</td>', 'Beautiful sky, perspective, reflections, colors.... wow.', '2004-01-02 05:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(529330, 52753, 15407, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflection! &amp; nore than good eye!  Congratulatios!  I may be outta my league here but I will rise to the challenge!<br/>Tim</td>', 'Excellent reflection! & nore than good eye!  Congratulatios!  I may be outta my league here but I will rise to the challenge!Tim', '2004-01-02 05:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(529371, 52489, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.</td>', 'I like this a lot.', '2004-01-02 07:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(529373, 52803, 9232, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  Love the texture and smooth outlines.<br/>I can''t wait to see your exposure settings for this shot.  Only nit would be the two areas in upper left and left edge with no color.</td>', 'Very artistic.  Love the texture and smooth outlines.I can''t wait to see your exposure settings for this shot.  Only nit would be the two areas in upper left and left edge with no color.', '2004-01-02 07:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(529375, 53102, 9232, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly underexposed both on the skins and in the darkened shadows.  Perhaps a tripod, smaller aperture and longer exposure would have yielded more vibrant colors by comparison.  The current exposure tends to cause blown out areas.  The background on lefthand side is dotted and distracting.</td>', 'Seems slightly underexposed both on the skins and in the darkened shadows.  Perhaps a tripod, smaller aperture and longer exposure would have yielded more vibrant colors by comparison.  The current exposure tends to cause blown out areas.  The background on lefthand side is dotted and distracting.', '2004-01-02 07:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(529378, 52707, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great action capture but the brambles in the left FG are mildly distracting.  Must have been exciting to see them playing in the snow.  Good job stopping the action with the snow aloft and the paw batting at the ground.</td>', 'Great action capture but the brambles in the left FG are mildly distracting.  Must have been exciting to see them playing in the snow.  Good job stopping the action with the snow aloft and the paw batting at the ground.', '2004-01-02 07:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(529382, 52545, 9941, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot - beatuiful DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful shot - beatuiful DOF.', '2004-01-02 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(529383, 52122, 9941, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one cool photograph!  Perfect DOF, interesting tones.</td>', 'Wow, this is one cool photograph!  Perfect DOF, interesting tones.', '2004-01-02 08:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(529384, 51478, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice, seems just a touch "soft" to me, and is a bit busy for my tastes.</td>', 'Nice, seems just a touch "soft" to me, and is a bit busy for my tastes.', '2004-01-02 08:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(529385, 52303, 9941, '<td valign="top">The gull alone doesn''t do much for me, but the circles in the water makes the photo work.  Gave you a 7.</td>', 'The gull alone doesn''t do much for me, but the circles in the water makes the photo work.  Gave you a 7.', '2004-01-02 08:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(529386, 53071, 9941, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  The lighting is very nice.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  The lighting is very nice.', '2004-01-02 08:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(529387, 53078, 9941, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, nice DOF for such a tight shot.</td>', 'Interesting composition, nice DOF for such a tight shot.', '2004-01-02 08:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(529422, 52616, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great colours and DoF, 10</td>', 'Great colours and DoF, 10', '2004-01-02 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(529423, 52489, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the out of focus-ness doesnt matter, it''s a super shot. 10</td>', 'I really like this, the out of focus-ness doesnt matter, it''s a super shot. 10', '2004-01-02 09:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(529440, 51950, 14620, '<td valign="top">Good for you, braving the snow to take such a beautiful picture.  It looks like this was taken at night due to the background but it is so light.  It''s a wonderful photo!</td>', 'Good for you, braving the snow to take such a beautiful picture.  It looks like this was taken at night due to the background but it is so light.  It''s a wonderful photo!', '2004-01-02 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(529441, 53009, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is such a sweet photo and great lighting!</td>', 'This is such a sweet photo and great lighting!', '2004-01-02 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(529446, 52545, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  A wonderful, majestic subject that you captured with such regalness (is that a word?) :-)  Anyways, I love the lighting, the textures and the colors.  Owls are great animals to watch!</td>', 'This is beautiful!  A wonderful, majestic subject that you captured with such regalness (is that a word?) :-)  Anyways, I love the lighting, the textures and the colors.  Owls are great animals to watch!', '2004-01-02 10:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(529452, 53060, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, very good clarity and colors - nothing in the shot really captures my attention though = 6</td>', 'Nice composition, very good clarity and colors - nothing in the shot really captures my attention though = 6', '2004-01-02 10:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(529454, 52359, 2302, '<td valign="top">I love the leading line of the shore to the structure in the back. The colors here seem a bit muted - but it works for me. =</td>', 'I love the leading line of the shore to the structure in the back. The colors here seem a bit muted - but it works for me. =', '2004-01-02 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(529457, 51775, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and colors!  I like the idea but I think I would''ve liked to see more of the building.  Not sure why, but it seems oddly cropped.  Good picture!</td>', 'Great clarity and colors!  I like the idea but I think I would''ve liked to see more of the building.  Not sure why, but it seems oddly cropped.  Good picture!', '2004-01-02 10:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(529463, 53074, 2302, '<td valign="top">Very Nice - good lighting and detail on the leaf and on the texture of the snow.  I like the DOF on this shot. = 8</td>', 'Very Nice - good lighting and detail on the leaf and on the texture of the snow.  I like the DOF on this shot. = 8', '2004-01-02 10:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(529465, 52607, 6668, '<td valign="top">photo seems very grainy.</td>', 'photo seems very grainy.', '2004-01-02 10:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(529467, 53013, 2302, '<td valign="top">The background distracts from the shot.  You''ve got a nice photo for a personal album here - but as a portrait shot it doesn''t make me care about the person it shows.  =4</td>', 'The background distracts from the shot.  You''ve got a nice photo for a personal album here - but as a portrait shot it doesn''t make me care about the person it shows.  =4', '2004-01-02 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(529468, 49322, 2302, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the body and not the head seems a bit strange. Pretty good detail in the wood and wrinkles on the lizard though = 4</td>', 'The lighting on the body and not the head seems a bit strange. Pretty good detail in the wood and wrinkles on the lizard though = 4', '2004-01-02 10:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(529469, 53069, 2302, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for silos - nice composition and good capture of the sky = 6</td>', 'I''m a sucker for silos - nice composition and good capture of the sky = 6', '2004-01-02 10:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(529470, 53092, 2302, '<td valign="top">Good for the family album but as a portrait shot it doesn''t inpire me to care about the subject. Good DOF throwing the background into a soft focus. Composition seems a bit like the little guy is about to go out the left edge = 3</td>', 'Good for the family album but as a portrait shot it doesn''t inpire me to care about the subject. Good DOF throwing the background into a soft focus. Composition seems a bit like the little guy is about to go out the left edge = 3', '2004-01-02 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(529471, 52645, 2302, '<td valign="top">The colors here don''t seem natural to me and throw off the shot (imho) I love the coposition though = 5</td>', 'The colors here don''t seem natural to me and throw off the shot (imho) I love the coposition though = 5', '2004-01-02 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(529474, 51972, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed. I like the lightly soft focus and lighting. = 5</td>', 'Nicely framed. I like the lightly soft focus and lighting. = 5', '2004-01-02 10:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(529475, 51409, 2302, '<td valign="top">Looks spooky but the composition seems overpowered by the brush and weeds. I get the feeling of how overgrown it is - but it takes over the shot for me and doesn''t hold my interest. = 5</td>', 'Looks spooky but the composition seems overpowered by the brush and weeds. I get the feeling of how overgrown it is - but it takes over the shot for me and doesn''t hold my interest. = 5', '2004-01-02 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(529480, 52411, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. There doesn''t seem to be a good spot of focus though. The corn and cow are both kind of soft for my taste. It is hard to get interesting landscapes when everything is so brown at this time of year - but this is pretty good. = 5</td>', 'Nice composition. There doesn''t seem to be a good spot of focus though. The corn and cow are both kind of soft for my taste. It is hard to get interesting landscapes when everything is so brown at this time of year - but this is pretty good. = 5', '2004-01-02 10:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(529482, 52442, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice sky here. The lights in the city seem just a bit blown out though.  I am not sure about the inclusion of the person in the foreground. I don''t think it adds anything to the shot and makes me wonder where I should be looking. = 5</td>', 'Nice sky here. The lights in the city seem just a bit blown out though.  I am not sure about the inclusion of the person in the foreground. I don''t think it adds anything to the shot and makes me wonder where I should be looking. = 5', '2004-01-02 10:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(529484, 52952, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the flames and ash - I can almost feel the heat. As a photograph though the composition and subject doesn''t capture or hold my attention. = 4</td>', 'Nice capture of the flames and ash - I can almost feel the heat. As a photograph though the composition and subject doesn''t capture or hold my attention. = 4', '2004-01-02 10:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(529485, 51560, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this has been a bit too over-sharpened during editing, as all the edges look jaggy.</td>', 'I think this has been a bit too over-sharpened during editing, as all the edges look jaggy.', '2004-01-02 10:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(529487, 52998, 2302, '<td valign="top">wow - excellent colors here!  I like the DOF and composition very much. = 8</td>', 'wow - excellent colors here!  I like the DOF and composition very much. = 8', '2004-01-02 10:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(529490, 53066, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting for the shot.  The skin looks a bit unnatural to me as though there was some retouching done.  The extra space at the top doesn''t add to the photo - you may want to try a tighter crop.  overall a good shot - it makes me want to know more about the person in it which is what a good portrait should do. = 7</td>', 'Nice lighting for the shot.  The skin looks a bit unnatural to me as though there was some retouching done.  The extra space at the top doesn''t add to the photo - you may want to try a tighter crop.  overall a good shot - it makes me want to know more about the person in it which is what a good portrait should do. = 7', '2004-01-02 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(529492, 52227, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, lighting and composition. Subject doesn''t do much to capture my attention but would look nice on a OJ ad = 6</td>', 'Nice DOF, lighting and composition. Subject doesn''t do much to capture my attention but would look nice on a OJ ad = 6', '2004-01-02 11:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(529517, 52523, 10887, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty! Well done!</td>', 'This is very pretty! Well done!', '2004-01-02 11:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(529519, 53066, 3032, '<td valign="top">A bit unnaturally smooth skintone gradations, too plasticky/painted. I''d work on that. The technique I know is a bit too much to explain. :(<br/>Pose and lighting are good, you could dodge the eyes a bit.<br/> <br/>7<br/></td>', 'A bit unnaturally smooth skintone gradations, too plasticky/painted. I''d work on that. The technique I know is a bit too much to explain. :(Pose and lighting are good, you could dodge the eyes a bit. 7', '2004-01-02 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(529525, 52667, 11897, '<td valign="top">I love the photo, but the moving people tend to detract from it.<br/>Great shot though,<br/>Paul.</td>', 'I love the photo, but the moving people tend to detract from it.Great shot though,Paul.', '2004-01-02 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
