INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(529564, 51560, 11897, '<td valign="top">super colour,</td>', 'super colour,', '2004-01-02 12:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(529565, 50767, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2004-01-02 12:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(529566, 52213, 11897, '<td valign="top">Lovely, well framed.</td>', 'Lovely, well framed.', '2004-01-02 12:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(529567, 49310, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, worked well.</td>', 'Nice idea, worked well.', '2004-01-02 12:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(529569, 52793, 11897, '<td valign="top">love the mood, nicely done.</td>', 'love the mood, nicely done.', '2004-01-02 12:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(529570, 53065, 11897, '<td valign="top">Pin sharp, great shot.</td>', 'Pin sharp, great shot.', '2004-01-02 12:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(529571, 49435, 11897, '<td valign="top">too much of a snapshot for me.</td>', 'too much of a snapshot for me.', '2004-01-02 12:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(529572, 50518, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting structure shot in front of beautiful sky.  I love the angle at which this was shot.  I would have cloned out that white speck showing on the right part of the structure.  The far part of the structure seems to be slightly out of focus.  Good work.  Tilting the shot a little bit more to the left might have made things even better.</td>', 'Interesting structure shot in front of beautiful sky.  I love the angle at which this was shot.  I would have cloned out that white speck showing on the right part of the structure.  The far part of the structure seems to be slightly out of focus.  Good work.  Tilting the shot a little bit more to the left might have made things even better.', '2004-01-02 12:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(529575, 52834, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is a tad too dark.  Too bad you couldn''t have waited a bit to get more light.  I would have shot this form farther away and kept the tree to the right, but would have included all the branches that were cropped out.  You may have been dealing with obstacles to the shot that didn''t permit a wider shot.</td>', 'This is a tad too dark.  Too bad you couldn''t have waited a bit to get more light.  I would have shot this form farther away and kept the tree to the right, but would have included all the branches that were cropped out.  You may have been dealing with obstacles to the shot that didn''t permit a wider shot.', '2004-01-02 12:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(529579, 52895, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great shot 10</td>', 'Great shot 10', '2004-01-02 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(529583, 53066, 9504, '<td valign="top">Stunning portrait.</td>', 'Stunning portrait.', '2004-01-02 12:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(529584, 53042, 9504, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous!!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous!!', '2004-01-02 12:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(529585, 51410, 11738, '<td valign="top">The sky colour in this shot is very good, but I just can''t get my head around how WHITE that snow is.  My brain is telling me that there should be a slight blue tint there.  Was there a street light shining in from the upper right of the shot?  Good composition.  Too bad that the moon/sun is washing out that branch.</td>', 'The sky colour in this shot is very good, but I just can''t get my head around how WHITE that snow is.  My brain is telling me that there should be a slight blue tint there.  Was there a street light shining in from the upper right of the shot?  Good composition.  Too bad that the moon/sun is washing out that branch.', '2004-01-02 12:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(529587, 51950, 11738, '<td valign="top">This may sound stupid, but I think this shot could have been even better if the snow in the black sky would have been partially or totally cloned out.  I find it adds an element of "messiness" that takes away from this well composed shot.  Maybe a shot of the fence and snow only without the sky?</td>', 'This may sound stupid, but I think this shot could have been even better if the snow in the black sky would have been partially or totally cloned out.  I find it adds an element of "messiness" that takes away from this well composed shot.  Maybe a shot of the fence and snow only without the sky?', '2004-01-02 12:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(529588, 52589, 9504, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful kitty...though the nose looks a little red..  The yellow eyes are stunning.</td>', 'What a beautiful kitty...though the nose looks a little red..  The yellow eyes are stunning.', '2004-01-02 12:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(529589, 52829, 11738, '<td valign="top">The strong perpendicular and parrallel lines of this shot are too distracting.  There are lots of neat things in this shot, but try to stay away from 90 degree angles in shots like these to make them feel more natural.</td>', 'The strong perpendicular and parrallel lines of this shot are too distracting.  There are lots of neat things in this shot, but try to stay away from 90 degree angles in shots like these to make them feel more natural.', '2004-01-02 12:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(529590, 52122, 2752, '<td valign="top">Wow  this is great..great capture of everything from feathers to background. Is this a Harpee eagle?(10)</td>', 'Wow  this is great..great capture of everything from feathers to background. Is this a Harpee eagle?(10)', '2004-01-02 12:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(529592, 51406, 11738, '<td valign="top">That outter red frame takes away from the interesting shot.  Back-red-black might have been better here.</td>', 'That outter red frame takes away from the interesting shot.  Back-red-black might have been better here.', '2004-01-02 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(529594, 49898, 11738, '<td valign="top">There''s a pretty baby!  Love the B&amp;W treatment.  The skin tone is perfect.  The only recommendation is to modify lighting to get rid of head and ear shadws cast on neck and backdrop.</td>', 'There''s a pretty baby!  Love the B&W treatment.  The skin tone is perfect.  The only recommendation is to modify lighting to get rid of head and ear shadws cast on neck and backdrop.', '2004-01-02 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(529597, 53051, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a sunflower, but oversharpened.  Shot composition is ok, but could have been better.  I love sunflowers!  They make awesome floral subjects because of the colours and size.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Nice shot of a sunflower, but oversharpened.  Shot composition is ok, but could have been better.  I love sunflowers!  They make awesome floral subjects because of the colours and size.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-01-02 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(529600, 53070, 11738, '<td valign="top">That is one cool looking tree.  I love subjects like that.  Too bad the main subject is so centered.  The "rule of thirds" would work wonders here.  I would suggest a re-crop or re-shoot if possible.</td>', 'That is one cool looking tree.  I love subjects like that.  Too bad the main subject is so centered.  The "rule of thirds" would work wonders here.  I would suggest a re-crop or re-shoot if possible.', '2004-01-02 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(529602, 52135, 11738, '<td valign="top">I know it''s a goose or swan and that it''s probably preening, but this looks so bizarre, I think because of the crop.  I would love to see more of the bird to make more sense of this shot.   Lighting is also quite dark on the front of the wing.</td>', 'I know it''s a goose or swan and that it''s probably preening, but this looks so bizarre, I think because of the crop.  I would love to see more of the bird to make more sense of this shot.   Lighting is also quite dark on the front of the wing.', '2004-01-02 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(529609, 52311, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Perfectly centered.  This looks like Spanish Grease''s work.  Saw the exact same thing by another photographer on Photosig.com two days ago, but not holding that against you.  Nice colour.  Too bad about the edge of the glass pane at the bottom of the shot.  I realize that you couldn''t crop it out because it would have been too tight at the bottom.  The far edge of the glass pane could have been cloned out to give a more seamless look and could have taken care of that smudge on the front glass.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Perfectly centered.  This looks like Spanish Grease''s work.  Saw the exact same thing by another photographer on Photosig.com two days ago, but not holding that against you.  Nice colour.  Too bad about the edge of the glass pane at the bottom of the shot.  I realize that you couldn''t crop it out because it would have been too tight at the bottom.  The far edge of the glass pane could have been cloned out to give a more seamless look and could have taken care of that smudge on the front glass.', '2004-01-02 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
