(529987, 52424, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subjects.  Good tones.  I fin the crop a bit too tight, looks like the berries needs to breath a little.  Still an effective shot.  Jacko.</td>', 'Very interesting subjects.  Good tones.  I fin the crop a bit too tight, looks like the berries needs to breath a little.  Still an effective shot.  Jacko.', '2004-01-02 19:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
