(529989, 52563, 2716, '<td valign="top">The sparkle is a very nice touch and I like the bright color of the back ground.   How would it look if you removed a good portion of the left side of the shot so the drop would be in the lower left corner; might be more balanced.  Good job.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'The sparkle is a very nice touch and I like the bright color of the back ground.   How would it look if you removed a good portion of the left side of the shot so the drop would be in the lower left corner; might be more balanced.  Good job.  Jacko.  9', '2004-01-02 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(529991, 53051, 2716, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower.  Its color goes well with the sky..  How about cloning out the big leaf on the left top corner, or backing up so the whole  leaf would be in the shot (don''t like the leaf being cut).  Still an effective shot.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Lovely flower.  Its color goes well with the sky..  How about cloning out the big leaf on the left top corner, or backing up so the whole  leaf would be in the shot (don''t like the leaf being cut).  Still an effective shot.  Jacko.  8', '2004-01-02 19:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(529993, 52353, 2716, '<td valign="top">Groovy feel to this photo.  Looks like a long exposure ... I love the soft feel of the water.</td>', 'Groovy feel to this photo.  Looks like a long exposure ... I love the soft feel of the water.', '2004-01-02 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(530008, 52770, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very very cool shot.  Love the warm colors and the man in the middle just jumps out .  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Very very cool shot.  Love the warm colors and the man in the middle just jumps out .  Jacko.  10', '2004-01-02 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(530010, 52663, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love how the light illuminates the breast then fades into blackness afterwards.  Nice edit.  Too bad about the glare though.  You can see that you are losing skin detail as you go up towards the armpit.  You may want to use softer light if you shoot stuff like this again.  Hope your model wasn''t too cold during the shoot :P</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love how the light illuminates the breast then fades into blackness afterwards.  Nice edit.  Too bad about the glare though.  You can see that you are losing skin detail as you go up towards the armpit.  You may want to use softer light if you shoot stuff like this again.  Hope your model wasn''t too cold during the shoot :P', '2004-01-02 19:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(530013, 52563, 11738, '<td valign="top">There seems to be clone stamp dots all over this image.  Excellent choice of subject and good crop.</td>', 'There seems to be clone stamp dots all over this image.  Excellent choice of subject and good crop.', '2004-01-02 19:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
