(530843, 52391, 2649, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The soft focus is great.  I would probably crop out about 1/2 of the sky.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The soft focus is great.  I would probably crop out about 1/2 of the sky.  Good job.', '2004-01-03 17:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(530844, 52634, 14614, '<td valign="top">Caught the moment - great accent to the shot.</td>', 'Caught the moment - great accent to the shot.', '2004-01-03 17:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(530845, 49898, 2649, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Composition &amp; focus are outstanding.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Composition & focus are outstanding.', '2004-01-03 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(530848, 52793, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I found the light a bit too distracting given the soft feel of the rest of the image.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I found the light a bit too distracting given the soft feel of the rest of the image.', '2004-01-03 17:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530849, 52483, 4007, '<td valign="top">It an interesting idea, but this photo seems to have been sapped of all the potential emotion that is present.  To some extent I think we fill in the gaps naturally, assuming the awe of the boy and the tender smile of the officer, but you''ve cut that all out of the shot.  The boy is completley passive in this shot, and the officer''s hand carries a little bit of expression, but other than that the figures in this shot are cold and unemotional, which certainly couldn''t have been the intention.  I think including the officer''s face isn''t necessary, since having it cut off adds to the feeling that he is larger than life in the eyes of the child,  but perhaps a side angle that showed the kids face or at least some pose with more expression to it would make this a much better shot.</td>', 'It an interesting idea, but this photo seems to have been sapped of all the potential emotion that is present.  To some extent I think we fill in the gaps naturally, assuming the awe of the boy and the tender smile of the officer, but you''ve cut that all out of the shot.  The boy is completley passive in this shot, and the officer''s hand carries a little bit of expression, but other than that the figures in this shot are cold and unemotional, which certainly couldn''t have been the intention.  I think including the officer''s face isn''t necessary, since having it cut off adds to the feeling that he is larger than life in the eyes of the child,  but perhaps a side angle that showed the kids face or at least some pose with more expression to it would make this a much better shot.', '2004-01-03 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(530850, 52311, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a shot, and wonderfully executed.  The cool blue tone was a good choice as well.</td>', 'Great idea for a shot, and wonderfully executed.  The cool blue tone was a good choice as well.', '2004-01-03 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(530875, 49898, 3032, '<td valign="top">If I were this kid I would be so incredibly happy with this photo when I was a bit older. An excellent portrait, great pose, good lighting, good contrast, good b&amp;w toning, nice background, good use of space, good angle. In my opinion the best photo of this challenge.<br/></td>', 'If I were this kid I would be so incredibly happy with this photo when I was a bit older. An excellent portrait, great pose, good lighting, good contrast, good b&w toning, nice background, good use of space, good angle. In my opinion the best photo of this challenge.', '2004-01-03 18:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(530878, 52067, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and good composition. I like it how you filled the frame, zoomed in on the subject. The purple/pink light gives it that little bit of extra.<br/>I do wonder if it would benefit from a slightly stronger unsharp mask.<br/> <br/>Good photo. 9</td>', 'Nice subject and good composition. I like it how you filled the frame, zoomed in on the subject. The purple/pink light gives it that little bit of extra.I do wonder if it would benefit from a slightly stronger unsharp mask. Good photo. 9', '2004-01-03 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(530880, 52545, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the eye. I like this image a lot, good colours, nice composition, good contrast (except for that little highlight blowout in the middleleft). I have my doubts about the border, but that doesn''t really matter. 9</td>', 'Good focus on the eye. I like this image a lot, good colours, nice composition, good contrast (except for that little highlight blowout in the middleleft). I have my doubts about the border, but that doesn''t really matter. 9', '2004-01-03 18:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(530886, 52483, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good photo. It does a good job at communicating the helping hand message. I might have chosen to crop the top just a little bit lower, but other than that it is a very good photo. I also like the B&amp;W toning of this and the chosen aperture helps to clear out the background and focusses all the attention on the foreground. 8</td>', 'Good photo. It does a good job at communicating the helping hand message. I might have chosen to crop the top just a little bit lower, but other than that it is a very good photo. I also like the B&W toning of this and the chosen aperture helps to clear out the background and focusses all the attention on the foreground. 8', '2004-01-03 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(530888, 52311, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Nice lighting (spot from behind the background?) and blue toning. 8</td>', 'Good idea. Nice lighting (spot from behind the background?) and blue toning. 8', '2004-01-03 18:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530891, 52775, 3032, '<td valign="top">Your choice of lighting makes the face pop out really well. Nice pose and good composition, color seems to be good. The foto does seem a bit soft, but that could be intentional with a portrait.<br/>Perhaps you could use some dim lights from the left to add a more interesting reflection in the eyes, but that''s being nitpicky.<br/>I like it. 8</td>', 'Your choice of lighting makes the face pop out really well. Nice pose and good composition, color seems to be good. The foto does seem a bit soft, but that could be intentional with a portrait.Perhaps you could use some dim lights from the left to add a more interesting reflection in the eyes, but that''s being nitpicky.I like it. 8', '2004-01-03 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(530892, 52937, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice soft flower pic. In my opionion the color could use a little boost, on the other hand it is pretty calm this way. 8</td>', 'Nice soft flower pic. In my opionion the color could use a little boost, on the other hand it is pretty calm this way. 8', '2004-01-03 19:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(530893, 52122, 3032, '<td valign="top">Somehow this bird looks like it is pissed off about something. :)<br/>Good focus on the eye, good use of aperture/ shallow dof, like the toning balance and composition. 8</td>', 'Somehow this bird looks like it is pissed off about something. :)Good focus on the eye, good use of aperture/ shallow dof, like the toning balance and composition. 8', '2004-01-03 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(530896, 52707, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good action capture. Is the left one tearing up a real animal (not that I mind)? Pretty wild stuff. :)<br/>Good job on the exposure given the snowy white conditions. Great colors, good use of shallow dof. 8</td>', 'Good action capture. Is the left one tearing up a real animal (not that I mind)? Pretty wild stuff. :)Good job on the exposure given the snowy white conditions. Great colors, good use of shallow dof. 8', '2004-01-03 19:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530901, 52985, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. I especially like the crack patterns in the ice and the effect of the light and reflections on that. The shadows lack some detail and the horizon isn''t straight (or its a lens distortion). I''d focus on the reflections and ice patterns. 8</td>', 'Nice landscape. I especially like the crack patterns in the ice and the effect of the light and reflections on that. The shadows lack some detail and the horizon isn''t straight (or its a lens distortion). I''d focus on the reflections and ice patterns. 8', '2004-01-03 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(530907, 52625, 3032, '<td valign="top">The tonal balance is great an so is the color. It is just that the face is a bit soft (motion?) and the tail a bit oversharpened (diagonal jaggies).<br/>The choice of a wide aperture helps to blur out the busy background and the exposure is just excellent. 8</td>', 'The tonal balance is great an so is the color. It is just that the face is a bit soft (motion?) and the tail a bit oversharpened (diagonal jaggies).The choice of a wide aperture helps to blur out the busy background and the exposure is just excellent. 8', '2004-01-03 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(530910, 52835, 3032, '<td valign="top">What does it for me is the green light ot the light house. If it wasn''t for that I would rate the scene a bit dull. The color and color gradation is excellent and so is the foreground profiling. Good composition and thanks for waiting for the right time to take the photo. 8</td>', 'What does it for me is the green light ot the light house. If it wasn''t for that I would rate the scene a bit dull. The color and color gradation is excellent and so is the foreground profiling. Good composition and thanks for waiting for the right time to take the photo. 8', '2004-01-03 19:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(530911, 52577, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition &amp; filling of the frame. The wide aperature / shallow dof lets one focus directly on the eye. Nice colors. The only thing I don''t like is the dull border and the refllection in the eye is rather busy. 8</td>', 'Excellent composition & filling of the frame. The wide aperature / shallow dof lets one focus directly on the eye. Nice colors. The only thing I don''t like is the dull border and the refllection in the eye is rather busy. 8', '2004-01-03 19:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(530917, 52803, 3032, '<td valign="top">Out of focus tree lights? I like the effect. 7</td>', 'Out of focus tree lights? I like the effect. 7', '2004-01-03 19:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(530919, 52850, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait, nice B&amp;W toning.<br/>I don''t like the border and might have cropped it a bit tighter to really put the focus on the face. 7</td>', 'Interesting portrait, nice B&W toning.I don''t like the border and might have cropped it a bit tighter to really put the focus on the face. 7', '2004-01-03 19:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(530920, 52984, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, but the scene seems to lack a real point of interest. I think that a tighter crop on the trees in the middle would be better, especially the space at the left doesn''t add anything. Yes, I would make a square crop around the trees in the middle. <br/>I like the exposure, sharpness and color. 7</td>', 'I like the sky, but the scene seems to lack a real point of interest. I think that a tighter crop on the trees in the middle would be better, especially the space at the left doesn''t add anything. Yes, I would make a square crop around the trees in the middle. I like the exposure, sharpness and color. 7', '2004-01-03 19:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(530924, 53110, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like your background, lighting balance and crop, but the pic lacks a real wow-factor. A bit of light from the lower right would have helped a lot to get rid of the shadows.</td>', 'I like your background, lighting balance and crop, but the pic lacks a real wow-factor. A bit of light from the lower right would have helped a lot to get rid of the shadows.', '2004-01-03 19:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(530925, 52299, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern with all those bend shadows. Nice toning, good sharpening (lack of diagonal jaggies).</td>', 'Interesting pattern with all those bend shadows. Nice toning, good sharpening (lack of diagonal jaggies).', '2004-01-03 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(530927, 51910, 3032, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the helmet of Sauron (LotR). :)<br/>Nice composition, good lighting, good toning.</td>', 'This reminds me of the helmet of Sauron (LotR). :)Nice composition, good lighting, good toning.', '2004-01-03 19:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530929, 53093, 3032, '<td valign="top">The big square reflection in the glasses is distracting and the pose looks unnatural mild given the clothes and body jewelery she is wearing. You''d expect some rock action.<br/>The composition (apart from the pose) is pretty good and the exposure,  B&amp;W toning and lighting is very good.</td>', 'The big square reflection in the glasses is distracting and the pose looks unnatural mild given the clothes and body jewelery she is wearing. You''d expect some rock action.The composition (apart from the pose) is pretty good and the exposure,  B&W toning and lighting is very good.', '2004-01-03 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(530930, 52793, 13610, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot, the feeling of a snow storm is very strong. (9)</td>', 'Incredible shot, the feeling of a snow storm is very strong. (9)', '2004-01-03 19:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(530931, 53051, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.<br/>Its just that the colors are bit oversaturated and that the flower is oversharpened (light halos around 60% of the subject and pronounced diagonal jaggies).  I could live with the saturation, but I''d cut back on the sharpening. 7</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.Its just that the colors are bit oversaturated and that the flower is oversharpened (light halos around 60% of the subject and pronounced diagonal jaggies).  I could live with the saturation, but I''d cut back on the sharpening. 7', '2004-01-03 19:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(530934, 53054, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow, I just love how the light enhance the composition here. 8</td>', 'Wow, I just love how the light enhance the composition here. 8', '2004-01-03 19:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(530937, 52988, 3032, '<td valign="top">I would love to know how you do this kind of stuff. Is it safe to put power on a lightbulb that has its glass shell cut off? Excellent capture of the effect (exposure without to much highlight blowout yet a good smoke trail). Cool how the smoke goes into a mushroom nuclear blow effect. :)<br/> <br/>(edit: and I see no reason to do a DQ request, as this is a perfectly normal capture, yet it ain''t that easy I guess, good job!)</td>', 'I would love to know how you do this kind of stuff. Is it safe to put power on a lightbulb that has its glass shell cut off? Excellent capture of the effect (exposure without to much highlight blowout yet a good smoke trail). Cool how the smoke goes into a mushroom nuclear blow effect. :) (edit: and I see no reason to do a DQ request, as this is a perfectly normal capture, yet it ain''t that easy I guess, good job!)', '2004-01-03 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(530938, 52953, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture. Good job on the exposure and composition. I''d have dodged the face though.<br/></td>', 'Nice motion capture. Good job on the exposure and composition. I''d have dodged the face though.', '2004-01-03 20:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(530939, 53073, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very positive image. Makes me feel happy. Good job.</td>', 'Very positive image. Makes me feel happy. Good job.', '2004-01-03 20:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(530940, 52075, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool zoom effect, I wish I could do it with my camera. Nice exposure and good saturated colors.</td>', 'Cool zoom effect, I wish I could do it with my camera. Nice exposure and good saturated colors.', '2004-01-03 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530942, 52770, 3032, '<td valign="top">I saw this on CNN a while back.<br/>Nice composition with that profiling in the artificial sun and the upside down floor. Pretty accurate color.</td>', 'I saw this on CNN a while back.Nice composition with that profiling in the artificial sun and the upside down floor. Pretty accurate color.', '2004-01-03 20:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(530945, 52793, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and soft B&amp;W toning, yet the scene lacks a clear point of interest. 7</td>', 'I like the composition and soft B&W toning, yet the scene lacks a clear point of interest. 7', '2004-01-03 20:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(530992, 51972, 2553, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my highest rated, this is an exquisite shot!  Nice work with the lighting and composition.  I''d be willing to bet that this is ONE of MANY shots!  Congratulations to the proud parents/family!</td>', 'Definitely one of my highest rated, this is an exquisite shot!  Nice work with the lighting and composition.  I''d be willing to bet that this is ONE of MANY shots!  Congratulations to the proud parents/family!', '2004-01-03 21:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(530994, 52988, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.  Hope you added the particulars of the shot in the photog''s comment section so we can see how you went about this.  Not entirely crazy about the very centered composition, but not taking away points for that; the shot is just too fascinating!</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.  Hope you added the particulars of the shot in the photog''s comment section so we can see how you went about this.  Not entirely crazy about the very centered composition, but not taking away points for that; the shot is just too fascinating!', '2004-01-03 21:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(530999, 53107, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Color, composition, clarity, dof - it''s all here, and it''s all good!  Very nice shot, one of my top rated.</td>', 'Wow!  Color, composition, clarity, dof - it''s all here, and it''s all good!  Very nice shot, one of my top rated.', '2004-01-03 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(531003, 52793, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am absolutely crazy about this shot!  I love the softness of it.  I feel like I want just a bit more contrast, a bit more tonal range,  but then again, that might ruin the feel of it.  Can''t wait to see who this belongs to!</td>', 'I am absolutely crazy about this shot!  I love the softness of it.  I feel like I want just a bit more contrast, a bit more tonal range,  but then again, that might ruin the feel of it.  Can''t wait to see who this belongs to!', '2004-01-03 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(531010, 52563, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looks like a winner, or darned close to it!  This is just awesome.   Especially love the wonderfully colored background that is the perfect "presentation" for your subject.</td>', 'Looks like a winner, or darned close to it!  This is just awesome.   Especially love the wonderfully colored background that is the perfect "presentation" for your subject.', '2004-01-03 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(531015, 52662, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully surreal-looking.  I''m wondering if it is the lights in the sky that give everything else the odd color cast - like the yellow tones, and the purple color on the boat, am guessing that it is.  Terrific shot.</td>', 'Wonderfully surreal-looking.  I''m wondering if it is the lights in the sky that give everything else the odd color cast - like the yellow tones, and the purple color on the boat, am guessing that it is.  Terrific shot.', '2004-01-03 22:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(531019, 53009, 2553, '<td valign="top">So very sweet, and a perfect shot.  I love that the shot seems well thought out, using the color red throughout; that really pulls it together.</td>', 'So very sweet, and a perfect shot.  I love that the shot seems well thought out, using the color red throughout; that really pulls it together.', '2004-01-03 22:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(531022, 52390, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely shot, with very nice tonal range to make it visually stimulating.</td>', 'Quite a lovely shot, with very nice tonal range to make it visually stimulating.', '2004-01-03 22:04:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(531024, 52850, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable!  I would love to have seen a bit more light on the face so that I could see a bit more of the eyes, but never-the-less, a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable!  I would love to have seen a bit more light on the face so that I could see a bit more of the eyes, but never-the-less, a wonderful shot.', '2004-01-03 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(531025, 49898, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely the perfect baby shot!  The black and white is wonderful - makes it looks like the baby is floating on a cloud.  Great work!</td>', 'Absolutely the perfect baby shot!  The black and white is wonderful - makes it looks like the baby is floating on a cloud.  Great work!', '2004-01-03 22:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(531031, 52811, 2553, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites!!  A stunning combination of wonderful color, soft focus, mysterious moodiness,  and perfect minimalism.</td>', 'One of my favorites!!  A stunning combination of wonderful color, soft focus, mysterious moodiness,  and perfect minimalism.', '2004-01-03 22:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(531039, 52445, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, and an amazing shot.  I don''t care for the very "centeredness" of the subject, and find the many "elements" in the shot to be distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful color, and an amazing shot.  I don''t care for the very "centeredness" of the subject, and find the many "elements" in the shot to be distracting.', '2004-01-03 22:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(531076, 51560, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love the black and neon green color in this photo. well-composed.</td>', 'Love the black and neon green color in this photo. well-composed.', '2004-01-03 23:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(531077, 52511, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. I like the composition.</td>', 'Nice and simple. I like the composition.', '2004-01-03 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(531079, 53029, 12160, '<td valign="top">Well-composed photo. Sharp and the warm color is nice. Lighting is good too.</td>', 'Well-composed photo. Sharp and the warm color is nice. Lighting is good too.', '2004-01-03 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(531105, 52391, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the copmposition but find the picture to be but too grainy. I guess you used a very high ISO. Perhaps run it through NeatImage to clean it up.</td>', 'I like the copmposition but find the picture to be but too grainy. I guess you used a very high ISO. Perhaps run it through NeatImage to clean it up.', '2004-01-03 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(531107, 52850, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. Good skins tones as well. Agressive crop but I like it.</td>', 'Nice tones. Good skins tones as well. Agressive crop but I like it.', '2004-01-03 23:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(531113, 51950, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice BW. Very good contrasts. Focus seems very sharp. Leading line is very strong. Leads your eye all the way back to the horizon. My only problem is the sloped horizon. Is it a hill? Somehow it being sloped confuses the eye. I see why you left it in, though. Not sure how to help it, if at all. Have you tried rotating it? Perhaps not. My wife disagrees with me. She REALLY thinks the sloped part MAKES the shot. ANyway I like it alot, regardless.</td>', 'Nice BW. Very good contrasts. Focus seems very sharp. Leading line is very strong. Leads your eye all the way back to the horizon. My only problem is the sloped horizon. Is it a hill? Somehow it being sloped confuses the eye. I see why you left it in, though. Not sure how to help it, if at all. Have you tried rotating it? Perhaps not. My wife disagrees with me. She REALLY thinks the sloped part MAKES the shot. ANyway I like it alot, regardless.', '2004-01-03 23:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(531135, 53066, 13136, '<td valign="top">The pose and lighting are very nice and first impressions are very good. However, looking a bit longer, it looks like the skin has been touched up so much it looks like wax. There is absolutely no texture to the skin.</td>', 'The pose and lighting are very nice and first impressions are very good. However, looking a bit longer, it looks like the skin has been touched up so much it looks like wax. There is absolutely no texture to the skin.', '2004-01-04 00:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(531137, 52829, 13136, '<td valign="top">Real good color on this shot. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Real good color on this shot. Interesting composition.', '2004-01-04 00:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(531154, 53112, 15690, '<td valign="top">A cute picture for a child''s room, or in a story book for children.</td>', 'A cute picture for a child''s room, or in a story book for children.', '2004-01-04 00:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(531155, 52353, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset/sunrise scene. The composition is very interesting. I like how the dock leads your eyes toward the sun. The clouds seem to bring your eyes to the sun. Also is that the moon or a star near the top left. Very inspirational shot.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset/sunrise scene. The composition is very interesting. I like how the dock leads your eyes toward the sun. The clouds seem to bring your eyes to the sun. Also is that the moon or a star near the top left. Very inspirational shot.', '2004-01-04 01:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(531157, 52835, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset/sunrise scene. The silhouette of the lighthouse helps to give the powerful scene an extra bit of punch. I really like the star in the sky. It helps to make your eyes look at the complete scene, yet keeps the composition simple.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset/sunrise scene. The silhouette of the lighthouse helps to give the powerful scene an extra bit of punch. I really like the star in the sky. It helps to make your eyes look at the complete scene, yet keeps the composition simple.', '2004-01-04 01:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(531161, 51950, 10084, '<td valign="top">Contrast is very nice. I like how the fence is leading your eyes from the bottom to the top. The curve of the background also does this.</td>', 'Contrast is very nice. I like how the fence is leading your eyes from the bottom to the top. The curve of the background also does this.', '2004-01-04 01:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(531178, 52270, 4007, '<td valign="top">The lense flares are cool, but the rest of the shot has not detail due to the contrast, leaving it rather uninteresting overall.  That''s too bad because the beams of light in the background look like they offered a lot of potential, but thye just don''t come through very strongly because the shot is completely dominated by the sun flare in the top right.</td>', 'The lense flares are cool, but the rest of the shot has not detail due to the contrast, leaving it rather uninteresting overall.  That''s too bad because the beams of light in the background look like they offered a lot of potential, but thye just don''t come through very strongly because the shot is completely dominated by the sun flare in the top right.', '2004-01-04 01:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(531179, 52988, 4007, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. I can''t figure out what it is, but it''s forms are definately interesting and they hold my attention pretty well.</td>', 'Hmmm.. I can''t figure out what it is, but it''s forms are definately interesting and they hold my attention pretty well.', '2004-01-04 01:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(531180, 52614, 4007, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to do a flower shot, it needs a way to stand out, since it''s a cliche shot.  With the shadows, the leaf obstucting part of the flower, and the lack of excelent sharpness on this shot, it ends up looking very generic among the many other flower shots.  The first step to making this better I think would be to work on better lighting.  Then I''d try to mix it up by trying a more unique angle, framing, or else get in really close.  Good luck.</td>', 'If you''re going to do a flower shot, it needs a way to stand out, since it''s a cliche shot.  With the shadows, the leaf obstucting part of the flower, and the lack of excelent sharpness on this shot, it ends up looking very generic among the many other flower shots.  The first step to making this better I think would be to work on better lighting.  Then I''d try to mix it up by trying a more unique angle, framing, or else get in really close.  Good luck.', '2004-01-04 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(531181, 51501, 4007, '<td valign="top">The whole shot looks a little out of focus/blurry.  Consequently this lacks enough detail to make it as interesting as it could have been.</td>', 'The whole shot looks a little out of focus/blurry.  Consequently this lacks enough detail to make it as interesting as it could have been.', '2004-01-04 02:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(531182, 52775, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The black hair with just the highlights showing through, and having it draped over her eye, which also only shows the highlights, all produces a nice effect.  The smile is a bit awkward perhaps.  I''m not really sure about the hint of red in the bottom right.  I can''t decide if it adds another point of interest or throws off the balance of the shot.  Probably both, so I''m not sure whether that hurts it or helps it, but it''s an issue to consider carefully: whether you want that to introduce a strong red without making it very important to the shot.</td>', 'I like this.  The black hair with just the highlights showing through, and having it draped over her eye, which also only shows the highlights, all produces a nice effect.  The smile is a bit awkward perhaps.  I''m not really sure about the hint of red in the bottom right.  I can''t decide if it adds another point of interest or throws off the balance of the shot.  Probably both, so I''m not sure whether that hurts it or helps it, but it''s an issue to consider carefully: whether you want that to introduce a strong red without making it very important to the shot.', '2004-01-04 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(531183, 53066, 12268, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Way too much post processing. Kinda over did the neat image. So much so that it does not even look real. I think it spoiled an otherwise good picture. I like the look on the face with the slight Mona Lisa grin.  6</td>', 'Whoa! Way too much post processing. Kinda over did the neat image. So much so that it does not even look real. I think it spoiled an otherwise good picture. I like the look on the face with the slight Mona Lisa grin.  6', '2004-01-04 02:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(531189, 53038, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful macro, done extremely well... I love the black background, and the choice of using just a few petals of the flower in the photo.  Great DOF.  The only thing I might say is that the droplets looks too centralized and unnatural... I think it almost might have looked better with fewer droplets.  Nice job though. -8- good luck!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful macro, done extremely well... I love the black background, and the choice of using just a few petals of the flower in the photo.  Great DOF.  The only thing I might say is that the droplets looks too centralized and unnatural... I think it almost might have looked better with fewer droplets.  Nice job though. -8- good luck!', '2004-01-04 02:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(531190, 52391, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of black and white and an old fashioned grainy looking style.  I know you''ll get a lot of comments about cropping off some of the top, but I think I really like it... gives it that distant feeling that puts it kind of in the past, I like the free space.</td>', 'Beautiful use of black and white and an old fashioned grainy looking style.  I know you''ll get a lot of comments about cropping off some of the top, but I think I really like it... gives it that distant feeling that puts it kind of in the past, I like the free space.', '2004-01-04 02:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(531191, 52616, 4967, '<td valign="top">To me this is just much too busy.  I think that maybe using a much smaller dof, and just focusing in on one part of the branch or swithcing your angle to get sky only in the background etc. might have helped, also the lamp post coming off on the right is semi bothersome, but not terribly.</td>', 'To me this is just much too busy.  I think that maybe using a much smaller dof, and just focusing in on one part of the branch or swithcing your angle to get sky only in the background etc. might have helped, also the lamp post coming off on the right is semi bothersome, but not terribly.', '2004-01-04 02:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(531192, 52802, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t really find a lot of interest in this photo.  I think that you are trying to show the dilapidated building?  but I''m not positive.  Nothing really stands out here from everything else... might have been interesting to do it in portrait style with the door in possibly the bottom left corner or something like that, I just don''t feel any part of this picture grabs me at all.</td>', 'I don''t really find a lot of interest in this photo.  I think that you are trying to show the dilapidated building?  but I''m not positive.  Nothing really stands out here from everything else... might have been interesting to do it in portrait style with the door in possibly the bottom left corner or something like that, I just don''t feel any part of this picture grabs me at all.', '2004-01-04 02:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(531195, 52291, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and very eerie looking scene here.  Definitely puts you on edge, and makes you feel a little nervous about what is happening... I think I might have framed it a little more with the picnic table in the right hand corner, but I do like the black upper right... interesting, and artsy.</td>', 'Great lighting and very eerie looking scene here.  Definitely puts you on edge, and makes you feel a little nervous about what is happening... I think I might have framed it a little more with the picnic table in the right hand corner, but I do like the black upper right... interesting, and artsy.', '2004-01-04 02:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(531198, 52473, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice close look at the rider, but I feel as though this isn''t a very intense part of the ride, the expression on the boys face isn''t particularly intense, his muscles are completely bunched up, there is not mud flying up in the air... it''s almost too clean to be a really great sports photo.  Facial expression is VERY important for sports, but also the sense of the moment rather then just the clearest photo of any point in the race.</td>', 'Nice close look at the rider, but I feel as though this isn''t a very intense part of the ride, the expression on the boys face isn''t particularly intense, his muscles are completely bunched up, there is not mud flying up in the air... it''s almost too clean to be a really great sports photo.  Facial expression is VERY important for sports, but also the sense of the moment rather then just the clearest photo of any point in the race.', '2004-01-04 02:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(531199, 52276, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and great black and white (slight blue toning?) This is very pretty and nicely composed, although I think it might be nice to crop out just a bit off the top to just above the tallest branch and maybe slightly off the right to where that first y branch is, and the clone out the jutting out branch, but thats just an idea... very nice as is... foggy looking... -8-</td>', 'Beautiful scene and great black and white (slight blue toning?) This is very pretty and nicely composed, although I think it might be nice to crop out just a bit off the top to just above the tallest branch and maybe slightly off the right to where that first y branch is, and the clone out the jutting out branch, but thats just an idea... very nice as is... foggy looking... -8-', '2004-01-04 03:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(531212, 52483, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would make for a great ad for law enforcement. Contrast is very good. Kind of tells a story. Definitely should try to submit for a poster or ad campaign.</td>', 'Would make for a great ad for law enforcement. Contrast is very good. Kind of tells a story. Definitely should try to submit for a poster or ad campaign.', '2004-01-04 03:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(531213, 51482, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would make for an awesome Christmas card. Contrast is pretty good. Would definitely like a bit more depth of field. The background becomes a bit distracting near the top of the tree.</td>', 'Would make for an awesome Christmas card. Contrast is pretty good. Would definitely like a bit more depth of field. The background becomes a bit distracting near the top of the tree.', '2004-01-04 03:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(531214, 52473, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.  Helps to give you a sense of the foreground bicyclist being chased by the other bicyclist. Colors are really good.</td>', 'Great depth of field.  Helps to give you a sense of the foreground bicyclist being chased by the other bicyclist. Colors are really good.', '2004-01-04 04:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(531215, 52657, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors. I like how the trees are slanted toward the left. I''m assuming it''s really wind at the location that you took the shot and they actually grow that way.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors. I like how the trees are slanted toward the left. I''m assuming it''s really wind at the location that you took the shot and they actually grow that way.', '2004-01-04 04:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(531216, 50844, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredibly beautiful contrast. The sephia mode is perfect for the subject matter. Great depth of field is captures. Beautiful details in the foreground vehicle. Composition is very interesting. I like how your eyes are lead from the rightside of the photo toward the left.</td>', 'Incredibly beautiful contrast. The sephia mode is perfect for the subject matter. Great depth of field is captures. Beautiful details in the foreground vehicle. Composition is very interesting. I like how your eyes are lead from the rightside of the photo toward the left.', '2004-01-04 04:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(531217, 50518, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract structure. You were able to capture some really neat looking shapes. I like how your eyes are lead from the foreground toward the background of the clouds. The clouds really help to make the subject pop out of the shot.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract structure. You were able to capture some really neat looking shapes. I like how your eyes are lead from the foreground toward the background of the clouds. The clouds really help to make the subject pop out of the shot.', '2004-01-04 04:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(531218, 52984, 13403, '<td valign="top">i like how thin the trees are... they look like veins against the sky...  almost more like roots than branches..</td>', 'i like how thin the trees are... they look like veins against the sky...  almost more like roots than branches..', '2004-01-04 04:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(531219, 50518, 13403, '<td valign="top">vertigo...</td>', 'vertigo...', '2004-01-04 04:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(531220, 53044, 13403, '<td valign="top">i like this- i''d like it even more if you had less a sense of the shape of the container..    how to explain?  hmm, just the dye...</td>', 'i like this- i''d like it even more if you had less a sense of the shape of the container..    how to explain?  hmm, just the dye...', '2004-01-04 04:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(531221, 51871, 13403, '<td valign="top">certainly picturesque.</td>', 'certainly picturesque.', '2004-01-04 04:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(531227, 52835, 11073, '<td valign="top">Pleasing color and warmth.  wish the image was bigger to appreciate more however...</td>', 'Pleasing color and warmth.  wish the image was bigger to appreciate more however...', '2004-01-04 05:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(531231, 52929, 11073, '<td valign="top">doesn''t look as sharp as it could be -  tripod?  But that said, the lines and composition are pleasing.  Colors are great.  My only compositional gripe is the fencing? in the pic on the left side, it distracts a little bit imo.  A little angle change would take care of this.  Nice work, but I think it could be stronger with a reshoot (mainly for the blurriness/soft focus).  6.</td>', 'doesn''t look as sharp as it could be -  tripod?  But that said, the lines and composition are pleasing.  Colors are great.  My only compositional gripe is the fencing? in the pic on the left side, it distracts a little bit imo.  A little angle change would take care of this.  Nice work, but I think it could be stronger with a reshoot (mainly for the blurriness/soft focus).  6.', '2004-01-04 05:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(531233, 51775, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool idea and even better execution.  i think i would have scored this higher with more contrast though.  nice work. simple and cool.  7.</td>', 'cool idea and even better execution.  i think i would have scored this higher with more contrast though.  nice work. simple and cool.  7.', '2004-01-04 05:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(531234, 53032, 11073, '<td valign="top">beautiful atmospheric element.  love it.  I''m not so crazy about the power lines ( I know you couldn''t help it ).  The horizon doesn''t look straight either, maybe its just me but I think it could be tiilted a few degrees in photoshop.  cool image. 6.</td>', 'beautiful atmospheric element.  love it.  I''m not so crazy about the power lines ( I know you couldn''t help it ).  The horizon doesn''t look straight either, maybe its just me but I think it could be tiilted a few degrees in photoshop.  cool image. 6.', '2004-01-04 05:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(531235, 50548, 11073, '<td valign="top">looks like a quarlo (has his feel to it) or a slower shot (he loves silhouettes).  I like the abstract look, and the use of the sun to "create" a unique lighting.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  Nice work. 7.</td>', 'looks like a quarlo (has his feel to it) or a slower shot (he loves silhouettes).  I like the abstract look, and the use of the sun to "create" a unique lighting.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  Nice work. 7.', '2004-01-04 05:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(531245, 52895, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The background is very busy and messy. It makes it hard to see the owl. Perhaps a norrower DOF would have blured the BG a little more.</td>', 'Nice capture. The background is very busy and messy. It makes it hard to see the owl. Perhaps a norrower DOF would have blured the BG a little more.', '2004-01-04 08:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(531246, 52489, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow! what a great image. Where is this taken? I love the mood of this picture. Very well done.</td>', 'Wow! what a great image. Where is this taken? I love the mood of this picture. Very well done.', '2004-01-04 08:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(531247, 51959, 5044, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Was this set up or captured "live"? I love the look on the mother''s face, as if she is edging the child on, waiting for the shot to fire.</td>', 'Powerful image. Was this set up or captured "live"? I love the look on the mother''s face, as if she is edging the child on, waiting for the shot to fire.', '2004-01-04 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(531248, 53071, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow. Those skaters look as if they are glowing in the dark. Very well done.</td>', 'Wow. Those skaters look as if they are glowing in the dark. Very well done.', '2004-01-04 08:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(531266, 53060, 11895, '<td valign="top">noisy, perhaps a little oversharpened but great capture nonetheless, love the colors and the perfect reflections</td>', 'noisy, perhaps a little oversharpened but great capture nonetheless, love the colors and the perfect reflections', '2004-01-04 10:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(531308, 52803, 13152, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colour! What are they?</td>', 'Fantastic colour! What are they?', '2004-01-04 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(531309, 52473, 9941, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  One of the only sports shots in this challenge.  Brilliant DOF, interesting colors.  Too bad no. 19 doesn''t look like he''s suffering more!</td>', 'Awesome!  One of the only sports shots in this challenge.  Brilliant DOF, interesting colors.  Too bad no. 19 doesn''t look like he''s suffering more!', '2004-01-04 11:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(531311, 52413, 9941, '<td valign="top">This captures the lonely animal so perfectly!  I want to reach out and give that dog some attention.  Wonderful photo!</td>', 'This captures the lonely animal so perfectly!  I want to reach out and give that dog some attention.  Wonderful photo!', '2004-01-04 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(531313, 50424, 13152, '<td valign="top">Very similar to an old Albrecht Durer painting. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very similar to an old Albrecht Durer painting. Nice shot.', '2004-01-04 11:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(531314, 53093, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  One thing that always bothers me in guitar photos is that I can tell if the model actually knows how to play or not.  Her hands are OK, but not quite convincing me that she is who you say she is.  Gave you an 8 though!</td>', 'Very cool photo.  One thing that always bothers me in guitar photos is that I can tell if the model actually knows how to play or not.  Her hands are OK, but not quite convincing me that she is who you say she is.  Gave you an 8 though!', '2004-01-04 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(531318, 52985, 9941, '<td valign="top">Oooohhhh... this is gorgeous!  One of my top 3 picks!</td>', 'Oooohhhh... this is gorgeous!  One of my top 3 picks!', '2004-01-04 11:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(531319, 52775, 9941, '<td valign="top">The nicest, most realistic portrait in the bunch.  Great job!</td>', 'The nicest, most realistic portrait in the bunch.  Great job!', '2004-01-04 11:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(531327, 51871, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. I like the colors in the sky and that you''ve captured a nice tonal range. Although not something you could change, I notice what look like telephone poles and that distracts (but they are small and not terribly intrusive). You composition emphasizes the lighthouse. 9</td>', 'Excellent image. I like the colors in the sky and that you''ve captured a nice tonal range. Although not something you could change, I notice what look like telephone poles and that distracts (but they are small and not terribly intrusive). You composition emphasizes the lighthouse. 9', '2004-01-04 11:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(531328, 52811, 6100, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of negative space. The even tonality is, I think, tough to achive but you''ve done it. 9</td>', 'Very nice use of negative space. The even tonality is, I think, tough to achive but you''ve done it. 9', '2004-01-04 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(531412, 53009, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, great title, well lit.  One of my top 4</td>', 'Nicely composed, great title, well lit.  One of my top 4', '2004-01-04 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
