(531426, 52838, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of the best "snow scenes with tree" shots.  The empty park adds to the composition, monocromatic tones adds to the interest as well.  Too bad there''s that sign/garbage can/? small thing in the lower left - it keeps my eye from being pulled in with the curve of the fence. 9</td>', 'One of the best "snow scenes with tree" shots.  The empty park adds to the composition, monocromatic tones adds to the interest as well.  Too bad there''s that sign/garbage can/? small thing in the lower left - it keeps my eye from being pulled in with the curve of the fence. 9', '2004-01-04 14:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(531448, 52311, 15593, '<td valign="top">Illusion indeed - nicely done.</td>', 'Illusion indeed - nicely done.', '2004-01-04 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(531475, 53035, 2553, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot all the way around.   I love the lighting and the nice warm feel of the shot.  Only nitpick I might have is that a composition of same or similar subjects is usually more effective and dynamic with an "odd" number of items.</td>', 'Terrific shot all the way around.   I love the lighting and the nice warm feel of the shot.  Only nitpick I might have is that a composition of same or similar subjects is usually more effective and dynamic with an "odd" number of items.', '2004-01-04 15:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(531476, 52985, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting, and that is a compliment!  An absolutely beautiful shot, with great tonal range and wonderful subtle color.</td>', 'Looks like a painting, and that is a compliment!  An absolutely beautiful shot, with great tonal range and wonderful subtle color.', '2004-01-04 15:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(531477, 52909, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the choice of black and white, and I love tree shots.   Nice tonal range and composition.</td>', 'Love the choice of black and white, and I love tree shots.   Nice tonal range and composition.', '2004-01-04 15:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(531478, 50877, 11073, '<td valign="top">liked it before, like it now.  I think that you''ve cropped a little off the left?  Nice work. 9</td>', 'liked it before, like it now.  I think that you''ve cropped a little off the left?  Nice work. 9', '2004-01-04 15:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(531480, 52838, 2553, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a painting or drawing, and it is quite beautiful.  Composition is wonderful, as is the choice of black and white.  One of my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'This almost looks like a painting or drawing, and it is quite beautiful.  Composition is wonderful, as is the choice of black and white.  One of my favorites this challenge.', '2004-01-04 15:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(531481, 52707, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just have to keep coming back to look at this shot.  It is so incredible that it''s hard to believe.  This would have been amazing for the action challenge, wouldn''t it??  Terrific shot, what more can I say?</td>', 'I just have to keep coming back to look at this shot.  It is so incredible that it''s hard to believe.  This would have been amazing for the action challenge, wouldn''t it??  Terrific shot, what more can I say?', '2004-01-04 15:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(531483, 50097, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  The color of the castle and the fireworks all make it seem kind of unreal.  Or maybe surreal.  I don''t normally favor a  very centered composition, but there is so much to look at here that it doesn''t really seem to hurt it.</td>', 'Love this shot!  The color of the castle and the fireworks all make it seem kind of unreal.  Or maybe surreal.  I don''t normally favor a  very centered composition, but there is so much to look at here that it doesn''t really seem to hurt it.', '2004-01-04 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(531485, 53038, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely work.  Composition is nice, lighting is great, color is beautiful.  Only thing that I, personally, don''t care for is that the petals seem to be just "floating" in the photo, there is no stem or anything to ground them.</td>', 'Lovely work.  Composition is nice, lighting is great, color is beautiful.  Only thing that I, personally, don''t care for is that the petals seem to be just "floating" in the photo, there is no stem or anything to ground them.', '2004-01-04 16:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(531501, 52663, 3087, '<td valign="top">I was drawn to this because I submitted an image with similar subject matter! :o) I really like your use of light and shadow, particularly the inclusion of a large area of negative space. Though the water does add interest my feeling is that fewer larger drops of water might be more visually dynamic. That said, I do like this image very much.</td>', 'I was drawn to this because I submitted an image with similar subject matter! :o) I really like your use of light and shadow, particularly the inclusion of a large area of negative space. Though the water does add interest my feeling is that fewer larger drops of water might be more visually dynamic. That said, I do like this image very much.', '2004-01-04 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(531539, 49898, 4967, '<td valign="top">Jacko?  What a cute kid and a great photo!  Love the choice of black and white... andd the white background is nice... I''m thinking maybe of having this cropped so that Samuel fills the frame leaving less white and more baby...</td>', 'Jacko?  What a cute kid and a great photo!  Love the choice of black and white... andd the white background is nice... I''m thinking maybe of having this cropped so that Samuel fills the frame leaving less white and more baby...', '2004-01-04 18:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(531540, 50836, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the DOF here... the colors in the photo look a bit muted but that doesn''t bother me.. I think I would have liked to have seen this cropped quite a bit more... so that the background didn''t take up quite so much of the frame... also I don''t really feel the boy is doing anything particularly interesting that catcheds my attention.</td>', 'Nice job with the DOF here... the colors in the photo look a bit muted but that doesn''t bother me.. I think I would have liked to have seen this cropped quite a bit more... so that the background didn''t take up quite so much of the frame... also I don''t really feel the boy is doing anything particularly interesting that catcheds my attention.', '2004-01-04 18:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(531541, 53074, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great job with the exposure of the snow... it looks so nice and crisp, good packing snow?  :-)  I like your composition hereNice leading lines etc.  Nicely done... solid photo.</td>', 'Great job with the exposure of the snow... it looks so nice and crisp, good packing snow?  :-)  I like your composition hereNice leading lines etc.  Nicely done... solid photo.', '2004-01-04 18:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(531544, 52964, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good idea... but I think you need to use more of the light you have.. currently the light draws me to his pants, not up to his face.. also I think this could have used a much tighter crop I like his pose though... andd great smile :-).  Hope he likes them!</td>', 'Good idea... but I think you need to use more of the light you have.. currently the light draws me to his pants, not up to his face.. also I think this could have used a much tighter crop I like his pose though... andd great smile :-).  Hope he likes them!', '2004-01-04 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(531548, 53101, 4967, '<td valign="top">This looks similar to colors of both rocks and lighting, as well as shadows that I saw and photographed in Australia... is it Australia?  I like the nice warm colors here... Polarizer?  I also like the shadow coming in from the bottom left hand corner.</td>', 'This looks similar to colors of both rocks and lighting, as well as shadows that I saw and photographed in Australia... is it Australia?  I like the nice warm colors here... Polarizer?  I also like the shadow coming in from the bottom left hand corner.', '2004-01-04 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(531549, 52988, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this was done, I''m guessing you used some photoshop (perfectly legal) but it is REALLY COOL!  This just looks awesome... and I''m hoping you''ll tell us how you got this at the end of the challenge.  I''m going to go with a 10 just beccause I think it''s a really cool thing, and well shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this was done, I''m guessing you used some photoshop (perfectly legal) but it is REALLY COOL!  This just looks awesome... and I''m hoping you''ll tell us how you got this at the end of the challenge.  I''m going to go with a 10 just beccause I think it''s a really cool thing, and well shot.', '2004-01-04 18:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(531551, 53093, 4967, '<td valign="top">Mag?  This is really a great portrait.... I love the lighting, and the choice of having it in black and white, it is all very well done, plus I like the white reflection in the glasses that I''m guessing was purposeful.  I also think the crop is excellent and very different.  -10-</td>', 'Mag?  This is really a great portrait.... I love the lighting, and the choice of having it in black and white, it is all very well done, plus I like the white reflection in the glasses that I''m guessing was purposeful.  I also think the crop is excellent and very different.  -10-', '2004-01-04 18:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(531556, 52660, 4967, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture!  What a beautiful animal... he looks so menacing but since you are so close to him, I would guess that he is your pet and you didn''t think he''d strike at you?!  Great texture to this picture, and very nice lighting.  Gorgeous eye!  This is very well done, nice job!  The only thing I would say is maybe a slightily more open dof but that would have been hard.  What kind of snake is he?<br/></td>', 'Gorgeous picture!  What a beautiful animal... he looks so menacing but since you are so close to him, I would guess that he is your pet and you didn''t think he''d strike at you?!  Great texture to this picture, and very nice lighting.  Gorgeous eye!  This is very well done, nice job!  The only thing I would say is maybe a slightily more open dof but that would have been hard.  What kind of snake is he?', '2004-01-04 18:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(531572, 53011, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Very small-town, homey feeling!  I wish it were bigger so I could see more details, though.  8</td>', 'Beautiful!  Very small-town, homey feeling!  I wish it were bigger so I could see more details, though.  8', '2004-01-04 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(531576, 52525, 11073, '<td valign="top">really like this pic.  it looks like an old time 1800esqe pic....but much much sharper.  Nice work. 8</td>', 'really like this pic.  it looks like an old time 1800esqe pic....but much much sharper.  Nice work. 8', '2004-01-04 19:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(531581, 53065, 11073, '<td valign="top">Very good composition within fhe frame, colors contrast well enough, and the moment of exposure was a very good one.  nice work.</td>', 'Very good composition within fhe frame, colors contrast well enough, and the moment of exposure was a very good one.  nice work.', '2004-01-04 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
