(531583, 53014, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting. Seems a little soft in focus, did you do a sharpen after you resized? Nice work. 8 -danny</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting. Seems a little soft in focus, did you do a sharpen after you resized? Nice work. 8 -danny', '2004-01-04 19:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(531584, 53071, 4493, '<td valign="top">The two lone people on the ice with their matching coats really makes for a spendid shot. Great colors and very sharp. 8 -danny</td>', 'The two lone people on the ice with their matching coats really makes for a spendid shot. Great colors and very sharp. 8 -danny', '2004-01-04 19:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(531592, 53054, 11073, '<td valign="top">very good.  sky is perfect, tonal range is excellent, composition within the frame is there, and the overall image is very pleasing.  Simple and cool.  nice work.  8 because its  really good + 1 because I know how hard it is to get night shots to turn out this good.  =  9.</td>', 'very good.  sky is perfect, tonal range is excellent, composition within the frame is there, and the overall image is very pleasing.  Simple and cool.  nice work.  8 because its  really good + 1 because I know how hard it is to get night shots to turn out this good.  =  9.', '2004-01-04 19:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(531593, 50836, 11073, '<td valign="top">good image quailty.  I think that I would have scored it higher if he wasn''t so centered within the frame. (read: crop the right off some)</td>', 'good image quailty.  I think that I would have scored it higher if he wasn''t so centered within the frame. (read: crop the right off some)', '2004-01-04 19:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(531599, 49435, 11073, '<td valign="top">this image has potential.  The shadow, powerlines, cars, houses, cut off flag, and trees all detract from the strong central subjects ( soldier and flag )  If you were to reshoot this from a low angle ( read: get on your knees or set up a tripod low - and shoot up at the subject).  This will serve to do a couple of things.  One, it will cut out all of the clutter - you will only see the soldier, the flag pole, and the flag.  Clean and simple.  Something tells me that you don''t really want the volkswagen in there anyway - if it doesn''t help convey your point or emotion, cut it out.  Two, shooting up at your subject gives a feeling of power  - which is appropriate with this subject.  This technique will help you compose a shot with a less than ideal background.  Now, having said all that, I''m only going to include the main subjects in my scoring of this pic.  The cut off flag and overexposed "badge" are the only real detractors.  5.</td>', 'this image has potential.  The shadow, powerlines, cars, houses, cut off flag, and trees all detract from the strong central subjects ( soldier and flag )  If you were to reshoot this from a low angle ( read: get on your knees or set up a tripod low - and shoot up at the subject).  This will serve to do a couple of things.  One, it will cut out all of the clutter - you will only see the soldier, the flag pole, and the flag.  Clean and simple.  Something tells me that you don''t really want the volkswagen in there anyway - if it doesn''t help convey your point or emotion, cut it out.  Two, shooting up at your subject gives a feeling of power  - which is appropriate with this subject.  This technique will help you compose a shot with a less than ideal background.  Now, having said all that, I''m only going to include the main subjects in my scoring of this pic.  The cut off flag and overexposed "badge" are the only real detractors.  5.', '2004-01-04 19:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(531620, 52424, 6600, '<td valign="top">High contrast, really pops.  Well titled.  Nicely done.</td>', 'High contrast, really pops.  Well titled.  Nicely done.', '2004-01-04 20:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
