(531767, 50877, 7706, '<td valign="top">Hey that is a cool photo. I have one taken from the other end of Southbank, which is a lot more over exposed, but it is my best photo on this site to date. Melbourne has a really beautiful landscape for night shots like this one. Good work :)</td>', 'Hey that is a cool photo. I have one taken from the other end of Southbank, which is a lot more over exposed, but it is my best photo on this site to date. Melbourne has a really beautiful landscape for night shots like this one. Good work :)', '2004-01-05 00:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(531783, 52165, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the mood created by the lighting on this photo, but unfortunately, it leaves me with little to see.  Still, it is well done.  An angle with the cake in center and the person''s face behind it lit slightly by the candles might look good too.  Oh, and happy birthday = )</td>', 'I like the mood created by the lighting on this photo, but unfortunately, it leaves me with little to see.  Still, it is well done.  An angle with the cake in center and the person''s face behind it lit slightly by the candles might look good too.  Oh, and happy birthday = )', '2004-01-05 00:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(531788, 52213, 509, '<td valign="top">This looks a little oversharpened on the tree, but I like the framing and color.  Very serene.</td>', 'This looks a little oversharpened on the tree, but I like the framing and color.  Very serene.', '2004-01-05 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(531797, 53011, 509, '<td valign="top">All this needs is a vintage automobile parked on the corner.  Nice job.  The person in the middle of the road looks a bit odd to me.</td>', 'All this needs is a vintage automobile parked on the corner.  Nice job.  The person in the middle of the road looks a bit odd to me.', '2004-01-05 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(531804, 53108, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject, but I''m not sure why you included the guard rail near the bottom.  I think it might look better cropped out, but it does fit to even out the horizon</td>', 'Nice choice of subject, but I''m not sure why you included the guard rail near the bottom.  I think it might look better cropped out, but it does fit to even out the horizon', '2004-01-05 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
