(531913, 53071, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract shapes. Captured lighting is very good. Very vibrant colors. I like the added action of the skaters in action.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract shapes. Captured lighting is very good. Very vibrant colors. I like the added action of the skaters in action.', '2004-01-05 02:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(531914, 53009, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would make for a great Christmas themed greeting or postcard. Colors are vibrant. The lighting on the tree was captured briliantly. Priceless captured of the child.</td>', 'Would make for a great Christmas themed greeting or postcard. Colors are vibrant. The lighting on the tree was captured briliantly. Priceless captured of the child.', '2004-01-05 02:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(531926, 53009, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful soft looking photo.  Did you use a star filter?  Nice job on the lighting, very calm.  Did he actually sleep there waiting for santa, is this conducive to keeping children in bed during the time he comes ;-).  Nice composition, good job getting close.  A nice photo... maybe a little busy, but I think it''s very well done.</td>', 'This is a beautiful soft looking photo.  Did you use a star filter?  Nice job on the lighting, very calm.  Did he actually sleep there waiting for santa, is this conducive to keeping children in bed during the time he comes ;-).  Nice composition, good job getting close.  A nice photo... maybe a little busy, but I think it''s very well done.', '2004-01-05 02:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(531927, 53065, 4967, '<td valign="top">Cute!  I would have liked to have seen more of the dog jumping and less of his surroundings... depending on the size of your photo you probably could have achieved this with a crop.  Great action here the best thing imho would have been a much tighter crop, thats all :-).</td>', 'Cute!  I would have liked to have seen more of the dog jumping and less of his surroundings... depending on the size of your photo you probably could have achieved this with a crop.  Great action here the best thing imho would have been a much tighter crop, thats all :-).', '2004-01-05 02:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(531929, 51950, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice lines here, I think though that I would have liked to have seen more definition in the snow... you might have done this with a different exposure.  The contrast is quite blatant.  Interesting idea though might have been cute to jazz it up just slightly with maybe a girl in a red coat (just an idea) sitting on the end of the fence, and you can see her footprints, or something like that... just taking it a step farther...</td>', 'Nice lines here, I think though that I would have liked to have seen more definition in the snow... you might have done this with a different exposure.  The contrast is quite blatant.  Interesting idea though might have been cute to jazz it up just slightly with maybe a girl in a red coat (just an idea) sitting on the end of the fence, and you can see her footprints, or something like that... just taking it a step farther...', '2004-01-05 02:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(531930, 52645, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great perspective here with the lines taking so home, nice colors with the setting sun... good definition in the snow.  This photo seems so simple, but it really strikes me... and so I''m going to give it a -10- I think it''s quite original and well done!  Good luck.</td>', 'Great perspective here with the lines taking so home, nice colors with the setting sun... good definition in the snow.  This photo seems so simple, but it really strikes me... and so I''m going to give it a -10- I think it''s quite original and well done!  Good luck.', '2004-01-05 02:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
