(532561, 50877, 7758, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh..... the Melbourne skyline.... how I miss it..... the Yarra River, Flinders St Station.... and the Rialto in the background! Taken from the Princes Bridge, or very close to it, unless I''m mistaken!<br/>Great shot, just a little too overexposed for mine.... the side of the clocktower on the station is a little blown out and the lights atop several of the buildings too. Overall though I think it''s a good shot, love the reflections in the water too.<br/>Good Luck, Todd. 8</td>', 'Ahhhh..... the Melbourne skyline.... how I miss it..... the Yarra River, Flinders St Station.... and the Rialto in the background! Taken from the Princes Bridge, or very close to it, unless I''m mistaken!Great shot, just a little too overexposed for mine.... the side of the clocktower on the station is a little blown out and the lights atop several of the buildings too. Overall though I think it''s a good shot, love the reflections in the water too.Good Luck, Todd. 8', '2004-01-05 15:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
