(532565, 52413, 4007, '<td valign="top">As someone who can''t stand pet/animal pictures with nothing to make them interesting or unique, I love this shot.  It has expression to it, and the fence makes for interesting compositional lines as well.  Good work.</td>', 'As someone who can''t stand pet/animal pictures with nothing to make them interesting or unique, I love this shot.  It has expression to it, and the fence makes for interesting compositional lines as well.  Good work.', '2004-01-05 15:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
