(532636, 52770, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting... I''m wondering, as I''m sure everyone else is what exactly you are shooting here... certainly a different subject.  I''m not sure if it would have been possible... but I think a tripod might have been good to try and still the guy who is right in the "sun" but maybe he just moved too much?  Interesting though.</td>', 'This is really interesting... I''m wondering, as I''m sure everyone else is what exactly you are shooting here... certainly a different subject.  I''m not sure if it would have been possible... but I think a tripod might have been good to try and still the guy who is right in the "sun" but maybe he just moved too much?  Interesting though.', '2004-01-05 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(532638, 52945, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject, and kind of abstract looking.  I think there are a few things that might have improved this... first and foremost, the piece that I think you are trying to focus on is dead center, it might have been better to crop more putting it perhaps in the bottom left hand corner?  Also I feel that a slight bit more dof might have helped.</td>', 'Beautiful subject, and kind of abstract looking.  I think there are a few things that might have improved this... first and foremost, the piece that I think you are trying to focus on is dead center, it might have been better to crop more putting it perhaps in the bottom left hand corner?  Also I feel that a slight bit more dof might have helped.', '2004-01-05 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(532652, 51867, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good composition here, nice choice to make it black and white... good dof, beautiful texture.  A nice solid photo.To me it doesn''t really have the WOW factor, but it''s still well done.</td>', 'Good composition here, nice choice to make it black and white... good dof, beautiful texture.  A nice solid photo.To me it doesn''t really have the WOW factor, but it''s still well done.', '2004-01-05 16:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(532654, 53096, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is sweet, but the pillow doesn''t really look exposed correctly, and I feel that maybe you should have zoomed in quite a bit more to really show what you are looking at.  I''m thinking maybe this was done with a wide angle, as the candles tilt out but I''m not for sure.  I just don''t think you need everything in the background etc. just makes it busy.</td>', 'This is sweet, but the pillow doesn''t really look exposed correctly, and I feel that maybe you should have zoomed in quite a bit more to really show what you are looking at.  I''m thinking maybe this was done with a wide angle, as the candles tilt out but I''m not for sure.  I just don''t think you need everything in the background etc. just makes it busy.', '2004-01-05 16:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(532657, 50518, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this... very abstract and very cool.  So are they clouds or is it snowy water?  I''m guessing you are looking up into clouds, as this looks to be a very hard structure to climb up to get a picture.  -9-</td>', 'I like this... very abstract and very cool.  So are they clouds or is it snowy water?  I''m guessing you are looking up into clouds, as this looks to be a very hard structure to climb up to get a picture.  -9-', '2004-01-05 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(532659, 52353, 4967, '<td valign="top">very dramatic and beautiful.  Nicely done with the reflections and the sillouhette.  I think it might have been nice to crop off some of the right hand side, but thats just my opinion.  Nice Dramatic sky!</td>', 'very dramatic and beautiful.  Nicely done with the reflections and the sillouhette.  I think it might have been nice to crop off some of the right hand side, but thats just my opinion.  Nice Dramatic sky!', '2004-01-05 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
