(532754, 52299, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the small details in the shot but it is just not a very interesting subject to me...sorry.</td>', 'I like the small details in the shot but it is just not a very interesting subject to me...sorry.', '2004-01-05 17:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(532811, 52299, 8054, '<td valign="top">This image works very well in b/w. Due to the angles and other factors/properties of the coverplate itself, you can see multiple repeating patterns and I really like that. If I were to do this again (or you) I think splashes of color here and there would be very interesting. And one more minor issue: levels. It''s hard to tell with the tight pattern how white those lines really are but they look a bit flat to me. Overall great image!</td>', 'This image works very well in b/w. Due to the angles and other factors/properties of the coverplate itself, you can see multiple repeating patterns and I really like that. If I were to do this again (or you) I think splashes of color here and there would be very interesting. And one more minor issue: levels. It''s hard to tell with the tight pattern how white those lines really are but they look a bit flat to me. Overall great image!', '2004-01-05 18:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(532814, 53054, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The street lighting gives enough information so you can see details of the brick wall and of the faded sign for hardware. Excellent job! 10</td>', 'Nicely done! The street lighting gives enough information so you can see details of the brick wall and of the faded sign for hardware. Excellent job! 10', '2004-01-05 18:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(532816, 52563, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a great macro shot: great DOF, amazing detail and to top it off: nice flare on the water drop. But there is one major and one minor flaw: I can see your reflection in the water drop (major) and it could have been cropped a bit tighter on the left side (minor). However, you did a good job!</td>', 'This is a great macro shot: great DOF, amazing detail and to top it off: nice flare on the water drop. But there is one major and one minor flaw: I can see your reflection in the water drop (major) and it could have been cropped a bit tighter on the left side (minor). However, you did a good job!', '2004-01-05 18:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(532818, 52563, 7778, '<td valign="top">&gt; 7</td>', '> 7', '2004-01-05 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(532822, 52775, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, good detail in the hair and other facial features and great skin tones. No annoying bright spots inherent with built-in flashes; it has a very warm feel. One think I might have done differently but does not detract from my score: border color. Since there is so much black in the image, I probably would have used a lighter/warmer border color vs black. Something to highlight the skin tones or even the color of the outfit but it would have to be thin as not to overpower the rest of the photograph. 9.</td>', 'Nicely framed, good detail in the hair and other facial features and great skin tones. No annoying bright spots inherent with built-in flashes; it has a very warm feel. One think I might have done differently but does not detract from my score: border color. Since there is so much black in the image, I probably would have used a lighter/warmer border color vs black. Something to highlight the skin tones or even the color of the outfit but it would have to be thin as not to overpower the rest of the photograph. 9.', '2004-01-05 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(532827, 52614, 8054, '<td valign="top">Main subject is too centered in this image. Lighting is a bit harsh especially for a close-up/macro. The leaf in the upper right is distracting because it''s large and covers up part of the flower which, seems to me, is the main subject of this image.</td>', 'Main subject is too centered in this image. Lighting is a bit harsh especially for a close-up/macro. The leaf in the upper right is distracting because it''s large and covers up part of the flower which, seems to me, is the main subject of this image.', '2004-01-05 19:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(532832, 53104, 8054, '<td valign="top">Vivid colors and nice composition. However, the focus seems a bit off only around the edges. I would have voted higher if the whole plant was in sharp focus.</td>', 'Vivid colors and nice composition. However, the focus seems a bit off only around the edges. I would have voted higher if the whole plant was in sharp focus.', '2004-01-05 19:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(532837, 53065, 8054, '<td valign="top">Cute doggie! Great action shot. My only complaint is the cropping. It could probably be cropped just a little bit more on the bottom but otherwise a great image.</td>', 'Cute doggie! Great action shot. My only complaint is the cropping. It could probably be cropped just a little bit more on the bottom but otherwise a great image.', '2004-01-05 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
