(533366, 52667, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely sepia toned photo. This of all the sepia colors is my favourite. The movement in the foreground gives your image life. I just can''t figure out how the title fits to the image though, or what it actually means.</td>', 'Lovely sepia toned photo. This of all the sepia colors is my favourite. The movement in the foreground gives your image life. I just can''t figure out how the title fits to the image though, or what it actually means.', '2004-01-06 11:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
