(533486, 53074, 9452, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect, i like this very much. The composition is just great, the blur in the second field makes it look like 3d effect. very cool.</td>', 'Almost perfect, i like this very much. The composition is just great, the blur in the second field makes it look like 3d effect. very cool.', '2004-01-06 13:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
