(533595, 53038, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot. Love the colours against the stark black background. Good Luck, Todd. 9.</td>', 'Great macro shot. Love the colours against the stark black background. Good Luck, Todd. 9.', '2004-01-06 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(533596, 52574, 7758, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity in this shot. I''m sure you''ve heard this a few times by now, but you should have fixed the two dark spots on the top right of the blue sky. Thats one of the reasons the editing rules were changed. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'I like the simplicity in this shot. I''m sure you''ve heard this a few times by now, but you should have fixed the two dark spots on the top right of the blue sky. Thats one of the reasons the editing rules were changed. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(533597, 52075, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Very colourful. Good Luck, Todd.</td>', 'Nicely done. Very colourful. Good Luck, Todd.', '2004-01-06 16:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(533599, 52473, 7758, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, nicely captures the expression on the faces but also the short depth of field really isolates the main subject. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Good action shot, nicely captures the expression on the faces but also the short depth of field really isolates the main subject. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(533601, 52576, 7758, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape shot. Not much I would do differently. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Lovely landscape shot. Not much I would do differently. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(533602, 53109, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colours do alot to bring this shot to life. Well done. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Nice rich colours do alot to bring this shot to life. Well done. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(533603, 53042, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great snow scene and lovely rich colour in the sky. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Great snow scene and lovely rich colour in the sky. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(533608, 52311, 7758, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. At first I thought it might have benefited from cropping the bases out but now I sort of think that it helps to ground the image and help the viewer understand the shot. What I don''t like is the dark line right under the front glass. I''m tipping I''m not the first to mention it. Get rid of the line and I think the shot would be first class. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Really nice shot. At first I thought it might have benefited from cropping the bases out but now I sort of think that it helps to ground the image and help the viewer understand the shot. What I don''t like is the dark line right under the front glass. I''m tipping I''m not the first to mention it. Get rid of the line and I think the shot would be first class. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(533609, 53101, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice deep, rich colours in this shot really bring it to life. I also think that the early sun really helps to throw some nice deep, dark shadows. Just a little unsure on the sharpness, I''m guessing it''s probably a resizing thing. Great work. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Nice deep, rich colours in this shot really bring it to life. I also think that the early sun really helps to throw some nice deep, dark shadows. Just a little unsure on the sharpness, I''m guessing it''s probably a resizing thing. Great work. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(533610, 52766, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great mood to this shot, good job on the exposure too. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Great mood to this shot, good job on the exposure too. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(533612, 53060, 7758, '<td valign="top">The reflections in this shot are amazing, I just feel the tree on the left is a little distracting. I feel like I want to move a little to the right to get it out of frame, but that''s just me. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'The reflections in this shot are amazing, I just feel the tree on the left is a little distracting. I feel like I want to move a little to the right to get it out of frame, but that''s just me. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(533613, 50836, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The shallow depth of field really helps to make your subject stand out. I might have shot this a little tighter, but that''s just me. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Nice shot. The shallow depth of field really helps to make your subject stand out. I might have shot this a little tighter, but that''s just me. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(533614, 53006, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great shot and nice funky lighting. I might have bumped up the contrast on this a little personally. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Great shot and nice funky lighting. I might have bumped up the contrast on this a little personally. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(533615, 52353, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great mood to this shot. Just a little unsure on your focus. Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Great mood to this shot. Just a little unsure on your focus. Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-01-06 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(533616, 52707, 10067, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture..  The motion and action cought in this photo is incredible!<br/>(&lt;PaKa&gt;)</td>', 'Amazing picture..  The motion and action cought in this photo is incredible!(<PaKa>)', '2004-01-06 16:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(533634, 52988, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is so cool, I still haven''t figured it out and can''t wait to see just how this was done, I''ve turned it upside down, sideways and still can''t quite figure it out.  Excellent.  A 10</td>', 'This is so cool, I still haven''t figured it out and can''t wait to see just how this was done, I''ve turned it upside down, sideways and still can''t quite figure it out.  Excellent.  A 10', '2004-01-06 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(533637, 49898, 12448, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this little guy looks so familier :)  He''s a doll and very little you could do to improve on this shot.  A 10</td>', 'Gosh, this little guy looks so familier :)  He''s a doll and very little you could do to improve on this shot.  A 10', '2004-01-06 17:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(533639, 52311, 12448, '<td valign="top">These glasses look sooooooooooooo familier, I wonder, LOL! :)<br/> <br/>I love this shot, very inventive and creative.  The lighting is excellent and I love the set up but the black line across the bottom is a bit distracting to me.  Started with an 8, going to a 9, would be a 10 without that line ;(</td>', 'These glasses look sooooooooooooo familier, I wonder, LOL! :) I love this shot, very inventive and creative.  The lighting is excellent and I love the set up but the black line across the bottom is a bit distracting to me.  Started with an 8, going to a 9, would be a 10 without that line ;(', '2004-01-06 17:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(533641, 49435, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is someone who came home or on their way out?  A wonderful idea but the shot itself really leaves me wanting.  The set up is a bit off, the flag pole looks like it''s coming out of his head and the shot itself is a bit blurry.  I think you wanted the flag in the shot but the set up could have been different.  The cropping is a bit loose on the sides and if he was more to the side of the flag pole. A 4<br/> <br/>Whoever it is, please tell them thank you from me and my family for their service and willingness to serve.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is someone who came home or on their way out?  A wonderful idea but the shot itself really leaves me wanting.  The set up is a bit off, the flag pole looks like it''s coming out of his head and the shot itself is a bit blurry.  I think you wanted the flag in the shot but the set up could have been different.  The cropping is a bit loose on the sides and if he was more to the side of the flag pole. A 4 Whoever it is, please tell them thank you from me and my family for their service and willingness to serve.', '2004-01-06 17:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(533646, 53015, 12448, '<td valign="top">A neat idea and does fit the title, but the actual shot leaves me wanting.  It''s fuzzy and the cropping seems off, maybe a bit off the left of the shot and littl emore to the right to include the rest of the pirates garb.  A 4</td>', 'A neat idea and does fit the title, but the actual shot leaves me wanting.  It''s fuzzy and the cropping seems off, maybe a bit off the left of the shot and littl emore to the right to include the rest of the pirates garb.  A 4', '2004-01-06 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(533655, 52910, 3554, '<td valign="top">The dog detracts quite a bit</td>', 'The dog detracts quite a bit', '2004-01-06 17:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(533658, 51950, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think if the camera were lower it would have been better.</td>', 'I think if the camera were lower it would have been better.', '2004-01-06 17:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
