(534372, 52424, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The sharpness and dof are very good.  I would have likes a less tighter crop, but minimally.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The sharpness and dof are very good.  I would have likes a less tighter crop, but minimally.', '2004-01-07 07:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(534373, 50877, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great in all ways.</td>', 'Great in all ways.', '2004-01-07 07:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(534377, 52390, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrasts and speed.</td>', 'Nice use of contrasts and speed.', '2004-01-07 07:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(534379, 52576, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great use of lines.</td>', 'Great use of lines.', '2004-01-07 07:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(534383, 51871, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would have helped.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would have helped.', '2004-01-07 07:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(534385, 52895, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great Owl, I would have cropped it more vertical though.</td>', 'Great Owl, I would have cropped it more vertical though.', '2004-01-07 07:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(534386, 53066, 6999, '<td valign="top">Of it''s type this is well done - but you''ve taken the skin smoothing trick so far it''s reminiscent of the worst kind of over-processed glamour photography, and effectively taken all the humanity out of your subject. It''s also left a peculiar shading around the inside of the left eye. Just too much of the selective blurring, really. Lighting is good, catch-light in the eyes is good, naturalness of the model is good.</td>', 'Of it''s type this is well done - but you''ve taken the skin smoothing trick so far it''s reminiscent of the worst kind of over-processed glamour photography, and effectively taken all the humanity out of your subject. It''s also left a peculiar shading around the inside of the left eye. Just too much of the selective blurring, really. Lighting is good, catch-light in the eyes is good, naturalness of the model is good.', '2004-01-07 07:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(534387, 52660, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up view.</td>', 'Nice close-up view.', '2004-01-07 07:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(534389, 52545, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up and contrasts.</td>', 'Nice close-up and contrasts.', '2004-01-07 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(534391, 52645, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice "pink" sunrise/set effect.</td>', 'Nice "pink" sunrise/set effect.', '2004-01-07 07:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(534393, 52803, 3569, '<td valign="top">Definitely colorful.</td>', 'Definitely colorful.', '2004-01-07 07:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(534394, 52311, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat trick. Lines at the bottom of frame and where background edges meet are a shame, and there seem to be one or two markes that could happily have been cloned out. Like the colour, and your handling of light is an object lesson.</td>', 'Neat trick. Lines at the bottom of frame and where background edges meet are a shame, and there seem to be one or two markes that could happily have been cloned out. Like the colour, and your handling of light is an object lesson.', '2004-01-07 07:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(534395, 52663, 3569, '<td valign="top">Just nice....</td>', 'Just nice....', '2004-01-07 07:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(534396, 52753, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO, a bit too busy.</td>', 'IMO, a bit too busy.', '2004-01-07 07:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(534400, 52311, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think it is very good, but not perfect. I like the soft edge definition of the glass with the darker blue, and I like the overall color tones and I like how clean the image is. Good overall appeal. The edge definition of the second glass is a bit dark on the right hand side and the line-up of the fourth glass is not perfect, it is a bit too far to the left. I would have tried to remove the edges of the table, both in front and at the back, Since you are using a light from the back through a translucent background a piece of semi-transparent paper flowing from the table on to the background might have done the trick.</td>', 'I think it is very good, but not perfect. I like the soft edge definition of the glass with the darker blue, and I like the overall color tones and I like how clean the image is. Good overall appeal. The edge definition of the second glass is a bit dark on the right hand side and the line-up of the fourth glass is not perfect, it is a bit too far to the left. I would have tried to remove the edges of the table, both in front and at the back, Since you are using a light from the back through a translucent background a piece of semi-transparent paper flowing from the table on to the background might have done the trick.', '2004-01-07 07:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(534402, 53054, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - I have little more to say :-) Perfect execution, perfect composition. I''d almost buy this, except i think the moonlight edging the top of the building doesn''t work for me - have no idea why, even after a long look, but I think it takes away some of the two-dimensional quality of the building''s facade. Great work.</td>', 'Beautiful - I have little more to say :-) Perfect execution, perfect composition. I''d almost buy this, except i think the moonlight edging the top of the building doesn''t work for me - have no idea why, even after a long look, but I think it takes away some of the two-dimensional quality of the building''s facade. Great work.', '2004-01-07 07:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(534407, 52811, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work. Bringing the hut and tree further into frame wouldn''t hurt the composition - you could keep it that close to the bottom, and keep the impact of the negative space, but like this it is really only cursorily in shot.</td>', 'Good work. Bringing the hut and tree further into frame wouldn''t hurt the composition - you could keep it that close to the bottom, and keep the impact of the negative space, but like this it is really only cursorily in shot.', '2004-01-07 07:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(534410, 51927, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Not sure about the sheer amount of the silhouetted foreground - losing more than half of it would give you a stronger compositional shape across the frame from the tree to the table to the very parallel lines between ground and horizon ... just a thought.</td>', 'Nice work. Not sure about the sheer amount of the silhouetted foreground - losing more than half of it would give you a stronger compositional shape across the frame from the tree to the table to the very parallel lines between ground and horizon ... just a thought.', '2004-01-07 08:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(534413, 52895, 6999, '<td valign="top">cool shot - though a pity you couldn''t have isolated the thing a touch more against the background. And a brief note about the title ... it actually makes me doubt the ''in the wild'' element of the shot and look for teltale giveaways of this being faked more than I would otherwise.</td>', 'cool shot - though a pity you couldn''t have isolated the thing a touch more against the background. And a brief note about the title ... it actually makes me doubt the ''in the wild'' element of the shot and look for teltale giveaways of this being faked more than I would otherwise.', '2004-01-07 08:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(534483, 52227, 4049, '<td valign="top">nice focus</td>', 'nice focus', '2004-01-07 09:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(534755, 52770, 8722, '<td valign="top">Wow! This image is wonderfully complex. I can''t even begin to grasp the amount of depth and detail in this picture. Very good. 9.</td>', 'Wow! This image is wonderfully complex. I can''t even begin to grasp the amount of depth and detail in this picture. Very good. 9.', '2004-01-07 12:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(534762, 52353, 8722, '<td valign="top">Majestic image. My favorite in this contest so far. Seems to me as though it''s reflecting everything beautiful in nature. 10</td>', 'Majestic image. My favorite in this contest so far. Seems to me as though it''s reflecting everything beautiful in nature. 10', '2004-01-07 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(534767, 51950, 8722, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The curves and angles are inspiring. Reminds me of the moon... :) 9</td>', 'Beautiful image. The curves and angles are inspiring. Reminds me of the moon... :) 9', '2004-01-07 12:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(535125, 52667, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of the overall scene, but the blur is really distracting.</td>', 'Nice rendition of the overall scene, but the blur is really distracting.', '2004-01-07 15:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(535127, 53110, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and exposure, and nice composition.</td>', 'Great lighting and exposure, and nice composition.', '2004-01-07 15:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(535129, 53014, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice study in lighting aqnd shape. The color is a little too warm to be natural.</td>', 'Nice study in lighting aqnd shape. The color is a little too warm to be natural.', '2004-01-07 15:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(535269, 53074, 9906, '<td valign="top">The leaf looks a little bit staged, but this is the best detail I''ve seen in snow yet...<br/>TC</td>', 'The leaf looks a little bit staged, but this is the best detail I''ve seen in snow yet...TC', '2004-01-07 16:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(535276, 51972, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of soft focus!  Something doesn''t seem quite right here compositionally though and I can''t put my finger on it.  It maybe the straight on angle of the shot or the constraining crop...  I''m gonna come back to this one and if I figure out what it is I''ll adjust this note!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice use of soft focus!  Something doesn''t seem quite right here compositionally though and I can''t put my finger on it.  It maybe the straight on angle of the shot or the constraining crop...  I''m gonna come back to this one and if I figure out what it is I''ll adjust this note!TC', '2004-01-07 16:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(535280, 52577, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice use of DOF and composition.  I''m not sure I like the crop, but it is effective!  The only thing I would change within this crop is the reflection in the eye is a bit much.  Overall: an excellent portrait without using standard portrait techniques!<br/>TC<br/>PS:  Did you work this one up as B/W or two tone?  You have an awesome depth of color tones to play around with.  I would love to see this after the challenge if you have done it, or have permission to do it up myself!!!<br/></td>', 'This is a very nice use of DOF and composition.  I''m not sure I like the crop, but it is effective!  The only thing I would change within this crop is the reflection in the eye is a bit much.  Overall: an excellent portrait without using standard portrait techniques!TCPS:  Did you work this one up as B/W or two tone?  You have an awesome depth of color tones to play around with.  I would love to see this after the challenge if you have done it, or have permission to do it up myself!!!', '2004-01-07 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(535281, 53067, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, call me old school, but I don''t care for nose rings...  Not a bad shot overall, but don''t care for the selective desaturation.  I don''t think that it has a real effect here.  Also your border is not even all around.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry, call me old school, but I don''t care for nose rings...  Not a bad shot overall, but don''t care for the selective desaturation.  I don''t think that it has a real effect here.  Also your border is not even all around.TC', '2004-01-07 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(535283, 51775, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect here!  I can''t wait to see how much PS you had to do to achieve this.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cool effect here!  I can''t wait to see how much PS you had to do to achieve this.TC', '2004-01-07 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(535289, 51606, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks a little underexposed...Especially around the insect itself.  Flower looks good, but the white is a little dull.<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks a little underexposed...Especially around the insect itself.  Flower looks good, but the white is a little dull.TC', '2004-01-07 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(535295, 52945, 9906, '<td valign="top">Focus appears to be a little TOO soft here.  A touch more lighting or a boost in levels would help to bring out the shadows more also.  Nice composition!<br/>TC</td>', 'Focus appears to be a little TOO soft here.  A touch more lighting or a boost in levels would help to bring out the shadows more also.  Nice composition!TC', '2004-01-07 17:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(535299, 52834, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love these types of shots.  Great subtleties in the sky colors and background.  Love the silhouette!  Only wish you''d have gotten all the tree in shot...<br/>TC</td>', 'I love these types of shots.  Great subtleties in the sky colors and background.  Love the silhouette!  Only wish you''d have gotten all the tree in shot...TC', '2004-01-07 17:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(535320, 53103, 15642, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2004-01-07 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(535322, 49435, 15642, '<td valign="top">Composition could''ve been better.</td>', 'Composition could''ve been better.', '2004-01-07 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(535324, 52930, 15642, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the vignette around the picture. Very nice nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the vignette around the picture. Very nice nonetheless.', '2004-01-07 17:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(535326, 52511, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice. The title doesn''t jibe, but very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice. The title doesn''t jibe, but very nice shot.', '2004-01-07 17:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(535327, 53108, 15642, '<td valign="top">I may have cropped out the guardrail, but a nice pic of rural life.</td>', 'I may have cropped out the guardrail, but a nice pic of rural life.', '2004-01-07 17:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(535332, 52909, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not dead, just resting.</td>', 'Not dead, just resting.', '2004-01-07 17:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(535333, 53066, 15642, '<td valign="top">Pretty. The face/skintones look overly re-touched. My imagination?</td>', 'Pretty. The face/skintones look overly re-touched. My imagination?', '2004-01-07 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(535334, 53009, 15642, '<td valign="top">I''m always a sucker for a kid in his jammies. Very cute shot!</td>', 'I''m always a sucker for a kid in his jammies. Very cute shot!', '2004-01-07 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(535338, 53093, 15642, '<td valign="top">She sure looks the part (except for the way she holds that guitar). Very cool.</td>', 'She sure looks the part (except for the way she holds that guitar). Very cool.', '2004-01-07 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(535339, 51927, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice, but foreground a bit too dark for me.</td>', 'Nice, but foreground a bit too dark for me.', '2004-01-07 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(535341, 50104, 15642, '<td valign="top">Uninteresting composition. Nice bike, though!</td>', 'Uninteresting composition. Nice bike, though!', '2004-01-07 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(535579, 51959, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats  a great picture.  Not sure how it will do, since it does not have alot of eye candy.<br/> <br/>But a super photo none the less.</td>', 'Thats  a great picture.  Not sure how it will do, since it does not have alot of eye candy. But a super photo none the less.', '2004-01-07 21:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(535584, 52075, 11034, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the feel of motion. A of centered composition could do better, but i know how difficul it be.<br/> <br/>Great shoot.</td>', 'I like the color and the feel of motion. A of centered composition could do better, but i know how difficul it be. Great shoot.', '2004-01-07 21:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(535589, 52803, 11034, '<td valign="top">A little bit confution on the composition, but great colours.<br/> <br/>Luck.<br/></td>', 'A little bit confution on the composition, but great colours. Luck.', '2004-01-07 21:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(535591, 53034, 11034, '<td valign="top">A portrait comp could do better in this. A lot of distracting thinghs on sides. Good luck.</td>', 'A portrait comp could do better in this. A lot of distracting thinghs on sides. Good luck.', '2004-01-07 21:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(535596, 49435, 11034, '<td valign="top">The flag or the soldier? You must decide wich dominate the shoot. Good try. Luck.</td>', 'The flag or the soldier? You must decide wich dominate the shoot. Good try. Luck.', '2004-01-07 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(535600, 53032, 11034, '<td valign="top">I like the sunbeams. Good luck</td>', 'I like the sunbeams. Good luck', '2004-01-07 21:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(535604, 52563, 11034, '<td valign="top">Make it portraid and i give you a ten. Good luck.</td>', 'Make it portraid and i give you a ten. Good luck.', '2004-01-07 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(535807, 51671, 6668, '<td valign="top">Interesting sculpture...I like the background that you used.</td>', 'Interesting sculpture...I like the background that you used.', '2004-01-08 00:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(535812, 52926, 4767, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photo!  It certainly isn''t complemented by the frame, unfortunately.</td>', 'What a lovely photo!  It certainly isn''t complemented by the frame, unfortunately.', '2004-01-08 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(535816, 53107, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors, nice work. 10</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors, nice work. 10', '2004-01-08 00:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(535817, 53103, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.</td>', 'Interesting photo.', '2004-01-08 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(535818, 51406, 6668, '<td valign="top">don''t care for this border with this shot at all.</td>', 'don''t care for this border with this shot at all.', '2004-01-08 00:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(535825, 53096, 6668, '<td valign="top">The placement of the two side candelabras is distracting to me....in my opinion...they should both be either all the way in or all the way out of the shot. just seems to be to much going on without any real order.</td>', 'The placement of the two side candelabras is distracting to me....in my opinion...they should both be either all the way in or all the way out of the shot. just seems to be to much going on without any real order.', '2004-01-08 00:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(535826, 52492, 4767, '<td valign="top">A Siberian Husky goes to school?</td>', 'A Siberian Husky goes to school?', '2004-01-08 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(535829, 52442, 6668, '<td valign="top">very nice...the only problem I have are the two glaring lights just right of the center, my eye is drawn to them and it distracts from the rest of the image, but otherwise a simply gorgous shot. 9</td>', 'very nice...the only problem I have are the two glaring lights just right of the center, my eye is drawn to them and it distracts from the rest of the image, but otherwise a simply gorgous shot. 9', '2004-01-08 01:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(535832, 53068, 6668, '<td valign="top">Although I am sure this is a nice shot in  your family, there is really nothing that makes it stand out to someone who doesn''t know the women in the shot, it looks to me like a family christmas snapshot. <br/> <br/>Although I m ust agree with the title...she really does seem to love it! :-) 5</td>', 'Although I am sure this is a nice shot in  your family, there is really nothing that makes it stand out to someone who doesn''t know the women in the shot, it looks to me like a family christmas snapshot.  Although I m ust agree with the title...she really does seem to love it! :-) 5', '2004-01-08 01:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(535834, 53054, 8816, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been a fantastic entry for the ''After Dark'' challenge!  Very nice nonetheless! 8</td>', 'Would''ve been a fantastic entry for the ''After Dark'' challenge!  Very nice nonetheless! 8', '2004-01-08 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(535836, 52707, 6668, '<td valign="top">What does the tiger on the right have in his mouth?<br/> <br/>Nice capture, the branches in the front are a little distracting though.</td>', 'What does the tiger on the right have in his mouth? Nice capture, the branches in the front are a little distracting though.', '2004-01-08 01:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(535839, 52483, 8816, '<td valign="top">Nicely takin photo, very clean!  You should offer this to the local police department for an advertising photo or something!  8</td>', 'Nicely takin photo, very clean!  You should offer this to the local police department for an advertising photo or something!  8', '2004-01-08 01:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(535843, 49898, 4767, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonality - excellent shot!</td>', 'Lovely tonality - excellent shot!', '2004-01-08 01:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(535845, 51867, 8816, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The DOF is enticing, and really draws me in and the way the leaves are positioned leads me straight to the leaf that is in focus and has the least amount of snow on it!  Very well thought out composition!  Lighting is nice, as is the toning of the photo!  Overall VERY nice! 9</td>', 'I love this shot.  The DOF is enticing, and really draws me in and the way the leaves are positioned leads me straight to the leaf that is in focus and has the least amount of snow on it!  Very well thought out composition!  Lighting is nice, as is the toning of the photo!  Overall VERY nice! 9', '2004-01-08 01:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(535849, 53043, 4767, '<td valign="top">Hope that wasn''t in someone''s Stocking...</td>', 'Hope that wasn''t in someone''s Stocking...', '2004-01-08 01:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(535861, 52226, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment on the cake and roses.  I would have liked to see the expressions on the faces of the b &amp; g.  Wonderful detail on the bodice of the gown - crystal and buttons - but also on the L-brackets on upper left, which distracts my eye.</td>', 'Nice treatment on the cake and roses.  I would have liked to see the expressions on the faces of the b & g.  Wonderful detail on the bodice of the gown - crystal and buttons - but also on the L-brackets on upper left, which distracts my eye.', '2004-01-08 01:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(535870, 53003, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Gorgeous children!</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Gorgeous children!', '2004-01-08 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(535872, 53112, 4767, '<td valign="top">Is this the ''Christmas in Killarney'' that Bing Crosby used to sing about?</td>', 'Is this the ''Christmas in Killarney'' that Bing Crosby used to sing about?', '2004-01-08 01:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(535874, 52770, 4767, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!</td>', 'WOW!!!', '2004-01-08 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(535903, 53006, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed with the window reflections, or lack thereof.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed with the window reflections, or lack thereof.', '2004-01-08 01:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(535905, 52660, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love this, especially that there is some good colour involved.</td>', 'Love this, especially that there is some good colour involved.', '2004-01-08 01:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(535908, 51410, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nice 3D feeling to this.</td>', 'Very nice 3D feeling to this.', '2004-01-08 01:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(535912, 53074, 10170, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, the leaf looks almost 3D</td>', 'Beautifully done, the leaf looks almost 3D', '2004-01-08 02:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(535916, 49898, 10170, '<td valign="top">Perfect, can''t fault it.  Real cute kid as well :)</td>', 'Perfect, can''t fault it.  Real cute kid as well :)', '2004-01-08 02:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(535932, 52707, 13728, '<td valign="top">Wow, what were they ripping apart?  Not your car I hope!:-)</td>', 'Wow, what were they ripping apart?  Not your car I hope!:-)', '2004-01-08 02:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(535934, 51849, 13728, '<td valign="top">That didn''t fly I heard</td>', 'That didn''t fly I heard', '2004-01-08 02:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(535935, 52135, 13728, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the bird</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the bird', '2004-01-08 02:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(535936, 52985, 13728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-01-08 02:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(535939, 52660, 13728, '<td valign="top">great expression..if snakes have expressions</td>', 'great expression..if snakes have expressions', '2004-01-08 02:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(535940, 53108, 13728, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and the lighting, would have loved it cropped in from the bottom..too much stuff on the bottom isn''t interesting</td>', 'I like this shot and the lighting, would have loved it cropped in from the bottom..too much stuff on the bottom isn''t interesting', '2004-01-08 02:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(535977, 52793, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the overall mood and soft gray tints, with details in the trees still clearly visible. Only thing is that a more natural environment might have been more attractive. here the straight road and the fence in front of the trees damage some of the atmosphere.</td>', 'I like the overall mood and soft gray tints, with details in the trees still clearly visible. Only thing is that a more natural environment might have been more attractive. here the straight road and the fence in front of the trees damage some of the atmosphere.', '2004-01-08 05:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(535979, 52662, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene to capture those northern lights in. The distracting element for me is the purple color on the boat in front. (don''t know if it is DPC legal, but could it have been removed by desaturation magenta and/or blue, without affecting the other colors ?).</td>', 'Very nice scene to capture those northern lights in. The distracting element for me is the purple color on the boat in front. (don''t know if it is DPC legal, but could it have been removed by desaturation magenta and/or blue, without affecting the other colors ?).', '2004-01-08 05:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(536014, 52122, 13812, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2004-01-08 07:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(536081, 49486, 8610, '<td valign="top">I don´t like the blue border, Just black border would be fine</td>', 'I don´t like the blue border, Just black border would be fine', '2004-01-08 09:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(536116, 53092, 6073, '<td valign="top">Very charming photo.  Conveys a great sense of mood and playfulness, so top honors for that.  As far as the technical details.  Lighting &amp; framing.  You took this at night w/the curtain flash, which you may or may not have been able to help.  The shadows are distracting and there isn''t enough light on the background to contrast your subject.  Also the lack of light does not allow for details to show up on the primary subject and the dough.  You did a good job with what you had though.  <br/> <br/>Framing.  You''ve got negative space to the right of the subject, which was needed to show the cookie dough.  This negative space must be balanced to the left as well, and it is not.  I am not sure if this was cropped out before or after, but leaving just a little more in would have help me from thinking the hand was almost lost in the shot.  <br/> <br/>As far as candids go, this is a great shot.  Looks like everyone was having a ball.</td>', 'Very charming photo.  Conveys a great sense of mood and playfulness, so top honors for that.  As far as the technical details.  Lighting & framing.  You took this at night w/the curtain flash, which you may or may not have been able to help.  The shadows are distracting and there isn''t enough light on the background to contrast your subject.  Also the lack of light does not allow for details to show up on the primary subject and the dough.  You did a good job with what you had though.   Framing.  You''ve got negative space to the right of the subject, which was needed to show the cookie dough.  This negative space must be balanced to the left as well, and it is not.  I am not sure if this was cropped out before or after, but leaving just a little more in would have help me from thinking the hand was almost lost in the shot.   As far as candids go, this is a great shot.  Looks like everyone was having a ball.', '2004-01-08 10:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(536119, 49898, 4400, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo!! 10</td>', 'Lovely photo!! 10', '2004-01-08 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(536132, 52413, 6073, '<td valign="top">Strong mood, excellent framing and a great capture.  The only weak point I see here is the lighting/exposure.  I''d think this might make a great reshoot.  Try metering for the grass beyond the fence...the portion that is blown out.  Stop that down 1, step back a bit and fire off the curtain flash.  If this doesn''t work, play around with the manual setting until you can get the foreground lite w/o leaving the background so hot.  I think you can still get the shadow on the dog''s face while still holding on to the dramatic lighting.  <br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Strong mood, excellent framing and a great capture.  The only weak point I see here is the lighting/exposure.  I''d think this might make a great reshoot.  Try metering for the grass beyond the fence...the portion that is blown out.  Stop that down 1, step back a bit and fire off the curtain flash.  If this doesn''t work, play around with the manual setting until you can get the foreground lite w/o leaving the background so hot.  I think you can still get the shadow on the dog''s face while still holding on to the dramatic lighting.   Good luck.', '2004-01-08 10:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(536133, 53074, 6073, '<td valign="top">Just a good photograph all the way around.  Nice job.</td>', 'Just a good photograph all the way around.  Nice job.', '2004-01-08 10:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(536135, 52135, 6073, '<td valign="top">That better not be a store bought swan''s wing.  <br/> <br/>I like the lighting on the lower right, how it picks up the details of the feather.  It''s ashame we couldn''t get that effect across the entire wing.</td>', 'That better not be a store bought swan''s wing.   I like the lighting on the lower right, how it picks up the details of the feather.  It''s ashame we couldn''t get that effect across the entire wing.', '2004-01-08 10:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(536140, 50097, 6073, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Good exposure, good compo.  The only negative thing I noticed was the Tilt.  This is an easy fix in PS.  Play around with it.  The castle would need to drop the left side just a degree or two.  <br/> <br/>This photo makes me which I was there for the celebration.  High marks!</td>', 'Great capture!  Good exposure, good compo.  The only negative thing I noticed was the Tilt.  This is an easy fix in PS.  Play around with it.  The castle would need to drop the left side just a degree or two.   This photo makes me which I was there for the celebration.  High marks!', '2004-01-08 10:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
