(536713, 49898, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like it.  One thing though, at least on my computer screen, the dark portion of the hair (towards the back) makes it look like he''s wearing a little yarmulka (sp?).  The skintones and the eyes are really good.  I''m so glad you didn''t use the "glow" effect that is so common now, together with the "plastified" skin - it''s much better this way.</td>', 'Nice, I like it.  One thing though, at least on my computer screen, the dark portion of the hair (towards the back) makes it look like he''s wearing a little yarmulka (sp?).  The skintones and the eyes are really good.  I''m so glad you didn''t use the "glow" effect that is so common now, together with the "plastified" skin - it''s much better this way.', '2004-01-08 18:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(536714, 52413, 2302, '<td valign="top">I believe that pictures of pets or animals are really hard to do because like people portraits you have to make the viewer care about the suject in order for the shot to be effective.  My first reaction was "Ohh - poor Pup"  - so you got me there. Besides that factor - great framing and I love the two tone approach here for colors. = 9</td>', 'I believe that pictures of pets or animals are really hard to do because like people portraits you have to make the viewer care about the suject in order for the shot to be effective.  My first reaction was "Ohh - poor Pup"  - so you got me there. Besides that factor - great framing and I love the two tone approach here for colors. = 9', '2004-01-08 18:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
