(536777, 53071, 6073, '<td valign="top">These colors and these lines work very very well in this photograph.  The fact that this is a night shot, makes it even better.  Great job on exposure control, and excellent framing. The only thing that holds me back from a 10 is the foreground lighting.  Your exposure was long enough for you to hold a flash and bump the front, which would have added just a bit.  Very well done.<br/></td>', 'These colors and these lines work very very well in this photograph.  The fact that this is a night shot, makes it even better.  Great job on exposure control, and excellent framing. The only thing that holds me back from a 10 is the foreground lighting.  Your exposure was long enough for you to hold a flash and bump the front, which would have added just a bit.  Very well done.', '2004-01-08 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(536810, 51959, 6073, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but a little disturbing.  Is this for real, or set up? <br/> <br/>Good color/tone, but there is some really tough competition in this challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting photo, but a little disturbing.  Is this for real, or set up?  Good color/tone, but there is some really tough competition in this challenge. ', '2004-01-08 20:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(536811, 53010, 6073, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me want to be there to see this in person.  Wow, now that looks cold.  I''m looking forward to reading your word''s on this one.  Great capture, great exposure control.  <br/> <br/>I''d love to see this have one more color in it.  Maybe a bon fire in the lower left foreground.  Enough to bounce off the wall, like the orange light in the back left?  <br/> <br/>Very interesting....High marks here.....</td>', 'This picture makes me want to be there to see this in person.  Wow, now that looks cold.  I''m looking forward to reading your word''s on this one.  Great capture, great exposure control.   I''d love to see this have one more color in it.  Maybe a bon fire in the lower left foreground.  Enough to bounce off the wall, like the orange light in the back left?   Very interesting....High marks here.....', '2004-01-08 20:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(536812, 52811, 14012, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative space</td>', 'Interesting use of negative space', '2004-01-08 20:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(536815, 52563, 6073, '<td valign="top">Darn good photo, but we just saw this in the Motivational Poster challenge.  Lots of dust here on the lense or on inside your camera.  I''m counting atleast 10 spots that I can see at a glance. <br/> <br/>I''m guessing you chose this photo for the sparkle on the lower left side of the drop of water?  Nice touch.</td>', 'Darn good photo, but we just saw this in the Motivational Poster challenge.  Lots of dust here on the lense or on inside your camera.  I''m counting atleast 10 spots that I can see at a glance.  I''m guessing you chose this photo for the sparkle on the lower left side of the drop of water?  Nice touch.', '2004-01-08 20:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(536816, 53060, 6073, '<td valign="top">This would make for a better photo in the fall.  It is still good though.</td>', 'This would make for a better photo in the fall.  It is still good though.', '2004-01-08 20:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
