(536829, 53066, 6073, '<td valign="top">Woa.... this has neat image written all over it.  If you didn\''t neat this until it crashed your PC, I wanna know how you did this?  Seriously!  Shoot me a note.  <br/> <br/>Awesome potrait.  Great subject.  I really like the hair halfway over the right eye. She almost looks a little dirty, but she really isn''t?????  <br/> <br/>I wanna see this shot with a different background, but with the white, it still marks really high.  I think a diff background color other then that shirt color would work better. <br/></td>', 'Woa.... this has neat image written all over it.  If you didn\''t neat this until it crashed your PC, I wanna know how you did this?  Seriously!  Shoot me a note.   Awesome potrait.  Great subject.  I really like the hair halfway over the right eye. She almost looks a little dirty, but she really isn''t?????   I wanna see this shot with a different background, but with the white, it still marks really high.  I think a diff background color other then that shirt color would work better. ', '2004-01-08 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
