(537010, 51959, 6668, '<td valign="top">kind of a disturbing shot when you really look at what is going on here, I also like the use of sepia tones here, but to me the positioning of the people in the shot doesn''t seem natural, also seems to be so much of the story we are missing out on. 7</td>', 'kind of a disturbing shot when you really look at what is going on here, I also like the use of sepia tones here, but to me the positioning of the people in the shot doesn''t seem natural, also seems to be so much of the story we are missing out on. 7', '2004-01-08 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(537049, 52075, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is pretty!  Just curious if these actually were all in one shot, or if this is a combined picture from photoshop?  Very cool though!  Lots of awesomely bright colors.</td>', 'This is pretty!  Just curious if these actually were all in one shot, or if this is a combined picture from photoshop?  Very cool though!  Lots of awesomely bright colors.', '2004-01-09 02:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(537053, 53069, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think you could have cropped down quite a bit as well as cropped up from the bottom quite a bit.  I like the scene though, I think you used a star filter?  VERY nice!  Love the color and the perfect sillouhettes.  just really cropping and foccusing on the scenery would have helped.  -9-</td>', 'I think you could have cropped down quite a bit as well as cropped up from the bottom quite a bit.  I like the scene though, I think you used a star filter?  VERY nice!  Love the color and the perfect sillouhettes.  just really cropping and foccusing on the scenery would have helped.  -9-', '2004-01-09 02:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(537056, 51606, 4967, '<td valign="top">The bee looks kind of dead?  is he actually alive?  He looks huge for that flower!  I think I would have liked to have seen an even closer crop on this.  good use of DOF though.</td>', 'The bee looks kind of dead?  is he actually alive?  He looks huge for that flower!  I think I would have liked to have seen an even closer crop on this.  good use of DOF though.', '2004-01-09 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(537062, 52563, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped off some off the left side.. and made it more vertical, Great job with DOF, and the picture is intriguing!  ILove the star on the side of the droplet... very well done!</td>', 'I think I would have cropped off some off the left side.. and made it more vertical, Great job with DOF, and the picture is intriguing!  ILove the star on the side of the droplet... very well done!', '2004-01-09 02:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(537064, 52707, 4967, '<td valign="top">Woah!  Is this at a zoo... and was whatever is in the tigers mouths just fresh dead?  if so AMAZING shot... I would have cropped this more into a panorama kind of... or a much skinnier vertical... and really tried to get rid of the distracting surroundings.</td>', 'Woah!  Is this at a zoo... and was whatever is in the tigers mouths just fresh dead?  if so AMAZING shot... I would have cropped this more into a panorama kind of... or a much skinnier vertical... and really tried to get rid of the distracting surroundings.', '2004-01-09 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(537068, 53040, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  I like the red of the lighthouse against the blue.</td>', 'Great timing.  I like the red of the lighthouse against the blue.', '2004-01-09 02:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(537073, 52311, 10170, '<td valign="top">Simple, clever, and very effective.</td>', 'Simple, clever, and very effective.', '2004-01-09 02:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(537076, 53093, 10170, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this one.  Great choice of b&amp;w and great lighting.  Exceptional model, both in looks, shape and the natural pose she has managed.  My favourite of the challenge.  10</td>', 'Absolutely love this one.  Great choice of b&w and great lighting.  Exceptional model, both in looks, shape and the natural pose she has managed.  My favourite of the challenge.  10', '2004-01-09 03:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(537089, 53051, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely yellow and blue color and good details. Very attractive shot. But also oversharpened to the point that it creates highlights. I would crop of 20% of the left to achieve a better composition, without the leave drawing so much attention.</td>', 'Lovely yellow and blue color and good details. Very attractive shot. But also oversharpened to the point that it creates highlights. I would crop of 20% of the left to achieve a better composition, without the leave drawing so much attention.', '2004-01-09 03:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(537091, 53010, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice blue image, feels really cold as it should be. I think you should have gone a bit closer, only including the snow, the icehotel and the wall on the right, not the part with the orange glow on the left.</td>', 'Nice blue image, feels really cold as it should be. I think you should have gone a bit closer, only including the snow, the icehotel and the wall on the right, not the part with the orange glow on the left.', '2004-01-09 03:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(537099, 51671, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good contrast.The shadows on the cats'' back and the light on the cats'' front really help to bring out the beautiful curves. I like the wood grain on the cat. Depth of field is good. Great separation of foreground and background. Hightlights in the cats'' eye is very cool.</td>', 'Very good contrast.The shadows on the cats'' back and the light on the cats'' front really help to bring out the beautiful curves. I like the wood grain on the cat. Depth of field is good. Great separation of foreground and background. Hightlights in the cats'' eye is very cool.', '2004-01-09 05:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(537100, 51560, 10084, '<td valign="top">Diagonal composition of the guitar makes it very interesting. Beautiful curves make the eyes follow the contour of the guitar. The color really makes the shot pop. The details in the center is too sharp and kind of hurts your eyes.</td>', 'Diagonal composition of the guitar makes it very interesting. Beautiful curves make the eyes follow the contour of the guitar. The color really makes the shot pop. The details in the center is too sharp and kind of hurts your eyes.', '2004-01-09 05:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(537103, 52473, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent, could be a magazine cover.</td>', 'Excellent, could be a magazine cover.', '2004-01-09 05:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(537104, 52953, 10170, '<td valign="top">Lovely action shot, especially the water.</td>', 'Lovely action shot, especially the water.', '2004-01-09 05:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
