(537119, 53101, 8682, '<td valign="top">Wow... really, it´s an awesome picture. I really like the contrast and the colours of this image. Perhaps, the only thing that damages the image (in my opinion) is the shadow, but it´s just my opinion. Congrats of a fantastic work. 8</td>', 'Wow... really, it´s an awesome picture. I really like the contrast and the colours of this image. Perhaps, the only thing that damages the image (in my opinion) is the shadow, but it´s just my opinion. Congrats of a fantastic work. 8', '2004-01-09 06:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
