(537122, 52984, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful colour of the sky.</td>', 'Beatiful colour of the sky.', '2004-01-09 06:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(537123, 53071, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours here, good subject too. Only thing is the blurs in the skating rink.  I know though that it''s difficult to get a decent exposure time with skaters, tried for over an hour myself...  9</td>', 'Really nice colours here, good subject too. Only thing is the blurs in the skating rink.  I know though that it''s difficult to get a decent exposure time with skaters, tried for over an hour myself...  9', '2004-01-09 06:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(537164, 52753, 13152, '<td valign="top">Proves that there are no absolute rules of composition - there is an arrowhead pointing to the centre of the frame! Love the bizzare pattern of silouettes and the smokey-coloured reflection of the sky. A cracking image. 10</td>', 'Proves that there are no absolute rules of composition - there is an arrowhead pointing to the centre of the frame! Love the bizzare pattern of silouettes and the smokey-coloured reflection of the sky. A cracking image. 10', '2004-01-09 08:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(537169, 51959, 13152, '<td valign="top">One of those telling photjournalistic moments, with the casual appearance of a snap but powerful in the capture of significant signs and gestures. I like the no entry sign coming out of the kid''s arm and the ''bear'' label on his target. Make a great poster for the NRA.</td>', 'One of those telling photjournalistic moments, with the casual appearance of a snap but powerful in the capture of significant signs and gestures. I like the no entry sign coming out of the kid''s arm and the ''bear'' label on his target. Make a great poster for the NRA.', '2004-01-09 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(537170, 53006, 13152, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.</td>', 'This is lovely.', '2004-01-09 08:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(537171, 52303, 13152, '<td valign="top">Even the drops of water in its beak, as far as I can tell. Gorgeous colour. Tiny bit of tension at the left and bottom of the frame, but you certainly got ''the moment''.</td>', 'Even the drops of water in its beak, as far as I can tell. Gorgeous colour. Tiny bit of tension at the left and bottom of the frame, but you certainly got ''the moment''.', '2004-01-09 08:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(537172, 52945, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very elegant, great colors and I love the narrow depth of field. I feel there is a bit too much going on in the top left corner and border area. I would crop away a very small part (approx 5%) of the left and the top, so the darkest parts visible in the border area are gone. It creates just a bit more rest in the picture.</td>', 'Very elegant, great colors and I love the narrow depth of field. I feel there is a bit too much going on in the top left corner and border area. I would crop away a very small part (approx 5%) of the left and the top, so the darkest parts visible in the border area are gone. It creates just a bit more rest in the picture.', '2004-01-09 08:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(537173, 52793, 13152, '<td valign="top">An atmospheric treat, perfectly framed.</td>', 'An atmospheric treat, perfectly framed.', '2004-01-09 08:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(537174, 53044, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and appealing result. Crop could be improved by taking a bit more of the top, so the top left and top right colors are gone. There is also the grey/blue refelction in the glass which does not really add to the picture. That would require a reshoot or some cloning.</td>', 'Very good idea and appealing result. Crop could be improved by taking a bit more of the top, so the top left and top right colors are gone. There is also the grey/blue refelction in the glass which does not really add to the picture. That would require a reshoot or some cloning.', '2004-01-09 08:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(537175, 51927, 13152, '<td valign="top">A very satisfying composition with a nice touch of ironic humour.</td>', 'A very satisfying composition with a nice touch of ironic humour.', '2004-01-09 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(537176, 53073, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very spontaneous expression, nice warmlight. The wild curly hair adds to the free mood expressed. Crop under the chin is a bit tight, would have like a bit more space.</td>', 'Very spontaneous expression, nice warmlight. The wild curly hair adds to the free mood expressed. Crop under the chin is a bit tight, would have like a bit more space.', '2004-01-09 08:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(537178, 53032, 13152, '<td valign="top">We all long for these conditions. Perfect exposure. Well done. Only slight complaint  is the power lines, but perhaps they add a needed percentage of grit to what might have been a little too sugary.</td>', 'We all long for these conditions. Perfect exposure. Well done. Only slight complaint  is the power lines, but perhaps they add a needed percentage of grit to what might have been a little too sugary.', '2004-01-09 08:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(537180, 52563, 13152, '<td valign="top">Wow. Even a starbust highlight. A gem.</td>', 'Wow. Even a starbust highlight. A gem.', '2004-01-09 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(537187, 50518, 13152, '<td valign="top">A sculpture? Or did you just make it one? Very nice spatial confusion indeed with decided ''Space Shuttle cargo bay'' overtones. I can''t figure out the secondary light sources - it is a puzzlingly good exposure. Make more like this please!</td>', 'A sculpture? Or did you just make it one? Very nice spatial confusion indeed with decided ''Space Shuttle cargo bay'' overtones. I can''t figure out the secondary light sources - it is a puzzlingly good exposure. Make more like this please!', '2004-01-09 08:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(537188, 52359, 13152, '<td valign="top">What dreamy light. Love the stick.</td>', 'What dreamy light. Love the stick.', '2004-01-09 08:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(537189, 52850, 13152, '<td valign="top">Great tonal control and composition. A fine, subtle portrait  - though I''d have preferred a title that didn''t tell me what the emotion is supposed to be; it limits the response.</td>', 'Great tonal control and composition. A fine, subtle portrait  - though I''d have preferred a title that didn''t tell me what the emotion is supposed to be; it limits the response.', '2004-01-09 09:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(537193, 52291, 13152, '<td valign="top">The curve at the top of the frame is clever and makes it look like a snap of a picnic on Io. Take out the table in P''Shop and sell a print to NASA. Very nice shot.</td>', 'The curve at the top of the frame is clever and makes it look like a snap of a picnic on Io. Take out the table in P''Shop and sell a print to NASA. Very nice shot.', '2004-01-09 09:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(537194, 53010, 13152, '<td valign="top">Well if there was ever a ''cool'' picture this has to be it.  Well done. I wish there was just a little more of the contrasting warm light - or a white Husky in the foreground. Did you stay a night?</td>', 'Well if there was ever a ''cool'' picture this has to be it.  Well done. I wish there was just a little more of the contrasting warm light - or a white Husky in the foreground. Did you stay a night?', '2004-01-09 09:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(537217, 53092, 772, '<td valign="top">looks like he is having fun :)</td>', 'looks like he is having fun :)', '2004-01-09 09:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(537219, 53015, 772, '<td valign="top">looks like a poor lighting situation for a decent photo.</td>', 'looks like a poor lighting situation for a decent photo.', '2004-01-09 09:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(537229, 52359, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great empty landscape with lovely colors and soft flowing colors between water, sand and sky. Looks like the wind is really blowing hard. You should have picked up the little orange object in front and thrown it away, but I know, you usually only see it when you get home.</td>', 'Great empty landscape with lovely colors and soft flowing colors between water, sand and sky. Looks like the wind is really blowing hard. You should have picked up the little orange object in front and thrown it away, but I know, you usually only see it when you get home.', '2004-01-09 10:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(537231, 52353, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely color, great wide angle, emphasised by the very nice smooth effect of the long exposure. A bit too many disturbances in the foreground, but not really killing. Great.</td>', 'Lovely color, great wide angle, emphasised by the very nice smooth effect of the long exposure. A bit too many disturbances in the foreground, but not really killing. Great.', '2004-01-09 10:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(537240, 51950, 15912, '<td valign="top">very artistic...shows the coldness of the winter.</td>', 'very artistic...shows the coldness of the winter.', '2004-01-09 10:30:44.000000', NULL, 1);
