(537484, 52213, 10848, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot, the colors are wonderful, I like the way you captured this with the time of day having subtle light showing the trees and mountain in the shadows great shot</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot, the colors are wonderful, I like the way you captured this with the time of day having subtle light showing the trees and mountain in the shadows great shot', '2004-01-09 15:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
