(537577, 53066, 14045, '<td valign="top">great shot.</td>', 'great shot.', '2004-01-09 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(537578, 52953, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture - I like how the white surf is frozen. Lovely colour in the water. Not so keen on position of surfer - from this angle the lower part of his body is hidden such that the overall "shape" doesn''t look right. I also think the angle of the sun to his face means it''s in too much shadow. Composition feels a touch unbalanced, I''d prefer more space above him and a touch less to his left so he''s more off centred but the distance between the edges of the top, left and bottom frames from him are about equal. If that doesn''t make sense let me know, it''s past my bed time!</td>', 'Nice motion capture - I like how the white surf is frozen. Lovely colour in the water. Not so keen on position of surfer - from this angle the lower part of his body is hidden such that the overall "shape" doesn''t look right. I also think the angle of the sun to his face means it''s in too much shadow. Composition feels a touch unbalanced, I''d prefer more space above him and a touch less to his left so he''s more off centred but the distance between the edges of the top, left and bottom frames from him are about equal. If that doesn''t make sense let me know, it''s past my bed time!', '2004-01-09 17:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
