(538022, 52667, 6458, '<td valign="top">I like these types of photo.. and I really like this one for one reason, the lady standing still looking at the camera. That is a really nice touch, though I think I would have made her more prominent, either with a different crop or with some photoshop trickery. <br/> <br/>Good job anyway, 8.</td>', 'I like these types of photo.. and I really like this one for one reason, the lady standing still looking at the camera. That is a really nice touch, though I think I would have made her more prominent, either with a different crop or with some photoshop trickery.  Good job anyway, 8.', '2004-01-10 11:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(538063, 52909, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a strking landscape though lighting/ weather conditions aren''t at their best in terms of really making the image stand out. Although the overcast feel is interesting I think a more obviously stormy sky (or perhaps a fine weather day) would lead to a more memorable result. Composition also doesn''t feel 100% balanced to me - the tree is too close to centre to be off-centred but too far from centre to be centred. Please feel free to ignore this comment as I appreciate that it''s somewhat rambling in nature!!!</td>', 'This is a strking landscape though lighting/ weather conditions aren''t at their best in terms of really making the image stand out. Although the overcast feel is interesting I think a more obviously stormy sky (or perhaps a fine weather day) would lead to a more memorable result. Composition also doesn''t feel 100% balanced to me - the tree is too close to centre to be off-centred but too far from centre to be centred. Please feel free to ignore this comment as I appreciate that it''s somewhat rambling in nature!!!', '2004-01-10 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
