(538139, 53107, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and I love the flaming red/orange and green contrast of the background.  You get a very good 3D feel for the pod and such detail ! Wonderful photograph.</td>', 'Great DOF and I love the flaming red/orange and green contrast of the background.  You get a very good 3D feel for the pod and such detail ! Wonderful photograph.', '2004-01-10 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(538141, 49322, 4008, '<td valign="top">It is not sharp, and these animals are very stationary so you have all the time to get a sharp picture. Best way to do it is use a tripod, but holding your camera against the glass also works well.</td>', 'It is not sharp, and these animals are very stationary so you have all the time to get a sharp picture. Best way to do it is use a tripod, but holding your camera against the glass also works well.', '2004-01-10 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(538143, 52926, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice warm picture, good use of light and structure, but the border is terrible in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice warm picture, good use of light and structure, but the border is terrible in my opinion.', '2004-01-10 14:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(538146, 53003, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice warm and soft portrait, nice glow in the hair. Choice of color of clothes and background put all emphasis on the faces, I like it.  It feels slightly unbalanced, I think the girl on the left needs a bit more space, maybe you can crop it less tight ? Also the girl on the left is missing some catchlights in her eyes, whereas the girl on the right has several.</td>', 'Nice warm and soft portrait, nice glow in the hair. Choice of color of clothes and background put all emphasis on the faces, I like it.  It feels slightly unbalanced, I think the girl on the left needs a bit more space, maybe you can crop it less tight ? Also the girl on the left is missing some catchlights in her eyes, whereas the girl on the right has several.', '2004-01-10 14:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(538147, 50097, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think it need a very small rotating anti-clockwise to get the caste towers vertical. But you captured the atmosphere very well and were right on time with for the fireworks. A bit closer crop would maybe make it a bit stronger.</td>', 'I think it need a very small rotating anti-clockwise to get the caste towers vertical. But you captured the atmosphere very well and were right on time with for the fireworks. A bit closer crop would maybe make it a bit stronger.', '2004-01-10 14:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(538149, 52558, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think the guitar should have been held more straight, so the side is not seen, only the shape from the front.  And then more covering the body so the shape of the guitar follows the flow of the body more.</td>', 'I think the guitar should have been held more straight, so the side is not seen, only the shape from the front.  And then more covering the body so the shape of the guitar follows the flow of the body more.', '2004-01-10 15:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(538151, 52213, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great picture if the tree blocking the view on the mountain would not have been there.</td>', 'Great picture if the tree blocking the view on the mountain would not have been there.', '2004-01-10 15:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(538152, 52226, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great contrast here. I love how white you got the whites of the dress and cake and how vivid the red of the flowers.  How did you get the whites so white and the black so black?!!! I like the angle of view so that you''ve hidden their faces and made this a picture that many couples and would be brides identify with. So well done!</td>', 'Great contrast here. I love how white you got the whites of the dress and cake and how vivid the red of the flowers.  How did you get the whites so white and the black so black?!!! I like the angle of view so that you''ve hidden their faces and made this a picture that many couples and would be brides identify with. So well done!', '2004-01-10 15:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(538153, 52988, 4008, '<td valign="top">I need to come back and read your explanation. I am puzzled about what I am looking at, but I like it. Looks like an electric light with a substance on it which caused smoke. It you crop the lower part with the threads away it become really abstract, makes me think of a bomb explosion. Funny to see the hand with finger. A warning against violance ?</td>', 'I need to come back and read your explanation. I am puzzled about what I am looking at, but I like it. Looks like an electric light with a substance on it which caused smoke. It you crop the lower part with the threads away it become really abstract, makes me think of a bomb explosion. Funny to see the hand with finger. A warning against violance ?', '2004-01-10 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(538154, 52577, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail...her future certainly looks bright from this angle.</td>', 'Excellent detail...her future certainly looks bright from this angle.', '2004-01-10 15:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(538156, 52793, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the mood and the perspective. Could be a little more dark to add some contrast and reduce the glare of the light in the background.</td>', 'Love the mood and the perspective. Could be a little more dark to add some contrast and reduce the glare of the light in the background.', '2004-01-10 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(538158, 51606, 5822, '<td valign="top">Technically a great shot, but it looks like the bee is dead.  Poor composition.</td>', 'Technically a great shot, but it looks like the bee is dead.  Poor composition.', '2004-01-10 15:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(538161, 52998, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though too centered a composition the colors are great! and focus/DOF is wonderful All this through glass. Excellent work.</td>', 'Though too centered a composition the colors are great! and focus/DOF is wonderful All this through glass. Excellent work.', '2004-01-10 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(538162, 53038, 5822, '<td valign="top">Equisite composition and color. I love it against the black background...really brings out the colors and texture.  Good control over DOF and I like your angle of view so that even with the back petal blurred, you can see both.  Very well done.</td>', 'Equisite composition and color. I love it against the black background...really brings out the colors and texture.  Good control over DOF and I like your angle of view so that even with the back petal blurred, you can see both.  Very well done.', '2004-01-10 15:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(538165, 52667, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on a classic. I love how you''ve captured the hustle and bustle and the size and depth of this station. Tones are excellent too, but my own preference would be to have a bit more contrast and reduction of the glare of the highlights in the background, but then again, that may have reduced the light and airy feel you''ve captured. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent take on a classic. I love how you''ve captured the hustle and bustle and the size and depth of this station. Tones are excellent too, but my own preference would be to have a bit more contrast and reduction of the glare of the highlights in the background, but then again, that may have reduced the light and airy feel you''ve captured. Very well done.', '2004-01-10 15:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(538167, 53042, 5822, '<td valign="top">Difficult light conditions, but I love the fresh feel you''ve captured.  Beautiful cool colors and you''ve really captured the lighting well.</td>', 'Difficult light conditions, but I love the fresh feel you''ve captured.  Beautiful cool colors and you''ve really captured the lighting well.', '2004-01-10 15:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(538174, 52829, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot! These sticks looked like logs to me until I found the clue of the leaf in the lower left.  I also like the different tones of green contrasting with the browns. I''m left wondering if the arrangement of the two big sticks have any significance.</td>', 'Great macro shot! These sticks looked like logs to me until I found the clue of the leaf in the lower left.  I also like the different tones of green contrasting with the browns. I''m left wondering if the arrangement of the two big sticks have any significance.', '2004-01-10 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(538178, 53003, 5822, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful portrait of two beautiful girls. I like the warm hues but I''m wondering if some backlighting would have added some depth to the photo.  Well done, in any case.</td>', 'A very beautiful portrait of two beautiful girls. I like the warm hues but I''m wondering if some backlighting would have added some depth to the photo.  Well done, in any case.', '2004-01-10 15:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(538180, 53112, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the concept here, but feel the image is a bit too cluttered and busy.  Lighting is not right either.I think the big green leprechaun on top should have the spot light.</td>', 'I love the concept here, but feel the image is a bit too cluttered and busy.  Lighting is not right either.I think the big green leprechaun on top should have the spot light.', '2004-01-10 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(538186, 52390, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast here to this fine art photograph which conveys the feeling of the strength of the falls. Looks like it was done by one of the masters.</td>', 'I like the contrast here to this fine art photograph which conveys the feeling of the strength of the falls. Looks like it was done by one of the masters.', '2004-01-10 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(538189, 52645, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice, almost impressionistic, interpretation of sunset/rise.  Good lighting and colors.</td>', 'Nice, almost impressionistic, interpretation of sunset/rise.  Good lighting and colors.', '2004-01-10 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(538191, 52270, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is where I find the use of a special effects filter to be a bit gimmicky. I think it detracts from the beauty of the scene and time of day.  I would have preferred instead you move a little to the right to shield the bright sun and increase exposure to include a better lit valley below.  Just wondering what the green object is in the lower left...Are you trying to hide something here? Still, this scene evokes some kind of feeling in me, just think it was handled wrong.</td>', 'This is where I find the use of a special effects filter to be a bit gimmicky. I think it detracts from the beauty of the scene and time of day.  I would have preferred instead you move a little to the right to shield the bright sun and increase exposure to include a better lit valley below.  Just wondering what the green object is in the lower left...Are you trying to hide something here? Still, this scene evokes some kind of feeling in me, just think it was handled wrong.', '2004-01-10 16:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(538194, 52489, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice old-time flavor to this scene with the buggys in the background and out of focus. I like the way the man and girl are in focus and have the only color in the shot.  Very nice composition.</td>', 'Nice old-time flavor to this scene with the buggys in the background and out of focus. I like the way the man and girl are in focus and have the only color in the shot.  Very nice composition.', '2004-01-10 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(538198, 51871, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful angle of view and perspective. Love the color contrast between the warm colors of the background and the cool colors of the foreground.</td>', 'Wonderful angle of view and perspective. Love the color contrast between the warm colors of the background and the cool colors of the foreground.', '2004-01-10 16:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(538199, 52606, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cool muted tones.  Love this scene.</td>', 'Beautiful cool muted tones.  Love this scene.', '2004-01-10 16:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
