(538247, 52353, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ok, 1st of all, you seem to live somewhere warm.. minus 5 right off the bat!!!  ;-) LOL<br/> <br/>This is one of my tops. I give you 9! Wherever I look my eye converges back to the shelter.  The levels are spot on and so is the saturation.  Great job!</td>', 'Ok, 1st of all, you seem to live somewhere warm.. minus 5 right off the bat!!!  ;-) LOL This is one of my tops. I give you 9! Wherever I look my eye converges back to the shelter.  The levels are spot on and so is the saturation.  Great job!', '2004-01-10 17:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(538248, 52483, 259, '<td valign="top">i like your idea.  i think i lower perspective looking up at the cop, would look really good, as well as create a sence of what the kid''s perspective is.</td>', 'i like your idea.  i think i lower perspective looking up at the cop, would look really good, as well as create a sence of what the kid''s perspective is.', '2004-01-10 17:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(538251, 51910, 4482, '<td valign="top">This is an amzing shot! I just love the composition. And the levels are spot on. I find it difficult to create impact using simple objects and you succeeded well here. The choice of a shallow DOF brings you back to try and read the engraving. Great shot! 9</td>', 'This is an amzing shot! I just love the composition. And the levels are spot on. I find it difficult to create impact using simple objects and you succeeded well here. The choice of a shallow DOF brings you back to try and read the engraving. Great shot! 9', '2004-01-10 17:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(538255, 52424, 259, '<td valign="top">nicely composed</td>', 'nicely composed', '2004-01-10 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(538256, 52413, 4482, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule of 3rds. Sepia works well here. This is a priceless pose. I just love it! The sad puppy eyes look. :-) 9</td>', 'Good use of the rule of 3rds. Sepia works well here. This is a priceless pose. I just love it! The sad puppy eyes look. :-) 9', '2004-01-10 17:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(538259, 52998, 4482, '<td valign="top">Y akow what... for once the "overuse" of NI works well for me here! So does the boosted saturation. The shaloow DOF brings my eyes back to the fish. It seems totally magical! 9</td>', 'Y akow what... for once the "overuse" of NI works well for me here! So does the boosted saturation. The shaloow DOF brings my eyes back to the fish. It seems totally magical! 9', '2004-01-10 18:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(538262, 53102, 259, '<td valign="top">the top of the glass bowl doesn''t help at all, it almost looks like the picture is embossed.  other than that, you''ve got a pretty nice composition set up.</td>', 'the top of the glass bowl doesn''t help at all, it almost looks like the picture is embossed.  other than that, you''ve got a pretty nice composition set up.', '2004-01-10 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(538263, 53054, 4482, '<td valign="top">Such a simple picture yet there''s something about it that just talks to me. I would feel safe under that light.... looking at the architecture, I would need to feel safe I think. :-)  The level are great. Beautiful composition. 9</td>', 'Such a simple picture yet there''s something about it that just talks to me. I would feel safe under that light.... looking at the architecture, I would need to feel safe I think. :-)  The level are great. Beautiful composition. 9', '2004-01-10 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(538264, 52838, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the soft focus</td>', 'i like the soft focus', '2004-01-10 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(538267, 53006, 259, '<td valign="top">i like everything except the shaddow on the left.</td>', 'i like everything except the shaddow on the left.', '2004-01-10 18:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(538270, 52796, 259, '<td valign="top">for some reason i kinda like the selective color in your shot.  most of the time it looks cheesy, but i think your shot actually needs it.  nice job.</td>', 'for some reason i kinda like the selective color in your shot.  most of the time it looks cheesy, but i think your shot actually needs it.  nice job.', '2004-01-10 18:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(538271, 51606, 259, '<td valign="top">i might be wrong, but that bee looks dead.</td>', 'i might be wrong, but that bee looks dead.', '2004-01-10 18:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(538273, 53009, 259, '<td valign="top">probably the best christmas shot i''ve seen on this site.  most christmas shots aren''t that good, but yours is a good shot any time of the year.</td>', 'probably the best christmas shot i''ve seen on this site.  most christmas shots aren''t that good, but yours is a good shot any time of the year.', '2004-01-10 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(538274, 52766, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-01-10 18:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(538275, 52511, 259, '<td valign="top">great use of perspective.</td>', 'great use of perspective.', '2004-01-10 18:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(538278, 52998, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow! You took my breath away! :-) I love this movie and the photo is so great! Wonderful vivid colours and nice composition and it totally reminds me to the movie, congrats!</td>', 'Wow! You took my breath away! :-) I love this movie and the photo is so great! Wonderful vivid colours and nice composition and it totally reminds me to the movie, congrats!', '2004-01-10 18:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(538279, 53112, 259, '<td valign="top">i find this picture odd.  i don''t see the motivation for taking this shot.</td>', 'i find this picture odd.  i don''t see the motivation for taking this shot.', '2004-01-10 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(538280, 53073, 259, '<td valign="top">easily one of the best.</td>', 'easily one of the best.', '2004-01-10 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(538284, 52525, 259, '<td valign="top">wow, impressive.</td>', 'wow, impressive.', '2004-01-10 18:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(538286, 52353, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the extreme wide angle effect.</td>', 'i like the extreme wide angle effect.', '2004-01-10 18:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(538290, 52226, 3032, '<td valign="top">I think your creativity saved this photo, because the background must be a photographers nightmare. The person who decided to put the cake in that place deserves one in the face. :)<br/>Ignoring the background;<br/> I really like your composition. The blade just touches the cake, the positioning of the newlyweds, the hand (with the ring) of the man on her, err rear..... <br/>The exposure and B&amp;W toning is just excellent.<br/>Leaving the colors (I am sure that I see red and green, so it must be more than just partial desaturation) of the roses makes the cake stand out so well. And that is just what was needed with this background. The cake and the couple draw most of the attention. Good thinking!<br/>If it were not for the background I would give this a 9, without that excellent toning &amp; exposure and the colors in the cake I would give it a 5. That averages to a 7, but I''ll give a bonus point for saving the shot: 8. :)<br/></td>', 'I think your creativity saved this photo, because the background must be a photographers nightmare. The person who decided to put the cake in that place deserves one in the face. :)Ignoring the background; I really like your composition. The blade just touches the cake, the positioning of the newlyweds, the hand (with the ring) of the man on her, err rear..... The exposure and B&W toning is just excellent.Leaving the colors (I am sure that I see red and green, so it must be more than just partial desaturation) of the roses makes the cake stand out so well. And that is just what was needed with this background. The cake and the couple draw most of the attention. Good thinking!If it were not for the background I would give this a 9, without that excellent toning & exposure and the colors in the cake I would give it a 5. That averages to a 7, but I''ll give a bonus point for saving the shot: 8. :)', '2004-01-10 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(538291, 51867, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot.  it has a classic feel to it.</td>', 'great shot.  it has a classic feel to it.', '2004-01-10 18:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(538293, 52895, 259, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  one thing that could improve it even further is a shallower depth of field to bring the owl out from among the branches.</td>', 'nice shot.  one thing that could improve it even further is a shallower depth of field to bring the owl out from among the branches.', '2004-01-10 18:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(538294, 53070, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot and great choice of black and white.</td>', 'great shot and great choice of black and white.', '2004-01-10 18:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(538295, 52563, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice, the depth of field makes this shot pop nicely.</td>', 'very nice, the depth of field makes this shot pop nicely.', '2004-01-10 18:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(538296, 52416, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but think it could be better when you had used some or more fill flash. Now there is a relatively bright spot in the umbrella which makes the flesh tones look a bit flat.<br/>I am not sure if I like the soft edges, with the umbrella and the skirt it looks ok, but the dark top has a dark halo.<br/>The background is ok.</td>', 'I like the composition, but think it could be better when you had used some or more fill flash. Now there is a relatively bright spot in the umbrella which makes the flesh tones look a bit flat.I am not sure if I like the soft edges, with the umbrella and the skirt it looks ok, but the dark top has a dark halo.The background is ok.', '2004-01-10 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(538299, 52822, 259, '<td valign="top">nice job filling the frame</td>', 'nice job filling the frame', '2004-01-10 18:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(538300, 52802, 259, '<td valign="top">there isn''t really anything interesting.</td>', 'there isn''t really anything interesting.', '2004-01-10 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(538303, 52930, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot, however, i am personally not a fan of the faded border.  i like the picture though.</td>', 'great shot, however, i am personally not a fan of the faded border.  i like the picture though.', '2004-01-10 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(538305, 52122, 259, '<td valign="top">it''s not a pretty bird, but it is a pretty picture.  strange how that can happen.</td>', 'it''s not a pretty bird, but it is a pretty picture.  strange how that can happen.', '2004-01-10 18:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(538306, 49435, 3032, '<td valign="top">This photo would have looked so much better if you had taken it from a position more to the right. Not only you more to the right, but also your subject. Try to create the situation that the guy stands next to the flagpole, while his body covers the parked vehicles. The more rightward shooting angle would also take out the powerline cariers at the right.<br/>Try to include the whole flag, by standing back and zooming in. Standing back would also avoid that shadow. A reflector on the ground could fill in the eye area. Eyes are one of the most important aspects in portaiture.<br/>I am sure that this guy''s time is limited, but shooting at a time when the sun is lower and more reddish could also fill in the shadow under the eye and give a more balanced color &amp; tone response.</td>', 'This photo would have looked so much better if you had taken it from a position more to the right. Not only you more to the right, but also your subject. Try to create the situation that the guy stands next to the flagpole, while his body covers the parked vehicles. The more rightward shooting angle would also take out the powerline cariers at the right.Try to include the whole flag, by standing back and zooming in. Standing back would also avoid that shadow. A reflector on the ground could fill in the eye area. Eyes are one of the most important aspects in portaiture.I am sure that this guy''s time is limited, but shooting at a time when the sun is lower and more reddish could also fill in the shadow under the eye and give a more balanced color & tone response.', '2004-01-10 18:48:14.000000', NULL, 1);
