(538521, 52793, 14001, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I really wish you would have removed the small light up the road.  Doesn''t make sense to me to have that second light.  9.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I really wish you would have removed the small light up the road.  Doesn''t make sense to me to have that second light.  9.', '2004-01-11 00:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(538522, 49310, 14001, '<td valign="top">Specactular!  The tree being narrow really works.  I don''t know that I''ve seen a photo from inisde a house that was more attractive.  December free study, has meaning to december.   The only think I don''t like is that it''s off center.  10, my pick for best image in this challenge.</td>', 'Specactular!  The tree being narrow really works.  I don''t know that I''ve seen a photo from inisde a house that was more attractive.  December free study, has meaning to december.   The only think I don''t like is that it''s off center.  10, my pick for best image in this challenge.', '2004-01-11 00:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(538523, 51646, 14001, '<td valign="top">Your were able to do a lot with very little.  Love the brick wall in the air filter cover.  9.</td>', 'Your were able to do a lot with very little.  Love the brick wall in the air filter cover.  9.', '2004-01-11 00:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
