(538526, 50877, 14001, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  All right, I''m fooled.  I can''t tell what city this is.  My gut says Chicago, but I don''t recognize anything.  Oh by the way,  I LOVE  how their is nobody in this mage.  9.</td>', 'Terrific.  All right, I''m fooled.  I can''t tell what city this is.  My gut says Chicago, but I don''t recognize anything.  Oh by the way,  I LOVE  how their is nobody in this mage.  9.', '2004-01-11 01:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
