(538915, 51421, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful landscape! Lovely muted colors  Crisp and clear...Can almost feel the sting of cold on my cheeks!</td>', 'Wonderful landscape! Lovely muted colors  Crisp and clear...Can almost feel the sting of cold on my cheeks!', '2004-01-11 15:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(538922, 49310, 5822, '<td valign="top">Color and tones are beautiful !  You''ve shot this at a perfect time of the evening to capture the blue of the sky. Really adds some special "atmosphere" here along with the silver of the ornaments.  I do, howeve, think the tree is a bit too heavy with ornament and I really wish you would have blurred the background more so that the houses outside were not visible. IMO, they really detract from an otherwise beautiful and elegant scene.</td>', 'Color and tones are beautiful !  You''ve shot this at a perfect time of the evening to capture the blue of the sky. Really adds some special "atmosphere" here along with the silver of the ornaments.  I do, howeve, think the tree is a bit too heavy with ornament and I really wish you would have blurred the background more so that the houses outside were not visible. IMO, they really detract from an otherwise beautiful and elegant scene.', '2004-01-11 15:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(538925, 53066, 8139, '<td valign="top">Too much neatimage, i prefer natural skil <br/>(but it''s just me )</td>', 'Too much neatimage, i prefer natural skil (but it''s just me )', '2004-01-11 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(538979, 51910, 7778, '<td valign="top">The well-chosen allegorical title contributes both story and flair to this simple, historical still life. <br/> <br/>The very edges of the fork handles appear a little dark on my monitor (despite the 1.8 Gamma/Apple CRT), while the chosen depth of field renders the hotel name precisely and legibly.</td>', 'The well-chosen allegorical title contributes both story and flair to this simple, historical still life.  The very edges of the fork handles appear a little dark on my monitor (despite the 1.8 Gamma/Apple CRT), while the chosen depth of field renders the hotel name precisely and legibly.', '2004-01-11 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(538984, 52122, 7778, '<td valign="top">Accomplished macro and a worthy subject (and personality!) composed to suit the purpose. Examplary silky (Canon?) background blur, flawless.</td>', 'Accomplished macro and a worthy subject (and personality!) composed to suit the purpose. Examplary silky (Canon?) background blur, flawless.', '2004-01-11 18:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(539001, 53040, 15547, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photograph!  Where was it taken?</td>', 'I absolutely love this photograph!  Where was it taken?', '2004-01-11 19:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(539008, 53070, 7778, '<td valign="top">Spectacular subject, good choice of black and white for the purpose, reasonable vertical  composition. <br/> <br/>I would wish for a marginally increased focal length (or distance to the dead tree) to allow for a slightly wider crop, especially at the top of the image and to the left of the foreground fir. <br/> <br/>The horizon, also, runs quite centrally. Inclusion of, proportionately, more sky would, IMO, make for a more pleasing and expansive composition.<br/> <br/>Overall, the photo reveals excessive contrast (proliferated in the foreground grass and along the limbs of tree), due, perhaps, to over-sharpening. Given the nature of this image, it makes good sense to me to want to draw attention to texture. Excessive contrast, as evidenced here, leads to blown out highlights and loss of detail. <br/> <br/>Nevertheless an interesting photo and, IMO, one worth re-shooting, possibly via a gamut  of exposures.</td>', 'Spectacular subject, good choice of black and white for the purpose, reasonable vertical  composition.  I would wish for a marginally increased focal length (or distance to the dead tree) to allow for a slightly wider crop, especially at the top of the image and to the left of the foreground fir.  The horizon, also, runs quite centrally. Inclusion of, proportionately, more sky would, IMO, make for a more pleasing and expansive composition. Overall, the photo reveals excessive contrast (proliferated in the foreground grass and along the limbs of tree), due, perhaps, to over-sharpening. Given the nature of this image, it makes good sense to me to want to draw attention to texture. Excessive contrast, as evidenced here, leads to blown out highlights and loss of detail.  Nevertheless an interesting photo and, IMO, one worth re-shooting, possibly via a gamut  of exposures.', '2004-01-11 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(539009, 52645, 15547, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, I really like the colors you captured.</td>', 'This is awesome, I really like the colors you captured.', '2004-01-11 19:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
