(539700, 52663, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful goosebumps !  Lighting is a bit too harsh as you''ve lost detail in her armpit.</td>', 'Beautiful goosebumps !  Lighting is a bit too harsh as you''ve lost detail in her armpit.', '2004-01-12 12:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(539705, 51560, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of this color. Not sure what you are communicating with it. Green is usually associated with cool, calming and balancing, but this is almost a neon/electric green. Not sure it goes with an acousitc guitar. Secondly, I like the fact that the far edge of the guitar has been faded and is indiscreet...it''s an interesting effect, but I wish the near side would have had the same treatment. Or, if both sides black borders were visible. An interesting photo nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of this color. Not sure what you are communicating with it. Green is usually associated with cool, calming and balancing, but this is almost a neon/electric green. Not sure it goes with an acousitc guitar. Secondly, I like the fact that the far edge of the guitar has been faded and is indiscreet...it''s an interesting effect, but I wish the near side would have had the same treatment. Or, if both sides black borders were visible. An interesting photo nonetheless.', '2004-01-12 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(539711, 52299, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, but would have had more impact for me if maybe a single toned color was lighting it in an interesting fashion. It appears a little to drab for me now.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, but would have had more impact for me if maybe a single toned color was lighting it in an interesting fashion. It appears a little to drab for me now.', '2004-01-12 12:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(539713, 52929, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though too busy for my tastes, I like the interesting geometric shapes and colors, as well as, the way my eye is lead into the picture by the gold wall.  I think you could have also shaved off about an inch off the top.</td>', 'Though too busy for my tastes, I like the interesting geometric shapes and colors, as well as, the way my eye is lead into the picture by the gold wall.  I think you could have also shaved off about an inch off the top.', '2004-01-12 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
