(539756, 53049, 5822, '<td valign="top">Not that bark can''t be interesting, but a more creative way to have dealt with this subject, for instance, would have been to have cropped the image in landscape format, put a large white border around it and title it:" Bar(k) Code.</td>', 'Not that bark can''t be interesting, but a more creative way to have dealt with this subject, for instance, would have been to have cropped the image in landscape format, put a large white border around it and title it:" Bar(k) Code.', '2004-01-12 12:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
