(540498, 53101, 5822, '<td valign="top">Colors are so rich and vibrant. Composition is excellent too except for the shadow smack dab in the middle of the picture.</td>', 'Colors are so rich and vibrant. Composition is excellent too except for the shadow smack dab in the middle of the picture.', '2004-01-12 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
