(540539, 51484, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice job of framing. I like the texture the bare limbs make. The only thing I think that would improve it is if it were taken at dawn or dusk or the sky was more interesting. But then, the sky doesn''t always cooperate in winter.</td>', 'Nice job of framing. I like the texture the bare limbs make. The only thing I think that would improve it is if it were taken at dawn or dusk or the sky was more interesting. But then, the sky doesn''t always cooperate in winter.', '2004-01-12 23:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
