(540542, 52985, 5007, '<td valign="top">Perfect time of day for this photo. I like how the trees reflect in the ice. It is simple and uncluttered.</td>', 'Perfect time of day for this photo. I like how the trees reflect in the ice. It is simple and uncluttered.', '2004-01-12 23:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
