(540550, 52910, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too bad the dog is so small and insignificant looking here. I think it would have made a difference to the impact of this photo if we could have seen the dog closer up frolicing in the snow. Also, what''s the pink thing in the background, a car? It''s distracting.</td>', 'Too bad the dog is so small and insignificant looking here. I think it would have made a difference to the impact of this photo if we could have seen the dog closer up frolicing in the snow. Also, what''s the pink thing in the background, a car? It''s distracting.', '2004-01-12 23:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(540552, 51427, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and the lighting in this. It is nice how the ground keeps the photo from being perfectly divided in half.</td>', 'I like the reflection and the lighting in this. It is nice how the ground keeps the photo from being perfectly divided in half.', '2004-01-12 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
