(540557, 53071, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this. Good job focusing. I also like how the light in the rink lights up the two skaters. I just noticed the other ghosts of skaters. Well done!</td>', 'I like the colors in this. Good job focusing. I also like how the light in the rink lights up the two skaters. I just noticed the other ghosts of skaters. Well done!', '2004-01-12 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
