(541052, 53066, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Professional studio looking. The woman''s face, though, appears too plastic and not natural. I''m wondering if you used a noise reducing filter to get these results. This has that "retouched" look which may, or may not, be desireable.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Professional studio looking. The woman''s face, though, appears too plastic and not natural. I''m wondering if you used a noise reducing filter to get these results. This has that "retouched" look which may, or may not, be desireable.', '2004-01-13 11:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(541058, 52359, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and tones. I do find the orange object in the foreground and erect structure on the left to be distracting. I also wish you had captured the waves in better focus.  Still a worthy picture.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and tones. I do find the orange object in the foreground and erect structure on the left to be distracting. I also wish you had captured the waves in better focus.  Still a worthy picture.', '2004-01-13 11:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(541211, 53066, 7369, '<td valign="top">While you have obviously put your best effort into this picture I think there is room for improvement. But first the good things :). Your (attractive) model has a great expression and the way her skin looks is pretty glamorous. I also love her casual hairstyle. <br/> <br/>Now the bad things: the background is too light for my taste; it distracts my attention from the model. It also makes the face looks too dark. Besides this you should have used a tighter crop; there is too much space between the head and the top of the photo. Overall an average photo (5).</td>', 'While you have obviously put your best effort into this picture I think there is room for improvement. But first the good things :). Your (attractive) model has a great expression and the way her skin looks is pretty glamorous. I also love her casual hairstyle.  Now the bad things: the background is too light for my taste; it distracts my attention from the model. It also makes the face looks too dark. Besides this you should have used a tighter crop; there is too much space between the head and the top of the photo. Overall an average photo (5).', '2004-01-13 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(541215, 53051, 7369, '<td valign="top">The composition is good but other than that this photo doesn''t hold much interest for me. I think you have used too much sharpening; this is especially noticeable around the edges. Considering the editing rules you should have removed or changed the leaf to the left, for now I find it distracting. The inside of the flower could use a little more light as it is a little too dark (3).</td>', 'The composition is good but other than that this photo doesn''t hold much interest for me. I think you have used too much sharpening; this is especially noticeable around the edges. Considering the editing rules you should have removed or changed the leaf to the left, for now I find it distracting. The inside of the flower could use a little more light as it is a little too dark (3).', '2004-01-13 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(541262, 52563, 12231, '<td valign="top">Good God! I have just joined DPChallenge, but seeing these contributions, I''m quite discouraged! Congratulations!</td>', 'Good God! I have just joined DPChallenge, but seeing these contributions, I''m quite discouraged! Congratulations!', '2004-01-13 16:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
