(542327, 52311, 6008, '<td valign="top">Neat illusion, love the cool tones too, lighting is great. Two nitpicks - as this was advanced rules I personally would have cloned out the lines where the paper met to give it more fluidity, and I have no idea what''s with the line at the front, not fond of it. Overall it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Neat illusion, love the cool tones too, lighting is great. Two nitpicks - as this was advanced rules I personally would have cloned out the lines where the paper met to give it more fluidity, and I have no idea what''s with the line at the front, not fond of it. Overall it''s a great shot!', '2004-01-14 10:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(542341, 52483, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has a great human interest angle. It''s not original, but bah, doesnt always matter. The tones are good, dof is good, lighting is just a tad too bright on his hand, but not distractingly so.  Nice shot.</td>', 'This has a great human interest angle. It''s not original, but bah, doesnt always matter. The tones are good, dof is good, lighting is just a tad too bright on his hand, but not distractingly so.  Nice shot.', '2004-01-14 10:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
