(543550, 53043, 7711, '<td valign="top">though the hand provides a nice measure to tell how big the baby is, it really distracts from the shot, and the isolation of the gator might have made for a stronger composition. I like the focus on his face, though wish his whole body was more in focus.</td>', 'though the hand provides a nice measure to tell how big the baby is, it really distracts from the shot, and the isolation of the gator might have made for a stronger composition. I like the focus on his face, though wish his whole body was more in focus.', '2004-01-14 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
