(543627, 53043, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the ''gator, but it would have looked much better on a surface than being held.  Of course this may have been the only way you could get the shot, so maybe I''m being unfair.</td>', 'Great shot of the ''gator, but it would have looked much better on a surface than being held.  Of course this may have been the only way you could get the shot, so maybe I''m being unfair.', '2004-01-14 20:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
