(543931, 53066, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot is wonderful but her face looks somehow artificial.  I think something you did in post-processing is a bit overdone for my tastes.</td>', 'This shot is wonderful but her face looks somehow artificial.  I think something you did in post-processing is a bit overdone for my tastes.', '2004-01-14 22:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(543935, 52416, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.  I like the soft effect you applied to the background, but I think you should try to mask the edges of her arms so they aren''t blurred.  This is very noticeable because of the transition where the soft effect stops under the umbrella.</td>', 'Very good shot.  I like the soft effect you applied to the background, but I think you should try to mask the edges of her arms so they aren''t blurred.  This is very noticeable because of the transition where the soft effect stops under the umbrella.', '2004-01-14 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(543939, 53074, 4007, '<td valign="top">The is a wonderful example of simplicity and capturing everyday things from the world around us in ways that show how beautiful and interesting they are.  Great framing and depth of field, the colors seem about right, and the lighting works nicely.  I enjoyed this one very much.</td>', 'The is a wonderful example of simplicity and capturing everyday things from the world around us in ways that show how beautiful and interesting they are.  Great framing and depth of field, the colors seem about right, and the lighting works nicely.  I enjoyed this one very much.', '2004-01-14 23:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(543940, 52473, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, and the shallow depth of field here works to bring out the front rider (of these two anyway).  Of course, it would be better without the peple standing behind, but there''s little you could do here.  Maybe at least crop the very top, where the fellows hand is, that'' being lighter it stands out.</td>', 'Excellent capture, and the shallow depth of field here works to bring out the front rider (of these two anyway).  Of course, it would be better without the peple standing behind, but there''s little you could do here.  Maybe at least crop the very top, where the fellows hand is, that'' being lighter it stands out.', '2004-01-14 23:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(543943, 52577, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  My top pick!</td>', 'Excellent work.  My top pick!', '2004-01-14 23:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(543944, 51478, 4007, '<td valign="top">At the very least this shot needs to be a lot sharper.</td>', 'At the very least this shot needs to be a lot sharper.', '2004-01-14 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(543949, 53009, 12253, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot overall!  Although I really like the angle of the child, it might be nice to tilt it a little left to make the tree appear more vertical here.  Or maybe a perspective adjustment.  Anyway, it''s a wonderful shot as is!  One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'A beautiful shot overall!  Although I really like the angle of the child, it might be nice to tilt it a little left to make the tree appear more vertical here.  Or maybe a perspective adjustment.  Anyway, it''s a wonderful shot as is!  One of my ribbon picks.', '2004-01-14 23:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(543952, 52353, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and I like the slight wide angle perspective the lens gives the sky.  Only little nit would be a bit more detail in the foreground; there''s basically (on my monitor) all black in the lower left corner and that detracts slightly IMHO.  Still a good chance for a ribbon here!  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and I like the slight wide angle perspective the lens gives the sky.  Only little nit would be a bit more detail in the foreground; there''s basically (on my monitor) all black in the lower left corner and that detracts slightly IMHO.  Still a good chance for a ribbon here!  Good luck.', '2004-01-14 23:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
