(544019, 52563, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great capture and use of DOF.  Incredible detail in the droplet reflection!  This deserves to do well even if we are getting tired of droplet photos!</td>', 'Great capture and use of DOF.  Incredible detail in the droplet reflection!  This deserves to do well even if we are getting tired of droplet photos!', '2004-01-14 23:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(544024, 52577, 12712, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot.  This will go in my favorites for sure.</td>', 'A wonderful shot.  This will go in my favorites for sure.', '2004-01-14 23:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(544025, 52398, 12253, '<td valign="top">Colors are beautiful, cloud detail very good.  My only negative is that there''s not much else to look at; that is, the river looks nice, but is so small at this distance and angle, the bottom third is basically black, and the top third is dark enough to not have much to contribute.  You might think about alternative crops to bring us closer to the river.</td>', 'Colors are beautiful, cloud detail very good.  My only negative is that there''s not much else to look at; that is, the river looks nice, but is so small at this distance and angle, the bottom third is basically black, and the top third is dark enough to not have much to contribute.  You might think about alternative crops to bring us closer to the river.', '2004-01-14 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(544027, 52775, 12253, '<td valign="top">Generally good, but aesthetically, I find it a bit dark--her hair disappears into the background on my monitor, and her hair over the face blends in with her eyes, which look quite "black" in this exposure.  I do like the angled head in the pose, and while the red dress adds a nice splash of color, having it at the bottom like that with the rest of the picture "black", seems to draw too much attention to it.   In short, a little more of her at the bottom would help, as would a level adjustment.</td>', 'Generally good, but aesthetically, I find it a bit dark--her hair disappears into the background on my monitor, and her hair over the face blends in with her eyes, which look quite "black" in this exposure.  I do like the angled head in the pose, and while the red dress adds a nice splash of color, having it at the bottom like that with the rest of the picture "black", seems to draw too much attention to it.   In short, a little more of her at the bottom would help, as would a level adjustment.', '2004-01-14 23:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(544029, 52926, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love the golden tones you have here.  The windows have interesting detail as well.  But the complex pattern and intricate work is spoiled a bit (for me anyway) by the choice of an integrated framing technique.  Not necessary here!  Let the picture speak for itself.</td>', 'I love the golden tones you have here.  The windows have interesting detail as well.  But the complex pattern and intricate work is spoiled a bit (for me anyway) by the choice of an integrated framing technique.  Not necessary here!  Let the picture speak for itself.', '2004-01-14 23:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(544031, 50767, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog and good action shot.  I think you might consider cropping this to put the person and dog closer to bottom left (leaving some margin).  Keeping the dog and the snow path on the diagonal of course!  Good exposure as well for this scene with such bright lighting and so much white snow and a white/yellow dog!</td>', 'Beautiful dog and good action shot.  I think you might consider cropping this to put the person and dog closer to bottom left (leaving some margin).  Keeping the dog and the snow path on the diagonal of course!  Good exposure as well for this scene with such bright lighting and so much white snow and a white/yellow dog!', '2004-01-14 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(544033, 52910, 9232, '<td valign="top">The red in the center and the dog at the bottom are mildly distracting</td>', 'The red in the center and the dog at the bottom are mildly distracting', '2004-01-14 23:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(544035, 51410, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on the snow on the trees here.  I like the composition but wish more of the trees at the bottom were included.</td>', 'I love the lighting on the snow on the trees here.  I like the composition but wish more of the trees at the bottom were included.', '2004-01-14 23:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(544037, 52811, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and composition.  I would have liked a little more foreground and some "buffer" on the fence (though with more foreground coming out of the corner like that might work well.)</td>', 'Very nice tones and composition.  I would have liked a little more foreground and some "buffer" on the fence (though with more foreground coming out of the corner like that might work well.)', '2004-01-14 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(544039, 52413, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great texture and tonal range on this.</td>', 'Great texture and tonal range on this.', '2004-01-14 23:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(544040, 52558, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and comparison of curves.   Two things come to mind: I think it might have looked better fully desaturated to grayscale.  And somehow getting rid of the label in the guitar.  Nice work overall.</td>', 'Nice composition and comparison of curves.   Two things come to mind: I think it might have looked better fully desaturated to grayscale.  And somehow getting rid of the label in the guitar.  Nice work overall.', '2004-01-14 23:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(544041, 52398, 9232, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been a little better if it had been cropped with less black at the bottom but overall its a great capture of a lovely sunset</td>', 'I think this might have been a little better if it had been cropped with less black at the bottom but overall its a great capture of a lovely sunset', '2004-01-14 23:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(544049, 52909, 9232, '<td valign="top">Sadly this overhangs the edges on 3 sides.  I could see one as artistic but with this composition I just think a shorter focal length should have been used.  Good tones and almost a very nice composition.</td>', 'Sadly this overhangs the edges on 3 sides.  I could see one as artistic but with this composition I just think a shorter focal length should have been used.  Good tones and almost a very nice composition.', '2004-01-14 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(544051, 52359, 12253, '<td valign="top">A nice photo with lucious colors and good reflections!  The soft focus effect which may be a matter of resolution adds aesthetically, except for items one would expect to be sharer, lile the background objects.    The main nit for me is the tilt to the right (nonnlevel horizon)</td>', 'A nice photo with lucious colors and good reflections!  The soft focus effect which may be a matter of resolution adds aesthetically, except for items one would expect to be sharer, lile the background objects.    The main nit for me is the tilt to the right (nonnlevel horizon)', '2004-01-14 23:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(544054, 51871, 9232, '<td valign="top">Seems like there''s just too much in this photo and it becomes cluttered.  You seem to have numerous valid subject areas; I''d suggest a longer study on this subject with multiple exposures that tell smaller pieces of the visual story so that each section can have more impact.</td>', 'Seems like there''s just too much in this photo and it becomes cluttered.  You seem to have numerous valid subject areas; I''d suggest a longer study on this subject with multiple exposures that tell smaller pieces of the visual story so that each section can have more impact.', '2004-01-14 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
