(544076, 52122, 4493, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments. The eye was changed back from the blue that I mentioned in the comments. <br/> <br/>For all of you who fear photoshop making digiart, here is the original file I started with:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=55276" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/4493/thumb/55276.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/4493/thumb/55276.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/4493/thumb/55276.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I spent over 2 hours perfecting this shot so it could be what you see here. Cloning, dodging, burning, healing brush, sharpening actions... all tools that help take this from my trash bin, to the frontpage.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!<br/>-danny</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments. The eye was changed back from the blue that I mentioned in the comments.  For all of you who fear photoshop making digiart, here is the original file I started with:   I spent over 2 hours perfecting this shot so it could be what you see here. Cloning, dodging, burning, healing brush, sharpening actions... all tools that help take this from my trash bin, to the frontpage. Thanks again!-danny', '2004-01-15 00:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
