(544125, 53073, 5792, '<td valign="top">Talya, Somehow I am not surprised that one of my top three choices for this challenge is one of yours. You just get better and better all the time. My only surprise is that it only scored barely over 6 here at DPC.<br/> <br/>It is a great image and should have got a much higher score.<br/> <br/>Congrats... it is a super image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-15 00:58:05.</i></td>', 'Talya, Somehow I am not surprised that one of my top three choices for this challenge is one of yours. You just get better and better all the time. My only surprise is that it only scored barely over 6 here at DPC. It is a great image and should have got a much higher score. Congrats... it is a super image.', '2004-01-15 00:57:05.000000', '2004-01-15 00:58:05.000000', 0),
