(544240, 52577, 5158, '<td valign="top">Thanx for all your votes and kind remarks on this image, making it the 12th place in this superb contest. <br/>I''m very, very happy with the outcome.<br/>I''m also happy to see that my G3 is capable to make great, SLR-like shots right out of the camera.<br/> <br/>Thanx again.<br/> <br/> <br/>@Kiwi: that''s somehow true and somehow not: to get our little one in front of the camera is often very hard, taking this particular picture not at all. I just asked her if I could take a picture of her eye and I was allowed to take just <b>one</b>. I was amazed by the light and quality myself. A large format copy hangs already on our wall.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-15 05:53:07.</i></td>', 'Thanx for all your votes and kind remarks on this image, making it the 12th place in this superb contest. I''m very, very happy with the outcome.I''m also happy to see that my G3 is capable to make great, SLR-like shots right out of the camera. Thanx again.  @Kiwi: that''s somehow true and somehow not: to get our little one in front of the camera is often very hard, taking this particular picture not at all. I just asked her if I could take a picture of her eye and I was allowed to take just one. I was amazed by the light and quality myself. A large format copy hangs already on our wall.', '2004-01-15 03:15:16.000000', '2004-01-15 05:53:07.000000', 0),
(544241, 52988, 10437, '<td valign="top">Oh, I know now!!!!!<br/>I wondered and wondered but didn''t wonder about the voting, was one of my 10''s<br/> <br/>Very creative, as usual<br/>If you add all the light bulbs, paint, props etc, phototography is a very expensive hobby indeed LOL</td>', 'Oh, I know now!!!!!I wondered and wondered but didn''t wonder about the voting, was one of my 10''s Very creative, as usualIf you add all the light bulbs, paint, props etc, phototography is a very expensive hobby indeed LOL', '2004-01-15 03:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(544242, 52122, 10437, '<td valign="top">A masterpiece, indeed!!<br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'A masterpiece, indeed!!Congratulations!', '2004-01-15 03:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(544244, 52988, 5728, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bela45:</b></div><hr/><i>If you add all the light bulbs, paint, props etc, phototography is a very expensive hobby indeed LOL</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Very true! Not to mention the camera and all the lenses etc. I am permanently broke!</td>', 'Originally posted by Bela45:If you add all the light bulbs, paint, props etc, phototography is a very expensive hobby indeed LOL  Very true! Not to mention the camera and all the lenses etc. I am permanently broke!', '2004-01-15 03:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(544252, 52985, 2553, '<td valign="top">Heartfelt Congratulations, Ursula!  This is a stunning piece of work!</td>', 'Heartfelt Congratulations, Ursula!  This is a stunning piece of work!', '2004-01-15 04:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(544253, 52122, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice. I was taking a look at your orginal and wwooowww. That is the best postprocessing I ever seen here on DPC.</td>', 'Nice. I was taking a look at your orginal and wwooowww. That is the best postprocessing I ever seen here on DPC.', '2004-01-15 04:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(544255, 52988, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great creativity Gary. hope you didn''t cut yourself when taking the bulbs apart. Did you use full voltage, i.e. 220V, or did you use a dimmer? How long does it take between switching on the lamp and before is burned out?.<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Great creativity Gary. hope you didn''t cut yourself when taking the bulbs apart. Did you use full voltage, i.e. 220V, or did you use a dimmer? How long does it take between switching on the lamp and before is burned out?. Jörg', '2004-01-15 05:08:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(544266, 52122, 2716, '<td valign="top">Congrats Crab!  very nice image.</td>', 'Congrats Crab!  very nice image.', '2004-01-15 05:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(544267, 52353, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot Matt. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Great shot Matt. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2004-01-15 05:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(544268, 52985, 2716, '<td valign="top">Way to go Ursula!  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Way to go Ursula!  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2004-01-15 05:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(544269, 52835, 2716, '<td valign="top">Bro!  So close, yet so far!  Wonderful image.  Nice placing.</td>', 'Bro!  So close, yet so far!  Wonderful image.  Nice placing.', '2004-01-15 05:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(544296, 52835, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, congrats on the green ribbon!</td>', 'Cool photo, congrats on the green ribbon!', '2004-01-15 06:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(544307, 52398, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is beautiful. Good job. The crop makes it look like you used a 8mm wide angle lens. I like the crop better on the other picture.</td>', 'Wow. This is beautiful. Good job. The crop makes it look like you used a 8mm wide angle lens. I like the crop better on the other picture.', '2004-01-15 06:36:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(544316, 52985, 10437, '<td valign="top">Finally, Ursula<br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Finally, UrsulaCongratulations!', '2004-01-15 06:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(544317, 52122, 772, '<td valign="top">Danny,<br/> <br/>Congrats on the blue ribbon for this challenge :)  I think winning this challenge is a major accomplishment.  You were up against a lot of good photos and the photographers had a lot more time to prepare for this one.  The uniqueness of this bird and your talent with the camera have certainly come together well in this image.  I look forward to seeing a lot more of your stuff on the front page this year :)</td>', 'Danny, Congrats on the blue ribbon for this challenge :)  I think winning this challenge is a major accomplishment.  You were up against a lot of good photos and the photographers had a lot more time to prepare for this one.  The uniqueness of this bird and your talent with the camera have certainly come together well in this image.  I look forward to seeing a lot more of your stuff on the front page this year :)', '2004-01-15 06:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(544321, 52483, 772, '<td valign="top">Tim, this is an excellent photo.  I really hoped to see this one do better overall.  The image has a nice ''plot'' and it just feels good :)  Excellent work as usual.</td>', 'Tim, this is an excellent photo.  I really hoped to see this one do better overall.  The image has a nice ''plot'' and it just feels good :)  Excellent work as usual.', '2004-01-15 06:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(544325, 51867, 772, '<td valign="top">Good morning Moody :)<br/> <br/>Someone got robbed and, unfortunately, it was you :(  You are getting really good with the toning.  When I first saw this photo, it reminded me of some of the ''richness'' I have seen from some of the low ISO b/w films.  I think the richness of the tones in this image almost contradict the bite of the frost.  It''s definitely an interesting juxtaposition.  Excellent work :)</td>', 'Good morning Moody :) Someone got robbed and, unfortunately, it was you :(  You are getting really good with the toning.  When I first saw this photo, it reminded me of some of the ''richness'' I have seen from some of the low ISO b/w films.  I think the richness of the tones in this image almost contradict the bite of the frost.  It''s definitely an interesting juxtaposition.  Excellent work :)', '2004-01-15 06:57:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(544329, 52424, 772, '<td valign="top">Mona, this is a very well executed black and white.. Great shot :)</td>', 'Mona, this is a very well executed black and white.. Great shot :)', '2004-01-15 06:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(544332, 52067, 772, '<td valign="top">DG, this is a very nice shot.  It was one of my top favorites in the challenge.  I bet this would make an interesting black and white as well :)</td>', 'DG, this is a very nice shot.  It was one of my top favorites in the challenge.  I bet this would make an interesting black and white as well :)', '2004-01-15 07:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(544336, 52707, 772, '<td valign="top">Joshua... very nice action capture here... It''s also good to see you posting to DPC again.. I was wondering where you had been :)</td>', 'Joshua... very nice action capture here... It''s also good to see you posting to DPC again.. I was wondering where you had been :)', '2004-01-15 07:03:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(544339, 52122, 6458, '<td valign="top">Great job crab!  It looks like I was right - we ribboned after all.  Congratulations on well deserved win!</td>', 'Great job crab!  It looks like I was right - we ribboned after all.  Congratulations on well deserved win!', '2004-01-15 07:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(544357, 52122, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great job Danny! Excellent post processing!!</td>', 'Great job Danny! Excellent post processing!!', '2004-01-15 07:23:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(544358, 52985, 4482, '<td valign="top">Woohoo Ursula!! This one is awsome!!!</td>', 'Woohoo Ursula!! This one is awsome!!!', '2004-01-15 07:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(544361, 52122, 2344, '<td valign="top">Awesome job crab! A well deserved win for sure!</td>', 'Awesome job crab! A well deserved win for sure!', '2004-01-15 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(544363, 52545, 8125, '<td valign="top">Congrats John, a great finish!  An awesome picture as well...  I love your bird series.  :-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats John, a great finish!  An awesome picture as well...  I love your bird series.  :-) ', '2004-01-15 07:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(544365, 52353, 6458, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone! <br/> <br/>This is a nice suprise! I thought for sure it wouldn''t ribbon, there were so many good shots in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Well, thanks go out to all who made this possible - my grandparents for having the forsight to move to an extremely photogenic location, mother nature for coming up with a most incredible sunset, my parents for giving me a wide angle converter for Christmas, and, of course, the voters! Yay! Go Voters!</td>', 'Thanks everyone!  This is a nice suprise! I thought for sure it wouldn''t ribbon, there were so many good shots in this challenge.  Well, thanks go out to all who made this possible - my grandparents for having the forsight to move to an extremely photogenic location, mother nature for coming up with a most incredible sunset, my parents for giving me a wide angle converter for Christmas, and, of course, the voters! Yay! Go Voters!', '2004-01-15 07:29:39.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(544371, 52122, 8159, '<td valign="top">Danny.... congrats on your 4th blue ribbon... a great accomplishment, especially in this challenge! Outstanding post-shot editing as well. Wow!</td>', 'Danny.... congrats on your 4th blue ribbon... a great accomplishment, especially in this challenge! Outstanding post-shot editing as well. Wow!', '2004-01-15 07:33:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(544388, 53009, 9295, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Christmas card! His rosy cheeks and feet are such a compliment to his bright red jammies and the tree and presents add a nice Victorian feel to the shot.  You might not have a ribbon for this photograph, but you have here something far more valuable. This is a priceless memory to be framed and cherished for years to come. I wish I had such a portrait of my own children.</td>', 'This looks like a Christmas card! His rosy cheeks and feet are such a compliment to his bright red jammies and the tree and presents add a nice Victorian feel to the shot.  You might not have a ribbon for this photograph, but you have here something far more valuable. This is a priceless memory to be framed and cherished for years to come. I wish I had such a portrait of my own children.', '2004-01-15 07:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(544396, 52988, 5728, '<td valign="top">I used a diamond cutter to cut the glass off at the base, so there was no chance of cutting myself. I used the full 220V and you have about quarter to half a second to take the photo.<br/> <br/>The idea about the dimmer isn''t bad Jörg! Maybe that way I can get the brightness of the burning wire down a bit. I would ideally love to do this again so that you can see the wire glowing red, and I think a dimmer might just do the trick. Thanks for the tip :)</td>', 'I used a diamond cutter to cut the glass off at the base, so there was no chance of cutting myself. I used the full 220V and you have about quarter to half a second to take the photo. The idea about the dimmer isn''t bad Jörg! Maybe that way I can get the brightness of the burning wire down a bit. I would ideally love to do this again so that you can see the wire glowing red, and I think a dimmer might just do the trick. Thanks for the tip :)', '2004-01-15 08:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(544399, 52988, 10858, '<td valign="top">Congrats Gary, this is a great one! :-) You are soo curious and you make such amazing stuff that noone else. :-)</td>', 'Congrats Gary, this is a great one! :-) You are soo curious and you make such amazing stuff that noone else. :-)', '2004-01-15 08:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(544400, 52122, 10858, '<td valign="top">Congrats Danny, this was one of my tens! :-) Way to go! :-)</td>', 'Congrats Danny, this was one of my tens! :-) Way to go! :-)', '2004-01-15 08:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(544401, 52988, 15407, '<td valign="top">What a great way to learn more about our art!</td>', 'What a great way to learn more about our art!', '2004-01-15 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(544405, 52122, 92, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a WELL deserved win. This being a open challenge and photos taken from around the world. Most having more time to spend on the challenge than you have...more so lately. This is saying alot about your talent !  This is a amazing, awesome photo.</td>', 'Congrats on a WELL deserved win. This being a open challenge and photos taken from around the world. Most having more time to spend on the challenge than you have...more so lately. This is saying alot about your talent !  This is a amazing, awesome photo.', '2004-01-15 08:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(544407, 52122, 806, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Beautiful job! The post-processing is perfect too.. although I only knew it because you mentioned it. Bravo!</td>', 'Congrats! Beautiful job! The post-processing is perfect too.. although I only knew it because you mentioned it. Bravo!', '2004-01-15 08:20:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(544408, 49898, 806, '<td valign="top">gorgeous portrait! wow Jacko! this will be forever treasured!</td>', 'gorgeous portrait! wow Jacko! this will be forever treasured!', '2004-01-15 08:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(544414, 49486, 9906, '<td valign="top">I knew if I guesed on both of the Chicago shots that I''d get it right on one of them (wink).  Nice shot pits.  I gotta make the drive to the Windy City...<br/>TC</td>', 'I knew if I guesed on both of the Chicago shots that I''d get it right on one of them (wink).  Nice shot pits.  I gotta make the drive to the Windy City...TC', '2004-01-15 08:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(544425, 52122, 6624, '<td valign="top">Congratulations - a big blue!  well deserved and well titled</td>', 'Congratulations - a big blue!  well deserved and well titled', '2004-01-15 08:55:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(544428, 52985, 5112, '<td valign="top">Thank you, all, for the kind words.<br/> <br/>Echoing Matt''s words, there were so many good pictures in the challenge, I didn''t think this would come in the top 3.  Thank you again.<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'Thank you, all, for the kind words. Echoing Matt''s words, there were so many good pictures in the challenge, I didn''t think this would come in the top 3.  Thank you again. Ursula', '2004-01-15 08:57:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(544429, 52353, 6624, '<td valign="top">beautiful image and congratulations for the red ribbon<br/></td>', 'beautiful image and congratulations for the red ribbon', '2004-01-15 08:58:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(544430, 52835, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  You beat your brother (again :))  Do you guys have a competition going?  <br/> <br/>Beautiful picture, this one.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations!  You beat your brother (again :))  Do you guys have a competition going?   Beautiful picture, this one. ', '2004-01-15 08:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(544431, 52985, 6624, '<td valign="top">absolute beauty, congratulations.</td>', 'absolute beauty, congratulations.', '2004-01-15 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(544432, 53038, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Terry, wonderful picture.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Beautiful, Terry, wonderful picture.  Congratulations!', '2004-01-15 09:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(544433, 52563, 5112, '<td valign="top">Your best finish (so far)!!!  Excellent.  This is a lovely picture, I really like the little star by the drop.</td>', 'Your best finish (so far)!!!  Excellent.  This is a lovely picture, I really like the little star by the drop.', '2004-01-15 09:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(544436, 49898, 5112, '<td valign="top">You know, I keep pictures like this one of my kids so I can blackmail them in the future :)))  Or, show them to their future spouses.  (Or both :))))</td>', 'You know, I keep pictures like this one of my kids so I can blackmail them in the future :)))  Or, show them to their future spouses.  (Or both :))))', '2004-01-15 09:02:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(544437, 52311, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, SG, good job!</td>', 'Congratulations, SG, good job!', '2004-01-15 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(544439, 52577, 6624, '<td valign="top">stunning image, the light and the skin are fine and the eyes are gorgeous...I never finished voting on this challenge as I kept thinking I had more time congratulations</td>', 'stunning image, the light and the skin are fine and the eyes are gorgeous...I never finished voting on this challenge as I kept thinking I had more time congratulations', '2004-01-15 09:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(544440, 52577, 5112, '<td valign="top">This was one of my two favourites this challenge.  I love the clarity, and the fact that you didn''t make the skin look plastic, as it''s so common now.  I love the reflected window.  And no makeup, love it.</td>', 'This was one of my two favourites this challenge.  I love the clarity, and the fact that you didn''t make the skin look plastic, as it''s so common now.  I love the reflected window.  And no makeup, love it.', '2004-01-15 09:05:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(544443, 52988, 5112, '<td valign="top">You should teach Science, not English.  A diamond cutter, I wonder if a Dremmel tool (sp?) would work.  Did you try different kinds of lightbulbs? (e.g. 60V, 100V).  That likely would not make a noticeable difference.</td>', 'You should teach Science, not English.  A diamond cutter, I wonder if a Dremmel tool (sp?) would work.  Did you try different kinds of lightbulbs? (e.g. 60V, 100V).  That likely would not make a noticeable difference.', '2004-01-15 09:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(544445, 52445, 6624, '<td valign="top">Mimosa, taken in a greenhouse, straight up to the ceiling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-15 17:20:27.</i></td>', 'Mimosa, taken in a greenhouse, straight up to the ceiling', '2004-01-15 09:10:19.000000', '2004-01-15 17:20:27.000000', 0),
(544446, 52413, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Congratulations.  I guess you''re going to enjoy the Rebel.<br/> <br/>Why "Maddux"?  (Reminds me of Greg Maddux, the ex-Cubs pitcher for the Braves).</td>', 'Beautiful!  Congratulations.  I guess you''re going to enjoy the Rebel. Why "Maddux"?  (Reminds me of Greg Maddux, the ex-Cubs pitcher for the Braves).', '2004-01-15 09:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(544450, 52525, 5112, '<td valign="top">I thought this one might be yours, Sonya.  It was one of my two favourites.  I really like this one.</td>', 'I thought this one might be yours, Sonya.  It was one of my two favourites.  I really like this one.', '2004-01-15 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(544453, 53093, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, mag, I kinda wondered if it was your picture.  I agree with kiwi, it should have done way better.</td>', 'Beautiful, mag, I kinda wondered if it was your picture.  I agree with kiwi, it should have done way better.', '2004-01-15 09:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(544456, 52122, 11897, '<td valign="top">A brilliant shot, well deserved win,some very good processing too.</td>', 'A brilliant shot, well deserved win,some very good processing too.', '2004-01-15 09:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(544457, 53073, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Talya, I like it very much both in colour and in b/w.  I thought it would be much higher in the challenge.  Should be.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, Talya, I like it very much both in colour and in b/w.  I thought it would be much higher in the challenge.  Should be.', '2004-01-15 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(544458, 52398, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, Paul, you done good!  (I''m trying to speak in slang).</td>', 'Hey, Paul, you done good!  (I''m trying to speak in slang).', '2004-01-15 09:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(544459, 53003, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good looking girls you have.  Do they always get along well?  I betcha they''re going to treasure this pict when they''re older and have their own kids.<br/> <br/>edit:  I didn''t read your notes before commenting - I guess that answers my question :)))  btw, I like the border.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-15 09:19:47.</i></td>', 'Nice!  Good looking girls you have.  Do they always get along well?  I betcha they''re going to treasure this pict when they''re older and have their own kids. edit:  I didn''t read your notes before commenting - I guess that answers my question :)))  btw, I like the border.', '2004-01-15 09:18:42.000000', '2004-01-15 09:19:47.000000', 0),
(544462, 52985, 7504, '<td valign="top">Yeah for you!  Your daughter was right after all, you WERE going to win!  Very beautiful shot, congrats.</td>', 'Yeah for you!  Your daughter was right after all, you WERE going to win!  Very beautiful shot, congrats.', '2004-01-15 09:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(544465, 53073, 3102, '<td valign="top">You went to Hawaii?  Where are the rest of the pix!?!  :)</td>', 'You went to Hawaii?  Where are the rest of the pix!?!  :)', '2004-01-15 09:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(544495, 50767, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good subject, well captured...perhaps a change in the angle of shot would have made it a winner for you.</td>', 'Good subject, well captured...perhaps a change in the angle of shot would have made it a winner for you.', '2004-01-15 09:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(544514, 52445, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What kind of flower is that?  I like the "x" shape.</td>', 'Wow!  What kind of flower is that?  I like the "x" shape.', '2004-01-15 09:52:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(544544, 52353, 7263, '<td valign="top">stunning, pure stunning. Suprised this didn''t place 1st. One of the best on DPC ever.<br/></td>', 'stunning, pure stunning. Suprised this didn''t place 1st. One of the best on DPC ever.', '2004-01-15 10:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(544568, 52985, 14603, '<td valign="top">So glad to see that your pic got placed..one of the few winners that I have managed to pick..If this hadn`t made it..I was going to give up :-)<br/> <br/>Congratulations,<br/>Gordon</td>', 'So glad to see that your pic got placed..one of the few winners that I have managed to pick..If this hadn`t made it..I was going to give up :-) Congratulations,Gordon', '2004-01-15 10:26:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(544574, 52577, 2780, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/> <br/>I thought this was a great photo, one of my 10s. There isnt really much negative I can say in this CC. The DoF in my opinion is perfect. The skin tones, lighting, focus, all perfect. I think one thing I may have tried differently is to have made the catchlight in the eyes smaller. You oculd have done this by either using a different light source, or in postprocessing. At the moment the window in the eye looks a little too big and it overpowers the pupil. There are also a few stray eyebrow hairs going down towards the eye. Now, this are extremely minor things, and if the rest of the photo wasn''t so perfect, then I wouldnt be mentioning them, but you''ve done 15 CC comments in the past week so I think you deserve a constructive one yourself :) <br/> <br/>Well, I can''t think of anything else to say, except congratulations on a fine photograph.</td>', 'Critique Club: I thought this was a great photo, one of my 10s. There isnt really much negative I can say in this CC. The DoF in my opinion is perfect. The skin tones, lighting, focus, all perfect. I think one thing I may have tried differently is to have made the catchlight in the eyes smaller. You oculd have done this by either using a different light source, or in postprocessing. At the moment the window in the eye looks a little too big and it overpowers the pupil. There are also a few stray eyebrow hairs going down towards the eye. Now, this are extremely minor things, and if the rest of the photo wasn''t so perfect, then I wouldnt be mentioning them, but you''ve done 15 CC comments in the past week so I think you deserve a constructive one yourself :)  Well, I can''t think of anything else to say, except congratulations on a fine photograph.', '2004-01-15 10:36:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(544576, 52122, 472, '<td valign="top">dude!! you did it !! woohoo!!! congrats man :)</td>', 'dude!! you did it !! woohoo!!! congrats man :)', '2004-01-15 10:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(544578, 52353, 472, '<td valign="top">yay matt!! I LOOOOVE this picture.  I want to BE THERE.  congratulations bud :).</td>', 'yay matt!! I LOOOOVE this picture.  I want to BE THERE.  congratulations bud :).', '2004-01-15 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(544579, 52985, 472, '<td valign="top">gorgeous ursula.  congratulations :)</td>', 'gorgeous ursula.  congratulations :)', '2004-01-15 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
