(547282, 53071, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very good shot of our beautiful City Hall area. I like it a lot. I know how hard it is to get this shot without any major glares. There are so many lights there during winter.<br/> <br/>The colours in your shot are amazing. You managed to avoid the greenish cast the lights from the arches normally make. I like that you included the people in your photo, as it makes it come alive.<br/> <br/>I also visited your website. So nice to see many great photos of our wonderful city. Thank you for sharing them. I''ll be checking for updates so keep it up.</td>', 'Very good shot of our beautiful City Hall area. I like it a lot. I know how hard it is to get this shot without any major glares. There are so many lights there during winter. The colours in your shot are amazing. You managed to avoid the greenish cast the lights from the arches normally make. I like that you included the people in your photo, as it makes it come alive. I also visited your website. So nice to see many great photos of our wonderful city. Thank you for sharing them. I''ll be checking for updates so keep it up.', '2004-01-18 01:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
