(550087, 50518, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi JC :)<br/> <br/>This is an interesting abstract study in shape and color.  I''m finding it difficult to offer a lot of commentary on it.  The shape and color seem to be the high point of interest, but there is no particular point that draws me in to the composition.  What I DO find good about this shot is that you chose a non standard perspective to work with.  This is a good starting point for a lot of creative work :)<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi JC :) This is an interesting abstract study in shape and color.  I''m finding it difficult to offer a lot of commentary on it.  The shape and color seem to be the high point of interest, but there is no particular point that draws me in to the composition.  What I DO find good about this shot is that you chose a non standard perspective to work with.  This is a good starting point for a lot of creative work :) John Setzler', '2004-01-20 08:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
