(550643, 52511, 15968, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo, but the title you gave it is pretty off the mark.  You don''t <i>love</i> a ball.  One doesn''t set a ball <i>free</i>!  You could have called it, "The Sun and Stars."  Or left it untitled Im thinking even... oh well, a nice photo.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo, but the title you gave it is pretty off the mark.  You don''t love a ball.  One doesn''t set a ball free!  You could have called it, "The Sun and Stars."  Or left it untitled Im thinking even... oh well, a nice photo.', '2004-01-20 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(550661, 51775, 15968, '<td valign="top">In a sea of photographs of tall buildings against the sky, this one is exceptional, and deserves a far higher rate than 5.8.  Trust me!  <br/> <br/>You needed a better name than "Silver Lining," or no name (shucks none comes to me).  Excellent though.  Wonderful, that perfect reflection of blue that runs down the thin strip of the building.  The blunt wedge of the building has a strong abstract appeal to my eye too.  Maybe, had I been so alert as to take this photograph, Id call it "Razor."</td>', 'In a sea of photographs of tall buildings against the sky, this one is exceptional, and deserves a far higher rate than 5.8.  Trust me!   You needed a better name than "Silver Lining," or no name (shucks none comes to me).  Excellent though.  Wonderful, that perfect reflection of blue that runs down the thin strip of the building.  The blunt wedge of the building has a strong abstract appeal to my eye too.  Maybe, had I been so alert as to take this photograph, Id call it "Razor."', '2004-01-20 16:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
