(555549, 53073, 7628, '<td valign="top">Talya,  Just stumbled across this - I missed the december free study and haven''t seen them.  This is a fabulous capture - such a true moment, great emotion, nice composition - I love her wavy hair flying all over.  I too am surprised it didn''t get more than a 6.  I''d say at least 9! Good work.<br/></td>', 'Talya,  Just stumbled across this - I missed the december free study and haven''t seen them.  This is a fabulous capture - such a true moment, great emotion, nice composition - I love her wavy hair flying all over.  I too am surprised it didn''t get more than a 6.  I''d say at least 9! Good work.', '2004-01-24 17:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(562821, 51927, 6999, '<td valign="top">Staggeringly poor score here, but I think your own post-challenge comment is correct. Likewise I''d like to re-inforce what JJ says.<br/> <br/>To add to my earlier comment, I meant to say that I appreciate compositionally the almost perfectt banding into the ''thirds'' lines image right ... it was more a question of weight, really. That''s what lost you the one point from me that would have given you a ten otherwise.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'Staggeringly poor score here, but I think your own post-challenge comment is correct. Likewise I''d like to re-inforce what JJ says. To add to my earlier comment, I meant to say that I appreciate compositionally the almost perfectt banding into the ''thirds'' lines image right ... it was more a question of weight, really. That''s what lost you the one point from me that would have given you a ten otherwise. Ed', '2004-01-30 05:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
